	["Parchment Style"] = "羊皮纸样式", -- draft
	["How the parchment looks wherever it shows: the sheets switched on below, and the quest log, quest and spell book pages. Burnt paper: warm paper with burnt edges, big pages with curled corners. Classic vellum: the vellum with painted brush-stroke edges from before 0.20.1."] = "羊皮纸在各处的样子：下方开启的纸张，以及任务日志、任务和法术书页面。焦纸：带焦边的暖色纸，大页面有卷角。经典牛皮纸：0.20.1之前带手绘笔触边缘的牛皮纸。", -- draft
	["Burnt paper"] = "焦纸", -- draft
	["Classic vellum"] = "经典牛皮纸", -- draft
	["Windows Fade In"] = "窗口淡入", -- draft
	["Every window fades in over a fifth of a second when it opens, instead of appearing at once: the character window, talents and spells, professions, the bags, social, guild, group finder, collections, the map, the game menu and the rest. Works with the reskin on or off. Reduce Motion: at once."] = "每个窗口打开时用五分之一秒淡入，而不是一下子出现：角色窗口、天赋和法术、专业、背包、社交、公会、队伍查找器、藏品、地图、游戏菜单等。换肤开启或关闭都可用。减少动态效果：立即出现。", -- draft
	["Reduce Motion"] = "减少动态效果", -- draft
	["Every MelloUI animation ends at once: windows open without fading, the whisper popup appears in place, the quest tracker's lines do not flash, the configurator jumps instead of gliding. For anyone who finds moving interface parts distracting. Works with UI Modifications switched off as well."] = "MelloUI的每个动画立即结束：窗口打开时不淡入，悄悄话弹窗原地出现，任务追踪器的行不闪烁，配置器直接跳转而不滑动。适合觉得界面动来动去会分心的人。界面修改关闭时同样有效。", -- draft
	["Show Names As"] = "名字显示方式", -- draft
	["How a character's name is written, everywhere at once: the player, target, focus, pet, party and raid frames, the nameplates, the chat and whisper windows, and the name over your own head (the game's own setting for it: only First name leaves out the surname there). A character with no surname shows the name it has; in the chat the name is still a link to the player. Names over other players' heads without a nameplate are the engine's and have no setting."] = "角色名字的写法，各处同时生效：玩家、目标、焦点、宠物、小队和团队框体、姓名板、聊天和悄悄话窗口，以及你自己头顶的名字（游戏自己的相关设置：只有“名”会在那里省略姓）。没有姓的角色显示它已有的名字；在聊天中名字仍是指向该玩家的链接。没有姓名板时其他玩家头顶的名字由引擎绘制，没有设置。", -- draft
	["Full name (Professor Skillybones)"] = "全名（Professor Skillybones）", -- draft
	["Initial and surname (P. Skillybones)"] = "首字母和姓（P. Skillybones）", -- draft
