	["Nameplate Tweaks"] = "姓名板调整", -- draft
	["On the game's nameplates: the large crowd-control icon above the name, the quest marker on enemies you still need, the threat line, the combo points on your target's plate, the names' form (Show Names As) and the soft shade behind the names (Name Shade). Off: all six go. Works with or without the reskin."] = "在游戏的姓名板上：名字上方的大号控制图标、你仍需要的敌人身上的任务标记、仇恨线、目标姓名板上的连击点数、名字形式（名字显示方式）以及名字后的柔和阴影（名字阴影）。关闭：六项全部消失。无论是否换肤都可用。", -- draft
