	["The menu buttons (character, spellbook, ...) and the bag buttons."] = "菜单按钮（角色、法术书……）和背包按钮。", -- draft
	["Minimap ring, zone text header, day/night indicator frame, tracking, calendar, zoom and addon buttons."] = "小地图圆环、区域名称标题、昼夜指示框、追踪、日历、缩放和插件按钮。", -- draft
	["Chat Frame"] = "聊天框", -- draft
	["Chat tabs, the chat input box and the chat buttons. Window background colours stay as configured in the chat settings."] = "聊天标签、聊天输入框和聊天按钮。窗口背景颜色保持聊天设置中的配置。", -- draft
	["Buffs & Debuffs"] = "增益和减益效果", -- draft
	["Darken the borders of your buff and debuff icons, with a thin dark edge round each icon (0.16.0: the Icon Border switch is part of this). The game's own icons: while Buffs & Debuffs shows MelloUI's rows in their place, there is nothing here to darken (those rows take the Aura Border)."] = "调暗你的增益和减益图标的边框，每个图标周围加一道细暗边（0.16.0：“图标边框”开关属于此项）。游戏自己的图标：当“增益和减益效果”用MelloUI的行代替它们时，这里没有要调暗的东西（那些行使用“光环边框”）。", -- draft
	["Keep Dispel Colours"] = "保留驱散颜色", -- draft
	["Leave the coloured magic / curse / poison / disease debuff borders untouched: on your buff and debuff icons (Buffs & Debuffs) and on the Cooldown Manager's icons (its Dark Mode)."] = "不改动魔法 / 诅咒 / 中毒 / 疾病减益的彩色边框：在你的增益和减益图标上（增益和减益效果）和冷却管理器的图标上（它的暗色模式）。", -- draft
	-- Fonts
	["Fonts"] = "字体", -- draft
	["One font per role: interface text, chat and numbers, titles, damage numbers; plus size and outline."] = "每种用途一种字体：界面文字、聊天和数字、标题、伤害数字；另加大小和描边。", -- draft
	["One font for all of Azeroth. Pick it, scale it, outline it."] = "一款字体贯穿整个艾泽拉斯。挑选、缩放、描边。", -- draft
	["Font Style"] = "字体风格", -- draft
	["A preset: choosing a style changes every font at once -- the titles, the interface text, the chat and numbers, the chat text and the chat on parchment, the sizes back to 100% (each face brings its own size correction) -- each pairing themed with readability first. Fine-tune any of them afterwards (the style then shows Custom). The damage numbers keep their own choice, but for Fredoka's: one face for everything.\nFredoka: MelloUI's own face: Fredoka's round letters for the titles, the text and the damage numbers, to fit MelloUI's icons. The default.\nScriptorium: Cinzel's carved capitals over Alegreya, a warm book face.\nChronicle: Alegreya SC's small capitals over Source Serif 4, the most readable serif.\nOld Tome: IM Fell English's aged print over Spectral.\nWarband: Pirata One's blackletter over Crimson Pro SemiBold: the boldest look.\nClarity: Cinzel titles, Noto Sans everywhere else: the easiest to read at small sizes.\nGothic: Enchanted Land's gothic titles kept, over Alegreya."] = "预设：选择一种风格会一次改变所有字体——标题、界面文字、聊天和数字、聊天文字和羊皮纸上的聊天，大小恢复到100%（每种字体自带大小校正）——每套搭配都以可读性为先。之后可以微调任意一项（风格随后显示“自定义”）。伤害数字保留自己的选择，Fredoka除外：一种字体用于全部。\nFredoka：MelloUI自己的字体：Fredoka的圆润字母用于标题、文字和伤害数字，与MelloUI的图标相配。默认。\nScriptorium：Cinzel的雕刻大写搭配Alegreya，一种温暖的书籍字体。\nChronicle：Alegreya SC的小型大写搭配Source Serif 4，最易读的衬线体。\nOld Tome：IM Fell English的旧式印刷搭配Spectral。\nWarband：Pirata One的哥特黑体搭配Crimson Pro SemiBold：最醒目的外观。\nClarity：Cinzel标题，其余全部Noto Sans：小字号下最易读。\nGothic：保留Enchanted Land的哥特标题，搭配Alegreya。", -- draft
	["preset: changes every font at once"] = "预设：一次改变所有字体", -- draft
	["Custom"] = "自定义", -- draft
	["Fredoka"] = "Fredoka", -- draft
	["Scriptorium"] = "Scriptorium", -- draft
	["Chronicle"] = "Chronicle", -- draft
	["Old Tome"] = "Old Tome", -- draft
	["Warband"] = "Warband", -- draft
	["Clarity"] = "Clarity", -- draft
	["Gothic"] = "Gothic", -- draft
	["Interface text (Friz Quadrata)"] = "界面文字（Friz Quadrata）", -- draft
	["Window text, buttons, tooltips, the quest log, nameplate names and the names above characters in the world (those after /reload)."] = "窗口文字、按钮、鼠标提示、任务日志、姓名板名字以及世界中角色头顶的名字（这些在/reload后）。", -- draft
	["Keep the game's"] = "保留游戏的", -- draft
	["Friz Quadrata (default)"] = "Friz Quadrata（默认）", -- draft
	["Chat & numbers (Arial Narrow)"] = "聊天和数字（Arial Narrow）", -- draft
	["The numbers: cooldown counts, stack counts; and the chat windows while Chat text and Interface text both keep the game's. The value text on the unit frames' bars follows the Interface text, the hit numbers on the portraits the Game Numbers Font."] = "数字：冷却计数、堆叠数；以及当“聊天文字”和“界面文字”都保留游戏字体时的聊天窗口。单位框体条上的数值文字跟随“界面文字”，头像上的伤害数字跟随“游戏数字字体”。", -- draft
	["Titles & headers (Morpheus)"] = "标题和题头（Morpheus）", -- draft
	["Window titles, quest and item names in dialogs, mail and book text, and the kit's title plates and headers while the reskin is on. Enchanted Land unless you choose otherwise. Keep the game's leaves each string in the game's own face: Morpheus where the game uses it, the interface face on the strings that start in it (the Quest Tracker's headers, Combat Text's notices)."] = "窗口标题、对话中的任务和物品名称、邮件和书籍文字，以及换肤开启时套件的标题牌匾和题头。默认Enchanted Land，除非你另选。“保留游戏的”让每段文字使用游戏自己的字体：游戏使用Morpheus的地方用Morpheus，原本用界面字体的文字用界面字体（任务追踪器的标题、战斗文字的通知）。", -- draft
	["Game Numbers Font (Skurri)"] = "游戏数字字体（Skurri）", -- draft
	["The numbers over the enemies: the game's own (after /reload) and Your Damage's (at once); and the hit numbers on the unit frames' portraits. The game's text around you (Combat Text's Game style) and MelloUI's are drawn in the Interface text face."] = "敌人头上的数字：游戏自己的（/reload后）和“你的伤害”的（立即）；以及单位框体头像上的伤害数字。你周围的游戏文字（战斗文字的“游戏”风格）和MelloUI的文字使用“界面文字”字体绘制。", -- draft
	["Chat text"] = "聊天文字", -- draft
	["The chat windows' messages, the chat's input box and the whisper windows. The same face as the Interface text unless you choose otherwise (the Chat & numbers face while that is the game's), so the chat follows the Font Styles and your own choice of reading face. The size stays the chat's own (Chat & numbers size)."] = "聊天窗口的消息、聊天输入框和悄悄话窗口。默认与“界面文字”相同，除非你另选（当“聊天和数字”为游戏字体时用它），这样聊天会跟随字体风格和你自己选择的阅读字体。大小仍是聊天自己的（“聊天和数字”大小）。", -- draft
	["Same as Interface text"] = "与界面文字相同", -- draft
	["Chat on parchment"] = "羊皮纸上的聊天", -- draft
	["The chat windows and whisper windows while they lie on their parchment sheet (Oldschool > Parchment). By default the chat text's face in its semibold cut where it has one, heavier so the dark ink reads on the paper; each Font Style sets that cut of its reading face."] = "聊天窗口和悄悄话窗口铺在羊皮纸上时（Oldschool > 羊皮纸）。默认使用聊天文字字体的半粗体（如果有），更粗，让深色墨水在纸上易读；每种字体风格都会设置其阅读字体的这个字重。", -- draft
	["Chat text, semibold"] = "聊天文字，半粗体", -- draft
	["Size and outline"] = "大小和描边", -- draft
	["Interface text size"] = "界面文字大小", -- draft
	["Every font drawn with the interface face, relative to its normal size; a Font Style puts it back to 100% (its faces bring their own correction). Not the text with a size of its own: the Quest Tracker, Combat Text, the chat (Chat & numbers size), FPS / Latency, Cooldown Timers, and the bar values while their size is set."] = "使用界面字体绘制的每种文字，相对于其正常大小；字体风格会把它恢复到100%（它的字体自带校正）。不包括有自己大小的文字：任务追踪器、战斗文字、聊天（“聊天和数字”大小）、FPS / 延迟、冷却计时以及设置了大小的条数值。", -- draft
	["Chat & numbers size"] = "聊天和数字大小", -- draft
	["The chat windows (on top of the game's own chat font size) and every number."] = "聊天窗口（在游戏自己的聊天字体大小之上）和所有数字。", -- draft
	["Titles & headers size"] = "标题和题头大小", -- draft
	["Titles, headers, dialog names, mail and book text, and the kit's title face on the painted plates; a Font Style puts it back to 100% (its faces bring their own correction). Not the Quest Tracker's title and section headers or Combat Text's notices: they have sizes of their own."] = "标题、题头、对话名字、邮件和书籍文字，以及手绘牌匾上套件的标题字体；字体风格会把它恢复到100%（它的字体自带校正）。不包括任务追踪器的标题和分区题头，也不包括战斗文字的通知：它们有自己的大小。", -- draft
	["Chat on parchment size"] = "羊皮纸上的聊天大小", -- draft
	["The chat and whisper windows' text on their parchment sheet, relative to the chat's own size."] = "羊皮纸上聊天和悄悄话窗口的文字，相对于聊天自己的大小。", -- draft
	["Outline"] = "描边", -- draft
	["Force an outline on every light-coloured font. Dark text on parchment (quests, spellbook, dialogs) keeps its original look. MelloUI's own text in the world (notices, combat text, Gains lines) takes its outline from Notices: Outlined Text; this sets only how thick it is."] = "强制给每种浅色字体加描边。羊皮纸上的深色文字（任务、法术书、对话）保持原样。MelloUI在世界中的文字（通知、战斗文字、收获行）的描边取自“通知：描边文字”；这里只设置粗细。", -- draft
	["Keep original"] = "保持原样", -- draft
	["Thin outline"] = "细描边", -- draft
	["Thick outline"] = "粗描边", -- draft
	-- ClassIcons
	["Class Icons"] = "职业图标", -- draft
	["High resolution painted class medallions in place of the default class icons, and on player portraits."] = "高分辨率手绘职业徽章，取代默认职业图标，并用于玩家头像。", -- draft
	["Painted medallions for every class, on the character sheet and on every portrait."] = "每个职业的手绘徽章，用于角色面板和每个头像。", -- draft
	["The painted class medallions in place of the game's class icons and on player portraits."] = "手绘职业徽章取代游戏的职业图标，并用于玩家头像。", -- draft
	["Player Portraits"] = "玩家头像", -- draft
	["Replace player portraits (yourself, target, focus, party) with the player's class medallion. NPC portraits are never touched."] = "用玩家的职业徽章替换玩家头像（你自己、目标、焦点、小队）。NPC头像永远不变。", -- draft
	-- BarTextures
	["Change the fill texture of health, power, nameplate, experience, reputation, honor and cast bars."] = "更改生命条、能量条、姓名板、经验条、声望条、荣誉条和施法条的填充材质。", -- draft
	["Health and mana bars in the finish you like: flat, smooth, glossy or minimalist."] = "你喜欢的生命条和法力条质感：扁平、平滑、光泽或极简。", -- draft
	["Texture"] = "材质", -- draft
	["Bar Texture"] = "条材质", -- draft
	["Fill texture for every bar whose own Bar Texture is Shared (each sits with its bars, on their own page). Custom files go into MelloUI\\Media\\Textures and are listed in Media\\CustomTextures.lua."] = "每个自身“条材质”为“共享”的条的填充材质（每项都和它的条在同一页面上）。自定义文件放进MelloUI\\Media\\Textures，并列在Media\\CustomTextures.lua中。", -- draft
	["Default (Blizzard)"] = "默认（暴雪）", -- draft
	["Flat"] = "扁平", -- draft
	["Smooth"] = "平滑", -- draft
	["Gloss"] = "光泽", -- draft
	["Minimalist"] = "极简", -- draft
	["Blizzard Classic"] = "Blizzard Classic", -- draft
	["Blizzard Raid"] = "Blizzard Raid", -- draft
	["Health Bar Colour"] = "生命条颜色", -- draft
	["Colour of the health bars: the unit frames', the nameplates' and your party and raid frames' (Group Frames). Blizzard bakes the green into its artwork, so the module has to colour flat textures itself. By health shades the bar from your full health colour through the half one to the low one, and keeps doing so in combat. My Colour is one colour of yours. An NPC's nameplate keeps the game's own colour (its reaction and threat) with every choice but By health. On the party and raid frames Class and Class / reaction are the class colour."] = "生命条的颜色：单位框体的、姓名板的以及你的小队和团队框体的（小队框体）。暴雪把绿色烘焙进美术里，所以模块必须自己为扁平材质上色。“按生命值”让条从你的满血颜色经过半血颜色渐变到低血颜色，战斗中也持续生效。“我的颜色”是你的一种颜色。NPC的姓名板在除“按生命值”外的所有选项下保留游戏自己的颜色（阵营关系和仇恨）。在小队和团队框体上，“职业”和“职业 / 关系”都是职业颜色。", -- draft
	["Green (Blizzard)"] = "绿色（暴雪）", -- draft
	["Class colour for players"] = "玩家使用职业颜色", -- draft
	["Class (players) / reaction (NPCs)"] = "职业 / 关系（NPC）", -- draft
	["By health (your three colours)"] = "按生命值（你的三种颜色）", -- draft
	["My Colour"] = "我的颜色", -- draft
	["My Health Colour"] = "我的生命颜色", -- draft
	["The health bars' colour with My Colour."] = "选择“我的颜色”时生命条的颜色。", -- draft
	["Full Health Colour"] = "满血颜色", -- draft
	["By health: the colour at full health."] = "按生命值：满血时的颜色。", -- draft
	["Half Health Colour"] = "半血颜色", -- draft
	["By health: the colour at half health."] = "按生命值：半血时的颜色。", -- draft
	["Low Health Colour"] = "低血颜色", -- draft
	["By health: the colour near death."] = "按生命值：濒死时的颜色。", -- draft
	["Colour Overrides Threat"] = "颜色优先于仇恨", -- draft
	["The chosen health bar colour wins over the game's own recolouring of health bars (the aggro / threat display on nameplates and unit frames): whenever the game sets its colour, yours is put back. Off: the game's threat colours show."] = "所选的生命条颜色胜过游戏自己对生命条的重新着色（姓名板和单位框体上的仇恨 / 威胁显示）：每当游戏设置它的颜色，你的颜色就会被放回去。关闭：显示游戏的仇恨颜色。", -- draft
	["Execute Range"] = "斩杀范围", -- draft
	["An enemy's health bar turns purple once its health is below the percentage set here, on the target, focus, target-of-target and boss frames and on nameplates, so you see when finishing moves can be used. Works in combat, when the game hides the exact health, and with every health bar colour."] = "敌人的生命值低于此处设定的百分比时，它的生命条变成紫色，作用于目标、焦点、目标的目标和首领框体以及姓名板，让你看出何时可以使用终结技。在战斗中、游戏隐藏确切生命值时以及任何生命条颜色下都有效。", -- draft
	["Execute Below"] = "斩杀阈值", -- draft
	["The health percentage under which the bar turns purple (20% for most execute abilities, 35% for some)."] = "生命条变紫的生命百分比（大多数斩杀技能为20%，部分为35%）。", -- draft
	["Apply To"] = "应用于", -- draft
	["The fill of the health and power bars of the player, target, focus, pet, party, boss and target-of-target frames: Shared (the Look page's Bar Texture), the game's own art, or a picture of their own."] = "玩家、目标、焦点、宠物、小队、首领和目标的目标框体的生命条和能量条填充：共享（“外观”页的条材质）、游戏自己的美术，或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["Shared (Look's Bar Texture)"] = "共享（外观）", -- draft
	["The game's"] = "游戏的", -- draft
	["Raid Frames"] = "团队框体", -- draft
	["The fill of MelloUI's party and raid frames and the game's raid-style frames: Shared (the Look page's Bar Texture), Plain (a flat fill; the game's own art on the game's frames), or a picture of their own."] = "MelloUI的小队和团队框体以及游戏的团队样式框体的填充：共享（“外观”页的条材质）、纯色（扁平填充；游戏框体上用游戏自己的美术），或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["Plain"] = "纯色", -- draft
	["The fill of nameplate health and cast bars: Shared (the Look page's Bar Texture), the game's own art, or a picture of their own."] = "姓名板生命条和施法条的填充：共享（“外观”页的条材质）、游戏自己的美术，或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["The fill of the Personal Display's health, power and shield bars under your character (and the game's own personal resource display while the Personal Display is off): Shared, Plain, or a picture of their own."] = "你角色下方个人显示的生命条、能量条和护盾条的填充（个人显示关闭时也包括游戏自己的个人资源显示）：共享、纯色，或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["The fill of the experience, reputation and honor bars, and the damage meter's race bar and Fight History's bars (Minimalist there on The game's): Shared, the game's own art, or a picture of their own."] = "经验条、声望条和荣誉条，以及伤害统计的竞速条和战斗历史的条的填充（选“游戏的”时那里为极简）：共享、游戏自己的美术，或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["The fill of the player, pet, target, focus and boss cast bars, and MelloUI's swing timers (Minimalist there on The game's): Shared, the game's own art, or a picture of their own."] = "玩家、宠物、目标、焦点和首领施法条以及MelloUI挥击计时条的填充（选“游戏的”时那里为极简）：共享、游戏自己的美术，或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["Cooldown Manager Bars"] = "冷却管理器的条", -- draft
	["The fill of the Buff Bar cooldown viewer's bars: Shared, the game's own art, or a picture of their own."] = "增益条冷却查看器的条填充：共享、游戏自己的美术，或它们自己的图片。", -- draft
	["Tooltip Health Bar"] = "鼠标提示生命条", -- draft
	["The fill of the health bar under a unit's tooltip (when Tooltip's Hide Health Bar is off): Shared, the game's own art, or a picture of its own."] = "单位鼠标提示下方生命条的填充（当鼠标提示的“隐藏生命条”关闭时）：共享、游戏自己的美术，或它自己的图片。", -- draft
	-- BarText
