	-- CooldownText
	["Cooldown Timers"] = "冷却计时", -- draft
	["Large countdown numbers on action bar cooldowns and nameplate auras, coloured by time left."] = "动作条冷却和姓名板光环上的大号倒计时数字，按剩余时间着色。", -- draft
	["Countdowns on every cooldown, coloured by how long you still have to wait."] = "每个冷却上的倒计时，按你还要等多久着色。", -- draft
	["Countdown numbers on action bar cooldowns and nameplate auras, coloured by the time left."] = "动作条冷却和姓名板光环上的倒计时数字，按剩余时间着色。", -- draft
	["Show On"] = "显示于", -- draft
	["Action, pet, stance and flyout buttons."] = "动作、宠物、姿态和弹出按钮。", -- draft
	["Nameplate Auras"] = "姓名板光环", -- draft
	["Buff, debuff and crowd control icons on nameplates. While Buffs & Debuffs puts your debuffs on enemy nameplates, those icons are MelloUI's own and show their own time: this switch does not reach them."] = "姓名板上的增益、减益和控制图标。当“增益和减益效果”把你的减益放到敌方姓名板上时，那些图标是MelloUI自己的，显示自己的时间：这个开关管不到它们。", -- draft
	["Timer"] = "计时", -- draft
	["Minimum Duration"] = "最短持续时间", -- draft
	["Cooldowns shorter than this show no text (2 s skips the global cooldown)."] = "短于此值的冷却不显示文字（2秒会跳过公共冷却）。", -- draft
	["Text Size"] = "文字大小", -- draft
	["Text height relative to the icon size."] = "文字高度相对图标大小。", -- draft
	["Show Tenths Below 5s"] = "5秒内显示十分位", -- draft
	["Show 4.3 instead of 5 when the cooldown is about to finish."] = "冷却快结束时显示4.3而不是5。", -- draft
	["Colour And Size By Time Left"] = "按剩余时间改变颜色和大小", -- draft
	["Red and larger under 5 s (1.3 times the Text Size), yellow under a minute, dim white and smaller for minutes (0.8 times), grey and smaller still for hours (0.75 times). Off: every timer is white at the Text Size."] = "5秒以内为红色且更大（文字大小的1.3倍），一分钟以内为黄色，以分钟计为暗白且更小（0.8倍），以小时计为灰色且再小一些（0.75倍）。关闭：所有计时均为白色，使用文字大小。", -- draft
	-- Tweaks
	["Tweaks"] = "调整", -- draft
	["Hide the micro menu and bag bar, and scale the floating combat text."] = "隐藏微型菜单和背包栏，并缩放浮动战斗文字。", -- draft
	["Small knobs with a big effect. Hide what you never click, scale what you never see."] = "小旋钮，大效果。隐藏你从不点的，放大你从没看清的。", -- draft
	["Hide Frames"] = "隐藏框体", -- draft
	["Hide Micro Menu"] = "隐藏微型菜单", -- draft
	["Hide the row of menu buttons (character, spellbook, talents, ...). Still shown while Edit Mode is open."] = "隐藏那一排菜单按钮（角色、法术书、天赋……）。编辑模式打开时仍显示。", -- draft
	["Hide Bag Bar"] = "隐藏背包栏", -- draft
	["Hide the backpack and bag slot buttons. Still shown while Edit Mode is open. Bags can still be opened with their keybinds."] = "隐藏行囊和背包栏位按钮。编辑模式打开时仍显示。背包仍可用快捷键打开。", -- draft
	["Hide Minimap Coordinates"] = "隐藏小地图坐标", -- draft
	["Hide the player coordinates the client writes under the minimap."] = "隐藏客户端写在小地图下方的玩家坐标。", -- draft
	["Bag Slots On Bag Window"] = "背包窗口上的背包栏位", -- draft
	["While the bag bar is hidden, show the bag slots under the open bag window so bags can still be equipped and removed. Works with and without the Combine Bags option."] = "背包栏隐藏时，在打开的背包窗口下方显示背包栏位，这样仍能装上和取下背包。开启或关闭“合并背包”选项都可用。", -- draft
	["Collapse Arrow"] = "折叠箭头", -- draft
	["An arrow beside the backpack folds the bag slots away so only the backpack shows; click it again to bring them back. While you hold an item they come out by themselves, so a new bag can be dropped into a slot. The game remembers which way you left it."] = "行囊旁的箭头可收起背包栏位，只显示行囊；再点一次即可展开。手里拿着物品时它们会自动出现，方便把新背包放进栏位。游戏会记住你最后的状态。", -- draft
	["Chat"] = "聊天", -- draft
	["Chat Notices"] = "聊天通知", -- draft
	["Lines MelloUI writes to chat on its own: a learned dungeon entrance, settings restored from the backup, hints. Replies to slash commands, and the notices you send to the chat (Send To Chat Instead), always show."] = "MelloUI自己写到聊天里的行：学到的地下城入口、从备份恢复的设置、提示。斜杠命令的回复以及你发送到聊天的通知（改为发送到聊天）总是显示。", -- draft
	["Notices"] = "通知", -- draft
	["On-screen Notices"] = "屏幕通知", -- draft
	["One short line in the upper third of the screen when MelloUI has news for you: a route set or finished, a service remembered, a dungeon's quests listed. It fades after a few seconds. Move it in Edit Layout."] = "当MelloUI有消息告诉你时，在屏幕上方三分之一处显示一行短文字：设定或完成了路线、记住了一个服务、列出了地下城的任务。几秒后淡出。可在“编辑布局”中移动。", -- draft
	["Send To Chat Instead"] = "改为发送到聊天", -- draft
	["Write these lines in the chat instead of showing them on the screen. They show there even while Chat Notices is off."] = "把这些行写进聊天，而不是显示在屏幕上。即使“聊天通知”关闭，它们也会显示在那里。", -- draft
	["Notice Sounds"] = "通知音效", -- draft
	["A short chime with each notice: the map's tracking sound for a new destination (left out while the World Marker's own sound plays for it), a softer one when you arrive."] = "每条通知伴随一声短促的提示音：新目的地用地图的追踪音效（世界标记自己的音效播放时省略），到达时一声更柔和的。", -- draft
	["Text Shade"] = "文字阴影", -- draft
	["A soft dark shade behind the text MelloUI shows on the world, so it reads on bright ground: the zone name when you enter a new area (with its subzone and PvP lines), the game's messages in the middle of the screen (red errors, yellow quest progress, raid warnings and boss emotes), the Route's World Marker, the names on the unit frames (yours, your pet's, your targets' targets' and the party's) and on the nameplates, and the channel tags and links on the chat's parchment. No outline on the zone name and the messages (Outlined Text adds it back); the game's colours stay. Off: the game's own look, and no shade behind any of them."] = "MelloUI显示在世界上的文字背后加一层柔和暗影，让它在明亮背景上也能看清：进入新区域时的区域名（及其子区域和PvP行）、屏幕中央的游戏消息（红色错误、黄色任务进度、团队警告和首领表情）、路线的世界标记、单位框体上的名字（你的、你宠物的、你目标的目标的和小队的）和姓名板上的名字，以及聊天羊皮纸上的频道标签和链接。区域名和消息不加描边（“描边文字”会加回来）；游戏的颜色保留。关闭：游戏自己的外观，它们背后都没有阴影。", -- draft
	["Outlined Text"] = "描边文字", -- draft
	["Draw the text MelloUI shows on the world with an outline: the on-screen notice's lines, Combat Text's lines and the Gains lines, and, while Text Shade is on, the zone text and the game's messages in the middle of the screen. Off: soft text on a dark shade."] = "为MelloUI显示在世界上的文字加描边：屏幕通知的行、战斗文字的行和收获行，以及“文字阴影”开启时的区域文字和屏幕中央的游戏消息。关闭：暗影上的柔和文字。", -- draft
	["Combat Text"] = "战斗文字", -- draft
	["Numbers Over Enemies"] = "敌人头上的数字", -- draft
	["The size of the numbers over the enemies and the ones you heal: the game's own, and Your Damage's when MelloUI draws them (one or the other shows). 1.0 is the game's size."] = "敌人头上和你治疗对象头上数字的大小：游戏自己的，以及MelloUI绘制时“你的伤害”的（两者只显示其一）。1.0为游戏的大小。", -- draft
	["Bar Layout"] = "动作条布局", -- draft
	["Which Bar"] = "哪条动作条", -- draft
	["The bar the rows below set: its rows, icons, icon size and padding, saved into your active Edit Mode layout as Edit Mode saves them, once you let a slider go (out of combat). The game shows them after a reload: type /reload (MelloUI says so once). One of the game's preset layouts is copied first: you are asked once."] = "下面几行设置的动作条：它的行数、图标、图标大小和间距，在你松开滑块时（脱离战斗）按编辑模式的方式存入你当前的编辑模式布局。游戏在重载后显示它们：输入/reload（MelloUI会提示一次）。会先复制游戏的一个预设布局：只询问一次。", -- draft
	["Action Bar 1"] = "动作条1", -- draft
	["Action Bar 2"] = "动作条2", -- draft
	["Action Bar 3"] = "动作条3", -- draft
	["Action Bar 4"] = "动作条4", -- draft
	["Action Bar 5"] = "动作条5", -- draft
	["Action Bar 6"] = "动作条6", -- draft
	["Action Bar 7"] = "动作条7", -- draft
	["Action Bar 8"] = "动作条8", -- draft
	["Stance Bar"] = "姿态条", -- draft
	["Pet Bar"] = "宠物条", -- draft
	["Rows"] = "行数", -- draft
	["How many rows the bar's buttons stand in (columns, on a bar stood upright in Edit Mode)."] = "动作条按钮排成几行（如果在编辑模式中竖着放，则为列数）。", -- draft
	["Icons"] = "图标", -- draft
	["How many of the bar's buttons show."] = "显示动作条的几个按钮。", -- draft
	["Icon Size"] = "图标大小", -- draft
	["The size of the bar's buttons. 100% is the game's own size."] = "动作条按钮的大小。100%为游戏自己的大小。", -- draft
	["Padding"] = "间距", -- draft
	["The room between the bar's buttons."] = "动作条按钮之间的空隙。", -- draft
	["The Bar's Shape"] = "动作条形状", -- draft
	["The bar as the rows above lay it out. Saved into your Edit Mode layout when you let a slider go (in a fight, when it ends); the bar itself changes after a reload."] = "按上面几行排布的动作条。松开滑块时存入你的编辑模式布局（战斗中则在战斗结束时）；动作条本身在重载后改变。", -- draft
	["Buff Layout"] = "增益布局", -- draft
	["The size of your buff and debuff icons, in pixels: MelloUI's own rows while Your Buffs And Debuffs shows them, else the game's buff and debuff bars (saved into your Edit Mode layout in its own steps of 3 pixels, shown after a reload; 30 is the game's size)."] = "你的增益和减益图标的大小（像素）：当“你的增益和减益效果”显示MelloUI的行时为那些行，否则为游戏的增益和减益条（按3像素一档存入你的编辑模式布局，重载后显示；30为游戏的大小）。", -- draft
	["Spacing"] = "间隔", -- draft
	["The room between your buff and debuff icons."] = "你的增益和减益图标之间的空隙。", -- draft
	["Per Row"] = "每行数量", -- draft
	["How many buffs stand in a row before the next row starts. Your debuffs start a row of their own (the game's debuff bar takes at most 16 in a row)."] = "一行放几个增益后开始下一行。你的减益另起一行（游戏的减益条每行最多16个）。", -- draft
	["Grow"] = "增长方向", -- draft
	["Which way a row of buffs grows from the first one."] = "一行增益从第一个开始向哪边增长。", -- draft
	["New Rows"] = "新行", -- draft
	["Where the next row of buffs goes: under the first, or over it."] = "下一行增益放在哪里：第一行下方或上方。", -- draft
	["Down"] = "向下", -- draft
	["Up"] = "向上", -- draft
	["Split Stack"] = "拆分堆叠", -- draft
	["Mouse Wheel Amount"] = "鼠标滚轮数量", -- draft
	["In the box that splits a stack (Shift-click a stack), the mouse wheel changes the amount: up adds one, down takes one, ten at a time while you hold Shift."] = "在拆分堆叠的框里（Shift+点击一个堆叠），鼠标滚轮改变数量：向上加一，向下减一，按住Shift时一次十个。", -- draft
	["Half Button"] = "一半按钮", -- draft
	["A ½ button at the left end of the split box's amount: click it and the amount is half the stack (191 makes 95). Buying in bundles at a merchant, it rounds down to whole bundles."] = "拆分框数量左端的一个½按钮：点击后数量变为堆叠的一半（191变成95）。在商人处按捆购买时，向下取整为整捆。", -- draft
	["Item Slots"] = "物品栏位", -- draft
	["Quality Gems"] = "品质宝石", -- draft
	["A small gem in the top-left corner of every item in your bags, the bank and the guild bank, in the colour of the item's quality: grey for junk, white for common, then green, blue, purple and orange. Junk and better items stand out at a glance. While the game shows its own mark in that corner (the junk coin at a merchant, the upgrade arrow, the exclamation mark on an item that starts a quest, the quality badge on a crafting reagent), the gem moves to the top-right corner. One switch for all three windows."] = "你的背包、银行和公会银行中每件物品左上角的一颗小宝石，颜色为物品品质：垃圾为灰色，普通为白色，然后是绿、蓝、紫和橙。垃圾和更好的物品一眼就能认出。当游戏在那个角显示自己的标记时（商人处的垃圾硬币、升级箭头、开始任务物品上的感叹号、制造材料的品质徽章），宝石会移到右上角。三个窗口一个开关。", -- draft
	["Grey Out Junk"] = "垃圾变灰", -- draft
	["Junk (grey quality) items show grey in your bags, the bank and the guild bank, so they stand apart from what you keep. One switch for all three windows."] = "垃圾（灰色品质）物品在你的背包、银行和公会银行中显示为灰色，与你要保留的东西区分开。三个窗口一个开关。", -- draft
	["Level Up"] = "升级", -- draft
	["When you gain a level, a light runs along the experience bar and the on-screen notice says your new level and, with the Quest List, how many quests it opened in your zone (their givers pop onto the world map the next time it shows them). With the painted reskin, the number in your player frame's level circle also turns over with a ring of light. Not with Reduce Motion: then only the notice."] = "升级时，一道光沿经验条划过，屏幕通知告诉你新等级，配合任务列表还会告诉你它在你所在区域开放了多少任务（下次世界地图显示时任务给予者会出现在上面）。使用手绘换肤时，玩家框体等级圆圈里的数字也会伴着一圈光翻转。“减少动态效果”开启时不会：只有通知。", -- draft
	["XP Gain"] = "获得经验", -- draft
	["When you gain experience, the stretch of the experience bar just gained lights up while a light runs along it to the new end. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "获得经验时，经验条上刚获得的那一段会亮起，同时一道光划向新的末端。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	-- Stats
	["Small coloured FPS and latency readout in the bottom right corner."] = "右下角小巧的彩色FPS和延迟读数。", -- draft
	["Frames per second and latency in the corner. Blame the server with confidence."] = "角落里的帧数和延迟。理直气壮地怪服务器吧。", -- draft
	["Values"] = "数值", -- draft
	["Show FPS"] = "显示FPS", -- draft
	["Frames per second."] = "每秒帧数。", -- draft
	["Show Latency"] = "显示延迟", -- draft
	["Home latency in milliseconds."] = "本地延迟（毫秒）。", -- draft
	["Show World Latency Too"] = "同时显示世界延迟", -- draft
	["Also show the world server latency next to the home latency."] = "在本地延迟旁同时显示世界服务器延迟。", -- draft
	["Look"] = "外观", -- draft
	["Distance from the right edge of the screen."] = "距屏幕右边缘的距离。", -- draft
	["Distance from the bottom edge of the screen."] = "距屏幕下边缘的距离。", -- draft
	["Update Interval"] = "更新间隔", -- draft
	-- Vendor
	["Vendor"] = "商人", -- draft
	["Automatically repair your gear and sell junk items when visiting a merchant."] = "拜访商人时自动修理装备并出售垃圾物品。", -- draft
	["Sell the grey, mend the steel. Every merchant visit handled before the window opens."] = "卖掉灰色的，修好钢铁的。每次拜访商人，窗口打开前就办妥。", -- draft
	["Repair"] = "修理", -- draft
	["Auto Repair"] = "自动修理", -- draft
	["Repair all equipped and carried items when a merchant that can repair is opened."] = "打开可修理的商人时修理所有已装备和携带的物品。", -- draft
	["Use Guild Funds"] = "使用公会资金", -- draft
	["Pay repairs from the guild bank when allowed. Falls back to your own gold if the guild cannot cover the cost."] = "允许时从公会银行支付修理费。公会无法支付时改用你自己的金币。", -- draft
	["Selling"] = "出售", -- draft
	["Auto Sell Junk"] = "自动出售垃圾", -- draft
	["Sell all grey quality items in your bags when a merchant is opened."] = "打开商人时出售你背包中所有灰色品质的物品。", -- draft
	["Report In Chat"] = "在聊天中报告", -- draft
	["Print the repair cost, the gold gained from selling junk and what Restock bought for you."] = "显示修理费用、出售垃圾获得的金币以及“补货”为你买了什么。", -- draft
	-- Services
	["Services"] = "服务", -- draft
	["Service icons under the minimap that route you to the nearest repair, mailbox, innkeeper, flight master, auction house, bank, trainer, barber or transmogrifier."] = "小地图下方的服务图标，带你前往最近的修理、邮箱、旅店老板、飞行管理员、拍卖行、银行、训练师、理发师或幻化师。", -- draft
	["Repair, mailbox, innkeeper, bank... the nearest one is a click under the minimap."] = "修理、邮箱、旅店老板、银行……最近的那个就在小地图下方一点之遥。", -- draft
	["Icon Bar Under The Minimap"] = "小地图下方的图标栏", -- draft
	["Service buttons under the minimap; they move with the minimap in Edit Mode. Groups: one row of group buttons as wide as the map; click one to open its services with their distances, then click a service to route to the nearest one by road. All Buttons: two rows with an icon for every service; click one to route there. Right-click stops the route. A grey button has none known on this continent yet. With the square minimap and \"Merge With Services\" on (the Minimap page, Services), the buttons sit inside the minimap's frame."] = "小地图下方的服务按钮；在编辑模式中随小地图移动。分组：一排与地图同宽的分组按钮；点击一个打开它的服务及距离，再点击一个服务按道路规划去最近那个的路线。全部按钮：两排，每个服务一个图标；点击一个即规划路线。右键停止路线。灰色按钮表示在这块大陆上还不知道任何一处。使用方形小地图并开启“与服务合并”（小地图页，服务）时，按钮位于小地图的边框内。", -- draft
	["Button Layout"] = "按钮布局", -- draft
	["Groups: one row of buttons as wide as the map (Travel, Trade, Repair, Trainers, Looks, Errands, and AddOns while your addons have minimap buttons). Click a group for a small list of its services, each with the distance to the nearest one; click a service to route there. Repair routes at once. Errands lists your reminders (Restock, Mail, Repair Gear, Trainer) and how each stands; click one to route to the nearest place for it. All Buttons: two rows with an icon for every service."] = "分组：一排与地图同宽的按钮（旅行、交易、修理、训练师、外观、杂事，以及你的插件有小地图按钮时的插件）。点击一个分组会出现它的服务小列表，每项带有到最近一处的距离；点击一个服务即规划路线。修理会立即规划路线。杂事列出你的提醒（补货、邮件、修理装备、训练师）及各自状态；点击一项规划去最近地点的路线。全部按钮：两排，每个服务一个图标。", -- draft
	["Groups"] = "分组", -- draft
	["All Buttons"] = "全部按钮", -- draft
	["AddOns Group"] = "插件分组", -- draft
	["Your addons' minimap buttons (Questie and the others that put a round button on the minimap's edge) taken off the minimap and gathered into one more group in the Services row, AddOns: click it for a list of them. A click on an addon there is that addon's own (left, right or middle), and pointing at it shows its own tooltip. Only with Button Layout's Groups. Off: the buttons go back on the minimap."] = "你的插件的小地图按钮（Questie以及其他在小地图边缘放圆形按钮的插件）从小地图上拿下来，收进服务栏中额外的一个分组“插件”：点击它即可看到列表。在那里点击插件就是点击插件本身（左键、右键或中键），指向它会显示它自己的鼠标提示。仅限按钮布局为“分组”时。关闭：按钮回到小地图上。", -- draft
	["Bar Distance From The Minimap"] = "图标栏与小地图的距离", -- draft
	["How far under the minimap the buttons sit. Not used while they are merged into the square minimap's frame."] = "按钮在小地图下方多远。按钮并入方形小地图边框时不使用。", -- draft
	["Round Icons"] = "圆形图标", -- draft
	["Show the service icons as round medallions in a round rim instead of squares."] = "把服务图标显示为圆框中的圆形徽章，而不是方块。", -- draft
	["Trays Slide Out"] = "托盘滑出", -- draft
	["A group's list slides out from the minimap column like a drawer when you click its button, its rows one after another, and slides back in as it closes. Not with Reduce Motion: then it shows at once."] = "点击分组按钮时，它的列表像抽屉一样从小地图栏滑出，一行接一行，关闭时滑回去。“减少动态效果”开启时不会：直接显示。", -- draft
	["Minimap Button"] = "小地图按钮", -- draft
	["Also show a round button on the minimap's edge that opens the list of the nearest services; drag it to move it, right-click it to stop the route. /services opens the same list."] = "同时在小地图边缘显示一个圆形按钮，打开最近服务的列表；拖动可移动它，右键停止路线。/services打开同一个列表。", -- draft
	-- Reminders
	["Reminders"] = "提醒", -- draft
	["A round button by your portrait for errands: supplies low (Restock), new mail, gear to repair, a trainer with something new. Click it to route there. Off, none of the four shows; the Widgets' portrait reminders keep their own switches."] = "头像旁一个圆形按钮，提醒杂事：补给不足（补货）、新邮件、装备待修、训练师有新内容。点击即规划路线。关闭时四项都不显示；小部件里的头像提醒保留各自的开关。", -- draft
	["Supplies, mail, repairs and training: a gentle nudge beside your portrait, never a nag."] = "补给、邮件、修理和训练：头像旁轻轻一点，从不唠叨。", -- draft
	["New Mail"] = "新邮件", -- draft
	["Remind you when mail is waiting for you. It goes once you open a mailbox, and comes back only for mail that arrives after."] = "有邮件等着你时提醒你。打开邮箱后消失，只有之后到达的邮件才会让它回来。", -- draft
	["Repair Gear"] = "修理装备", -- draft
	["Remind you when your gear is wearing out. Broken gear goes to the top of the list."] = "装备快磨损时提醒你。损坏的装备排在列表最前面。", -- draft
	["Remind At"] = "提醒阈值", -- draft
	["Remind you once your most worn piece of gear is down to this much durability."] = "当你磨损最严重的装备耐久度降到这个程度时提醒你。", -- draft
	["Trainer"] = "训练师", -- draft
	["Remind you when a trainer has something new for you."] = "训练师有新内容时提醒你。", -- draft
	["Class Spells"] = "职业法术", -- draft
	["When you reach a level with new spells at your class trainer. It stays until you have learned them; each visit to your class trainer tells MelloUI when the next ones come, and before your first visit it goes by the levels trainers teach at."] = "当你达到职业训练师有新法术的等级时。一直保留到你学会它们；每次拜访职业训练师都会告诉MelloUI下一批何时到来，第一次拜访之前则按训练师授课的等级判断。", -- draft
	["Profession Ranks"] = "专业等级", -- draft
	["When one of your professions can learn its next rank at a trainer: Journeyman, Expert or Artisan."] = "当你的某个专业可以在训练师处学习下一级时：中级、高级或专家级。", -- draft
	["Stay Up In Rest Areas"] = "在休息区域保持显示", -- draft
	["In an inn or a city, and in a town like Sentinel Hill, every reminder stays until it is done (a mailbox opened, the spells or the rank learned ...) or you leave; Not now there waits until you next enter one."] = "在旅店或城市里，以及哨兵岭这样的城镇里，每个提醒都保留到完成为止（打开了邮箱、学会了法术或等级……）或你离开；在那里点“现在不”会等到你下次进入。", -- draft
	["Widget"] = "小部件", -- draft
	["Place"] = "位置", -- draft
	["Where the reminder button sits beside your portrait. With the player frame hidden it keeps a place of its own, which you can move in Edit Layout."] = "提醒按钮在你头像旁的位置。玩家框体隐藏时它有自己的位置，可在“编辑布局”中移动。", -- draft
	["Left of the portrait"] = "头像左侧", -- draft
	["Above the portrait"] = "头像上方", -- draft
	["Right of the portrait"] = "头像右侧", -- draft
	["Glow"] = "光晕", -- draft
	["The soft glow around the button: a gentle pulse for a few seconds, then steady; always steady; or none. It brightens when you are close to where the reminder sends you."] = "按钮周围的柔和光晕：先轻柔脉动几秒再保持常亮；始终常亮；或无。靠近提醒指引的地点时会变亮。", -- draft
	["Pulse, then steady"] = "先脉动，后常亮", -- draft
	["Steady"] = "常亮", -- draft
	["Show For"] = "显示时长", -- draft
	["How long a new reminder stays before it tucks itself away. It stays while your pointer is on it."] = "新提醒在自动收起前停留多久。鼠标指针停在上面时一直保留。", -- draft
	["Lock The Widgets"] = "锁定小部件", -- draft
	["Keep the widget column (Voice Over, loot rolls, the corpse run and the rest) where it is: Edit Layout shows its plate but does not move it. Voice Over's padlock sets this too."] = "让小部件栏（Voice Over、拾取掷骰、跑尸及其他）保持原位：“编辑布局”会显示它的牌子但不移动它。Voice Over的锁也会设置这一项。", -- draft
	["Most Widgets Shown"] = "最多显示小部件", -- draft
	["How many widgets the column shows at once. The rest wait in a slim \"+2 more\" row on top; a click there lists them. Loot rolls, summons, resurrect offers and ready checks always show, and Voice Over keeps the bottom place."] = "小部件栏同时显示多少个小部件。其余的在顶部一条细细的“+2个”行里等待；点击即列出。拾取掷骰、召唤、复活邀请和就位确认总会显示，Voice Over保留最下方的位置。", -- draft
	-- Restock
	["Restock"] = "补货", -- draft
	["Keeps drink, food, ammunition and reagents in your bags: a reminder when one runs low (with Reminders on), and at a shop a list of what to buy, bought only when you click Buy."] = "让你的背包里常备饮料、食物、弹药和施法材料：某项不足时提醒你（需开启提醒），到了商店列出要买的东西，只在你点击“购买”时才买。", -- draft
	["Water, bread and arrows, topped up before they run out."] = "水、面包和箭，用完之前补满。", -- draft
	["Remind Below"] = "低于此值提醒", -- draft
	["You are reminded when a line drops below this share of its amount: at 50 %, a line of 20 water reminds you at 9. At a shop it is bought back up to the full amount. The reminder needs Reminders on; the Restock List marks the low lines either way."] = "当一行低于其数量的这个比例时提醒你：在50 %时，一行20瓶水会在剩9瓶时提醒。在商店里会补回完整数量。提醒需要开启提醒；补货列表无论如何都会标出不足的行。", -- draft
	["Shopping List At The Shop"] = "商店购物清单", -- draft
	["At a merchant who sells what you are low on, a small list beside the shop window: each item, how many and the price, and the total. Nothing is bought until you click Buy."] = "在出售你缺少物品的商人处，商店窗口旁一个小清单：每件物品、数量和价格，以及总价。点击“购买”之前什么都不买。", -- draft
	["Restock List"] = "补货列表", -- draft
	["What to keep in your bags and how many. Each character has its own list; a new one starts with suggestions for its class. Also /restock."] = "背包里要常备什么、多少。每个角色有自己的列表；新列表从该职业的建议开始。也可用/restock。", -- draft
	["Edit"] = "编辑", -- draft
	-- Widgets
	["Widgets"] = "小部件", -- draft
	["Small live widgets in one column: loot rolls, the way back to your corpse, timed quests, summons, resurrect offers, ready checks, whispers, your pet, the auction house, crafting batches, profession cooldowns, quest items and a healer drinking. And more reminders by your portrait: bags, talents, Well Fed, weapon poisons and oils, your buffs."] = "一栏中的实时小部件：拾取掷骰、回到尸体的路、限时任务、召唤、复活邀请、就位确认、悄悄话、你的宠物、拍卖行、批量制造、专业冷却、任务物品以及正在喝水的治疗者。头像旁还有更多提醒：背包、天赋、进食充分、武器毒药和油、你的增益效果。", -- draft
	["What needs you now, in one small column."] = "现在需要你处理的，都在一个小栏里。", -- draft
	["In The Column"] = "栏中", -- draft
	["Loot Rolls"] = "拾取掷骰", -- draft
	["A roll in a group: the item in its quality colour, a ring for the time left, and Need, Greed and Pass on hover. The count is the rolls waiting. The game's own roll window stays out of sight meanwhile (with the Gamepad UI it stays)."] = "队伍中的掷骰：物品显示为品质颜色，一个圆环表示剩余时间，悬停时显示需求、贪婪和放弃。数字是等待中的掷骰数。此时游戏自己的掷骰窗口隐藏（手柄界面下保留）。", -- draft
	["Corpse Run"] = "跑尸", -- draft
	["As a ghost: how far your body is and which way, and a ring until you can come back. Click it for the way there; at your body, Resurrect. The game's own Resurrect popup is see-through and click-through meanwhile."] = "作为灵魂时：尸体有多远、在哪个方向，以及一个圆环显示何时可以复活。点击查看路线；到达尸体处时为复活。此时游戏自己的复活弹窗透明且可点击穿透。", -- draft
	["Timed Quests"] = "限时任务", -- draft
	["A quest with a time limit: a ring for its whole time and the time left."] = "有时间限制的任务：一个表示总时长的圆环和剩余时间。", -- draft
	["Summons"] = "召唤", -- draft
	["Someone summons you: where to, the time left, and Accept or Decline on hover. The game's own popup is see-through and click-through meanwhile."] = "有人召唤你：去哪里、剩余时间，悬停时显示接受或拒绝。此时游戏自己的弹窗透明且可点击穿透。", -- draft
	["Resurrect Offers"] = "复活邀请", -- draft
	["Someone offers to resurrect you: the time left, and Accept or Decline on hover. The game's own popup is see-through and click-through meanwhile."] = "有人要复活你：剩余时间，悬停时显示接受或拒绝。此时游戏自己的弹窗透明且可点击穿透。", -- draft
	["Ready Checks"] = "就位确认", -- draft
	["The leader's ready check and its time, with Ready and Not Ready on hover (a click on it: Ready). The game's own box stays away meanwhile (with the Gamepad UI it stays); its alert sound and the taskbar flash still come."] = "队长的就位确认及其时间，悬停时显示就绪和未准备就绪（点击它：就绪）。此时游戏自己的框不出现（手柄界面下保留）；提示音和任务栏闪烁照常。", -- draft
	["Threat"] = "仇恨", -- draft
	["In a group fight, only when it matters: close to pulling your target (\"Ease off\") or with it on you (\"Aggro\"), and for a tank the mobs not on you. The ring is your threat against the pull; point at it for the group's threat on your target."] = "在队伍战斗中，只在要紧时显示：快要从坦克那里拉走目标（“收着点”）或目标已在你身上（“OT”），坦克则显示没有打你的怪。圆环是你相对OT阈值的仇恨；指向它可看全队对你目标的仇恨。", -- draft
	["Whispers"] = "悄悄话", -- draft
	["A new whisper: the sender in their class colour, the last line and how many are unread. Reply opens their whisper window. Needs Chat's Whisper Popup Window."] = "新悄悄话：发送者显示为职业颜色、最后一行以及未读条数。“回复”打开他的悄悄话窗口。需要聊天的“悄悄话弹窗”。", -- draft
	["Hunter Pet"] = "猎人宠物", -- draft
	["Your pet is not happy: its face, a ring for its happiness, and Feed Pet on hover (out of combat)."] = "你的宠物不开心：它的脸、一个表示快乐度的圆环，悬停时显示喂养宠物（脱离战斗时）。", -- draft
	["Auction House"] = "拍卖行", -- draft
	["Outbid, sold, won and expired at the auction house, in one list. Click it for the way to the nearest mailbox."] = "拍卖行的被超出出价、已售出、已赢得和已过期，汇在一个列表里。点击查看前往最近邮箱的路线。", -- draft
	["Crafting"] = "制造", -- draft
	["A batch you craft: which one of how many, a ring for each item, and Stop on hover."] = "你正在批量制造：第几个、共几个，每件物品一个圆环，悬停时显示停止。", -- draft
	["Profession Cooldowns"] = "专业冷却", -- draft
	["A profession cooldown ready again (a transmute, mooncloth, the salt shaker). MelloUI learns it when you open that profession."] = "某个专业冷却再次就绪（转化、月布、盐瓶）。打开该专业时MelloUI会记下它。", -- draft
	["Quest Items"] = "任务物品", -- draft
	["In a quest's objective area, with the quest's item in your bags: the item, a ring for the objective's progress and how many you carry. Click it to use the item (out of combat: it folds away in a fight)."] = "在任务目标区域且背包里有任务物品时：物品、一个表示目标进度的圆环以及你携带的数量。点击使用物品（脱离战斗时：战斗中会收起）。", -- draft
	["Healer Drinking"] = "治疗者喝水", -- draft
	["When you tank a group, between pulls: a healer of your group is drinking, so wait before the next pull. It goes when they stop or a fight starts. The game keeps party mana hidden from addons, so it shows their drinking, not their mana."] = "你给队伍当坦克时，在两波怪之间：队伍中的治疗者正在喝水，所以下一波之前等一等。治疗者停下或战斗开始时消失。游戏对插件隐藏队友的法力值，所以这里显示的是他在喝水，而不是他的法力。", -- draft
	["Rare Alert"] = "稀有警报", -- draft
	["A rare or rare elite nearby, seen on the minimap, as a nameplate, as your target or under the mouse: its face, its name and how far it is, glowing as it comes up. Click its face to target it (out of combat); Lead Me There shows the way to where the minimap has it."] = "附近有稀有或稀有精英，出现在小地图上、作为姓名板、作为你的目标或在鼠标下：它的脸、名字和距离，出现时发光。点击它的脸选中它（脱离战斗时）；“带我去”显示到小地图标出位置的路线。", -- draft
	["Rare Alert Sound"] = "稀有警报音效", -- draft
	["Play a sound when a rare is spotted."] = "发现稀有时播放音效。", -- draft
	["By The Portrait"] = "头像旁", -- draft
	["Bags Almost Full"] = "背包快满了", -- draft
	["Remind you when your bags are almost full; it stays, in a fight too, until you make room. Click it for the way to the nearest vendor."] = "背包快满时提醒你；一直保留（战斗中也是），直到你腾出空间。点击查看前往最近商人的路线。", -- draft
	["Free Slots"] = "空栏位", -- draft
	["Remind you once this many free bag slots or fewer are left."] = "剩余空背包栏位不超过这个数时提醒你。", -- draft
	["Talent Points"] = "天赋点", -- draft
	["Remind you when you have talent points to spend."] = "有天赋点可用时提醒你。", -- draft
	["Well Fed Ending"] = "进食充分即将结束", -- draft
	["Remind you when Well Fed has two minutes left."] = "进食充分只剩两分钟时提醒你。", -- draft
	["Weapon Poisons & Oils"] = "武器毒药和油", -- draft
	["Remind you when a poison, an oil or a sharpening stone has run out on a weapon, or has two minutes left, while you carry one to put it back on. It stays until it is back on, in fights too; click it to put it back on (out of combat)."] = "当武器上的毒药、油或磨刀石用完或只剩两分钟，而你身上带着可以补上的时，提醒你。一直保留到补上为止（战斗中也是）；点击即可补上（脱离战斗时）。", -- draft
	["Your Buffs"] = "你的增益效果", -- draft
	["Remind you when one of your own buffs is missing on you: Arcane Intellect and a mage's armor, Fortitude, Inner Fire and Divine Spirit, Mark of the Wild, a warlock's armor. Only buffs you can cast. It stays until the buff is back, in fights too (the game hides buffs in a fight, so one lost there shows after it); click it to cast (out of combat)."] = "当你自己的某个增益不在你身上时提醒你：奥术智慧和法师的护甲、坚韧、心灵之火和神圣之灵、野性印记、术士的护甲。只限你能施放的增益。一直保留到增益回来为止（战斗中也是；游戏在战斗中隐藏增益，所以战斗中失去的会在战斗后显示）；点击施放（脱离战斗时）。", -- draft
	["Your Buffs On The Group"] = "队伍上的你的增益", -- draft
	["Remind you when people in your group are missing a buff you can cast (Arcane Intellect and Divine Spirit only on those who use mana); point at it for their names. It stays until they have it, in fights too; click it to cast it on them, one by one (out of combat)."] = "当队伍中有人缺少你能施放的增益时提醒你（奥术智慧和神圣之灵只针对使用法力的人）；指向它可看到他们的名字。一直保留到他们都有为止（战斗中也是）；点击逐个为他们施放（脱离战斗时）。", -- draft
	-- Discard
	["Discard"] = "丢弃", -- draft
	["A button on the bag and loot windows that throws away your cheapest grey or white junk to free a slot (sells it at a vendor)."] = "背包和拾取窗口上的一个按钮，丢掉你最便宜的灰色或白色垃圾以腾出一个栏位（在商人处则出售）。", -- draft
	["Full bags? The cheapest junk makes room, never anything worth keeping."] = "背包满了？让最便宜的垃圾腾地方，绝不动值得留下的东西。", -- draft
	["Discard Button"] = "丢弃按钮", -- draft
	["A button on the bag window that frees a slot: it throws away the grey or white junk item worth least (at a vendor it sells it). Never food, drink, potions, scrolls, conjured items, crafting materials, quest items, reagents, ammunition, keys, white gear or anything on your Restock list. A white item asks first."] = "背包窗口上腾出栏位的按钮：丢掉价值最低的灰色或白色垃圾物品（在商人处则出售）。绝不丢食物、饮料、药水、卷轴、魔法制造的物品、制造材料、任务物品、施法材料、弹药、钥匙、白色装备或你补货列表上的任何东西。白色物品会先询问。", -- draft
	["Discard Button On Loot"] = "拾取窗口上的丢弃按钮", -- draft
	["The same button on the loot window. It frees a slot only when something you are looting is worth more than what it would throw away."] = "拾取窗口上的同一个按钮。只有当你正在拾取的东西比它要丢掉的更值钱时，才会腾出栏位。", -- draft
	["Never Throw Away Items Worth"] = "绝不丢弃价值达到", -- draft
	["In silver: a stack worth this or more is never thrown away (selling it at a vendor still is). 100 silver = 1 gold."] = "以银币计：价值达到或超过此数的一组物品绝不会被丢掉（在商人处出售仍可）。100银币 = 1金币。", -- draft
	-- Gains
	["Gains"] = "收获", -- draft
	["Short lines beside your character show what you just gained: a skill point, the items you loot or receive, and what you buy. You can move them in Edit Layout."] = "角色旁的短行显示你刚获得的东西：一个技能点、你拾取或收到的物品以及你买的东西。可在“编辑布局”中移动。", -- draft
	["Every skill point and every new item, told softly beside your character, then gone."] = "每个技能点、每件新物品，都在角色旁轻声告诉你，然后消失。", -- draft
	["Show"] = "显示", -- draft
	["Skill Ups"] = "技能提升", -- draft
	["A line when one of your skills goes up: weapon skills, Defense, professions, secondary skills and languages."] = "你的某项技能提升时显示一行：武器技能、防御、专业、副技能和语言。", -- draft
	["Show Skill Values"] = "显示技能数值", -- draft
	["The skill's new value and its cap after its name, such as 57 / 80."] = "技能名后显示新数值和上限，例如57 / 80。", -- draft
	["Looted & Received Items"] = "拾取和收到的物品", -- draft
	["A line for each item that comes into your bags: loot, quest rewards, crafted items, mail and trades. Moving items between your bags, the bank and your gear never counts."] = "每件进入背包的物品一行：拾取、任务奖励、制造物品、邮件和交易。在背包、银行和装备之间移动物品从不计入。", -- draft
	["Bought Items"] = "购买的物品", -- draft
	["A line for what you buy from a merchant, buybacks too, marked as bought."] = "从商人处购买的东西一行（购回也算），标为已购买。", -- draft
	["Junk Items"] = "垃圾物品", -- draft
	["Also show junk (grey) items. Off: they are left out."] = "也显示垃圾（灰色）物品。关闭：不显示。", -- draft
	["Money"] = "金钱", -- draft
	["A line when your money goes up: loot, quest rewards, sales, mail and trades, with the game's coins. Several gains in a row add up on one line. Spending makes no line."] = "你的金钱增加时显示一行：拾取、任务奖励、出售、邮件和交易，使用游戏的钱币图标。连续多次收入会合并成一行。花钱不产生行。", -- draft
	["Currencies"] = "货币", -- draft
	["A line for the other currencies you gain (honor, tokens, marks), with the currency's own icon."] = "你获得的其他货币一行（荣誉、徽章、印记），带该货币自己的图标。", -- draft
	["Item Names In Quality Colour"] = "物品名显示品质颜色", -- draft
	["Item names in their quality colour (green, blue, purple) beside the quality gem. Blue and purple read less well over bright ground. Off: the names in the text colour."] = "物品名显示为品质颜色（绿、蓝、紫），旁边是品质宝石。蓝色和紫色在明亮背景上较难看清。关闭：名字使用文字颜色。", -- draft
	["Lines"] = "行", -- draft
	["How long each line stays before it fades. Gaining the same skill or item again adds to its line and starts it over."] = "每行淡出前停留多久。再次获得同一技能或物品会加到它那行并重新计时。", -- draft
	-- Meter
	["Damage Meter"] = "伤害统计", -- draft
	["MelloUI's damage meter in place of the game's: three numbers by every frame (this fight, this run, healing), a race bar for the group in a fight, a summary after it and a Fight History window. The game's own damage meter is switched off while it is on, and comes back as you had it when it is off."] = "用MelloUI的伤害统计代替游戏的：每个框体旁三个数字（本场战斗、本次副本、治疗），战斗中队伍的竞速条，战斗后的总结，以及战斗历史窗口。开启时游戏自己的伤害统计关闭，关闭时按你原来的设置回来。", -- draft
	["How the fight went, where you already look."] = "战斗打得怎样，就在你本来就看的地方。", -- draft
	["Your Values"] = "你的数值", -- draft
	["Three numbers on top of your frame: the sword this fight's damage per second, the hourglass this run's, the cross your healing per second. Live in a fight, the last fight's after it. Move them in Edit Layout (Your Values)."] = "你框体上方三个数字：剑是本场战斗的每秒伤害，沙漏是本次副本的，十字是你的每秒治疗。战斗中实时显示，战斗后显示上一场的。可在“编辑布局”（你的数值）中移动。", -- draft
	["Party Values"] = "队伍数值", -- draft
	["The same three numbers on top of each party frame. To make room, the game's own Show Party Pets setting is switched on while this is on (the party frames stand a little further apart, and party pets show under them); your own setting comes back when it is off. With raid-style party frames: On Raid-Style Frames."] = "每个小队框体上方同样三个数字。为腾出空间，开启时会打开游戏的“显示小队宠物”设置（小队框体间距稍大，小队宠物显示在下方）；关闭时恢复你自己的设置。使用团队样式小队框体时：见“团队样式框体上”。", -- draft
	["On Raid-Style Frames"] = "团队样式框体上", -- draft
	["A small DPS or healing number on the right of each raid-style or raid frame, beside the health. In a fight, players MelloUI cannot tell apart stay empty until it ends. Point at a frame for all three numbers."] = "每个团队样式框体或团队框体右侧、生命值旁一个小小的DPS或治疗数字。战斗中MelloUI分辨不出的玩家保持空白，直到战斗结束。指向框体可看三个数字。", -- draft
	["Race Bar"] = "竞速条", -- draft
	["In a fight, one line for the group: the top player at its right end with their value, everyone else a class icon at their share of the top, you the bigger icon with the line filled up to you in your class colour. It fades in when the fight starts and out when it ends. The pointer on it lists everyone. Move it in Edit Layout."] = "战斗中为队伍显示一条线：最高的玩家在右端并带数值，其他人是位于其占最高者比例处的职业图标，你是较大的图标，线用你的职业颜色填到你的位置。战斗开始时淡入，结束时淡出。指针放在上面会列出所有人。可在“编辑布局”中移动。", -- draft
	["Race Bar Shows"] = "竞速条显示", -- draft
	["What the race bar races. Auto: healing while your group role is healer, else damage."] = "竞速条比拼的内容。自动：你的队伍职责为治疗者时比治疗，否则比伤害。", -- draft
	["Auto"] = "自动", -- draft
	["Damage"] = "伤害", -- draft
	["Healing"] = "治疗", -- draft
	["Race Bar Pins"] = "竞速条标记", -- draft
	["The most players on the race bar: the best ones, and always you."] = "竞速条上最多几名玩家：最好的几位，且总是包括你。", -- draft
	["Race Bar Width"] = "竞速条宽度", -- draft
	["How wide the race bar is. Also in Edit Layout: right-click the race bar."] = "竞速条的宽度。也可在“编辑布局”中：右键竞速条。", -- draft
	["Race Bar Thickness"] = "竞速条粗细", -- draft
	["How thick your share is on the race bar's line (its pins and labels keep their size). Also in Edit Layout: right-click the race bar."] = "你在竞速条线上的份额有多粗（标记和标签保持大小）。也可在“编辑布局”中：右键竞速条。", -- draft
	["Fight Summary"] = "战斗总结", -- draft
	["After a fight, for a few seconds in the widget column (longer while you point at it): won or lost and its length, your damage, DPS and rank, the ring your share of the group. The pointer on it shows the top five; a click opens the fight in the Fight History."] = "战斗后，在小部件栏中显示几秒（指着它时更久）：胜负和时长，你的伤害、DPS和排名，圆环是你占队伍的份额。指针放上去显示前五名；点击在战斗历史中打开这场战斗。", -- draft
	["Fight History"] = "战斗历史", -- draft
	["The Fight History window: every fight of this session, grouped by run, with the damage, healing and your spells of each. It opens from its button in the chat's button column and from the summary. It takes the place of the game's meter windows."] = "战斗历史窗口：本次游戏的每场战斗，按副本分组，带每场的伤害、治疗和你的法术。可从聊天按钮栏中的按钮和总结打开。它取代游戏的统计窗口。", -- draft
	["Fights Kept"] = "保留战斗数", -- draft
	["How many fights the history keeps, the oldest dropped first. Kept over a /reload; a new login starts it empty."] = "历史保留多少场战斗，最旧的先删除。/reload后保留；重新登录时清空。", -- draft
	-- SwingTimers
	["Swing Timers"] = "挥击计时条", -- draft
	["A shot bar and a melee bar in MelloUI's look in place of the game's swing timers: each swing and shot counted down beside your weapon's icon, the off hand under the main hand, a wand's shots on the melee bar. The game's own swing timers are switched off while this is on, and come back as you had them when it is off. While the Personal Display shows your swing on its rails (Swing On The Rails), these bars step aside."] = "用MelloUI外观的射击条和近战条代替游戏的挥击计时条：每次挥击和射击在武器图标旁倒数，副手在主手下方，魔杖射击在近战条上。开启时游戏自己的挥击计时条关闭，关闭时按你原来的设置回来。当个人显示在它的轨道上显示你的挥击时（轨道上的挥击），这些条让开。", -- draft
	["Every swing and shot at a glance."] = "每次挥击和射击，一目了然。", -- draft
	["Shot Bar"] = "射击条", -- draft
	["The shot bar for a bow, gun, crossbow or thrown weapon while Auto Shot is on: cream, shrinking to the middle while it reloads (you can move), then red, growing from the middle while you aim: stand still, moving holds the shot back."] = "自动射击开启时弓、枪、弩或投掷武器的射击条：奶油色，装填时向中间收缩（可以移动），然后变红，瞄准时从中间伸展：站着别动，移动会推迟射击。", -- draft
	["Melee Bar"] = "近战条", -- draft
	["The melee bar: each swing of your main hand counted down, shrinking to the middle. A wand's shots (Shoot) count down on it too."] = "近战条：主手的每次挥击倒数，向中间收缩。魔杖的射击（射击）也在它上面倒数。", -- draft
	["Off Hand Bar"] = "副手条", -- draft
	["A thinner bar under the melee bar for your off-hand weapon's swings, while you carry one."] = "近战条下方一条更细的条，显示你副手武器的挥击（携带副手时）。", -- draft
	["Seconds"] = "秒数", -- draft
	["The seconds left, past the bar's right end; on the shot bar Hold and Moving there while you aim. Off: the bars alone."] = "剩余秒数，位于条右端之外；瞄准时射击条那里显示“停住”和“移动中”。关闭：只有条。", -- draft
	["Width"] = "宽度", -- draft
	["How wide the bars are; the weapon's rim hangs left of them and the seconds right of them. Also in Edit Layout (right-click a bar there)."] = "条的宽度；武器圆框挂在左边，秒数在右边。也可在“编辑布局”中（在那里右键一条）。", -- draft
	["Height"] = "高度", -- draft
	["How tall the bars are; the off hand's is 60 % of it, and the weapon's rim grows with them from 15 on. Also in Edit Layout."] = "条的高度；副手条为它的60 %，武器圆框从15起随之变大。也可在“编辑布局”中。", -- draft
	["In Combat: a bar shows in a fight once it swings or shoots, and fades out when the fight ends (the shot bar also when Auto Shot stops). Always: each bar shows while you carry a weapon for it, at rest between swings."] = "战斗中：条在战斗中一挥击或射击就显示，战斗结束时淡出（射击条在自动射击停止时也会）。总是：携带相应武器时每条都显示，挥击间隙保持静止。", -- draft
	["In Combat"] = "战斗中", -- draft
	["Always"] = "总是", -- draft
	-- PartyMarkers
	["Party Markers"] = "队伍标记", -- draft
	["A class medallion above every party member's friendly nameplate, with a ring in their role's colour. In the open world; inside instances the game keeps friendly nameplates to itself."] = "每个队友友方姓名板上方一个职业徽章，带职责颜色的圆环。仅限野外；在副本中游戏不让插件使用友方姓名板。", -- draft
	["A class medallion over every party member's head, ringed in their role's colour: the healer, found at a glance."] = "每个队友头顶一个职业徽章，围着职责颜色的圆环：治疗者一眼就能找到。", -- draft
	["Markers"] = "标记", -- draft
	["Mark"] = "标记对象", -- draft
	["Whose nameplate gets the class medallion above the name."] = "谁的姓名板在名字上方显示职业徽章。", -- draft
	["Party and raid members"] = "小队和团队成员", -- draft
	["Every friendly player"] = "所有友方玩家", -- draft
	["Marker Size"] = "标记大小", -- draft
	["The medallion's size above the name."] = "名字上方徽章的大小。", -- draft
	["Height Above The Name"] = "名字上方高度", -- draft
	["The gap between the name and the medallion."] = "名字和徽章之间的间隙。", -- draft
	["Role Ring"] = "职责圆环", -- draft
	["A coloured ring around the medallion for the member's assigned role: green healer, blue tank, red damage. Only when the group has roles set (the group finder sets them; a party can set them by hand)."] = "徽章周围按成员指定职责着色的圆环：绿色治疗、蓝色坦克、红色伤害。仅当队伍设置了职责时（队伍查找器会设置；小队可以手动设置）。", -- draft
	["Open world only: inside instances the game keeps friendly nameplates to itself"] = "仅限野外：在副本中游戏不让插件使用友方姓名板", -- draft
	-- Sparkles
	["Loot Sparkles"] = "拾取闪光", -- draft
	["The game's sparkle on quest items you can loot, kept on through its graphics presets, and golden glints over the ore veins and herbs you walk up to: dim out of reach, bright in reach, grey when your skill is too low. The game settings it needs come back as you had them when it is off."] = "游戏在可拾取任务物品上的闪光，不受图形预设影响一直保留，以及你走近的矿脉和草药上的金色闪烁：够不着时暗淡，够得着时明亮，技能太低时为灰色。关闭时它需要的游戏设置按你原来的样子回来。", -- draft
	["What you can loot, at a glance."] = "能拾取什么，一目了然。", -- draft
	["Quest Item Sparkles"] = "任务物品闪光", -- draft
	["Keeps the game's sparkle on quest items you can loot. It needs the game's outline mode off, which its graphics presets switch back on: held while this is on, given back as you had it when off. Switching this off takes the sparkles away after the next game restart (the client's own; /reload is not enough)."] = "保留游戏在可拾取任务物品上的闪光。它需要关闭游戏的轮廓模式，而图形预设会重新打开它：开启时保持关闭，关闭时按你原来的设置还原。关闭此项后闪光会在下次重启游戏后消失（客户端重启；/reload不够）。", -- draft
	["Ore Veins"] = "矿脉", -- draft
	["Golden glints over the ore vein you walk up to (the game's soft targeting picks the nearest one, within about 15 yards): dim out of reach, bright once you can mine it, grey when your skill is too low."] = "你走近的矿脉上的金色闪烁（游戏的软目标选取最近的一个，约15码内）：够不着时暗淡，可以开采时明亮，技能太低时为灰色。", -- draft
	["Herbs"] = "草药", -- draft
	["The same glints over the herb you walk up to."] = "你走近的草药上同样的闪烁。", -- draft
	["Quest Objects"] = "任务物体", -- draft
	["The same glints over a quest object you walk up to. Off by default: the game's own sparkle (Quest Item Sparkles) already marks most of them."] = "你走近的任务物体上同样的闪烁。默认关闭：游戏自己的闪光（任务物品闪光）已经标出了大部分。", -- draft
	-- CustomSounds
	["Custom Sounds"] = "自定义音效", -- draft
	["The interface's sounds replaced by the custom library: iron, leather, parchment and stone for clicks, windows, bags, gear, vendors, whispers and the group finder."] = "用自定义音效库替换界面音效：点击、窗口、背包、装备、商人、悄悄话和队伍查找器使用铁、皮革、羊皮纸和石头的声音。", -- draft
	["Iron, leather, parchment and stone. Every click, page, pouch and buckle of the interface, re-recorded."] = "铁、皮革、羊皮纸和石头。界面的每一次点击、翻页、钱袋和扣带，全部重新录制。", -- draft
	["Sounds"] = "音效", -- draft
	["Clicks"] = "点击", -- draft
	["Buttons, checkboxes, tabs and scroll arrows: light clicks, a heavy one for Okay/Accept, a latch releasing for Cancel, Quit and abandoning a quest."] = "按钮、复选框、标签和滚动箭头：轻点击，确定/接受用重点击，取消、退出和放弃任务用松开插销的声音。", -- draft
	["Windows"] = "窗口", -- draft
	["A page turn when the character sheet, spell book, quest log or main menu opens, a latch when they close; the spell book's page turns; a quest giver's list and Decline; the bags as a leather pouch opening and closing."] = "打开角色面板、法术书、任务日志或主菜单时翻页，关闭时插销声；法术书翻页；任务给予者的列表和拒绝；背包像皮袋一样打开和合上。", -- draft
	["Inventory"] = "物品栏", -- draft
	["An item picked up, moved between slots, put down or looted; a rare or better item has its own sound. Silences the game's own pick-up and put-down sounds (the Equipment and Vendor sounds rely on that, and play only while this is on)."] = "拿起、在栏位间移动、放下或拾取物品；稀有及以上物品有自己的音效。屏蔽游戏自己的拿起和放下音效（装备和商人音效依赖这一点，只在此项开启时播放）。", -- draft
	["Equipment"] = "装备", -- draft
	["Buckles and plate for armour, a steel slide for weapons, jewellery ticks for rings, necks and trinkets; straps loosening when something is taken off."] = "护甲用扣带和板甲声，武器用钢铁滑动声，戒指、项链和饰品用首饰叮当声；取下东西时皮带松开的声音。", -- draft
	["Coins on the counter when buying, coins into the pouch when selling (the automatic grey sale too)."] = "购买时钱币落在柜台上，出售时钱币进袋（自动出售灰色物品也是）。", -- draft
	["Social"] = "社交", -- draft
	["A note under the door for a whisper, two knocks for a group invite."] = "悄悄话是门下塞进的纸条，组队邀请是两声敲门。", -- draft
	["Group Finder"] = "队伍查找器", -- draft
	["The ledger for entering a queue or applying to a listing, a strike-through for leaving it, the bell for a group that is ready and for a ready check."] = "进入队列或申请发布时是登记簿，离开时是划掉，队伍就绪和就位确认时是铃声。", -- draft
	["The workbench when an item is crafted."] = "制造出物品时的工作台声。", -- draft
	["Quests"] = "任务", -- draft
	["The mechanism engaging when a quest is turned in."] = "交任务时机关啮合的声音。", -- draft
	["Errors"] = "错误", -- draft
	["A muted knock for the game's red error messages (\"You can't do that yet\"), at most one every half second; none for a message Error Messages hides."] = "游戏红色错误信息（“你还不能那么做”）用一声闷响，每半秒最多一次；被“错误信息”隐藏的消息不发声。", -- draft
	["Targets"] = "目标", -- draft
	["An iron sight catching when a target is selected, a latch releasing when it is lost."] = "选中目标时铁瞄具卡住的声音，失去目标时插销松开的声音。", -- draft
	["A seal struck into the record when you level."] = "升级时在记录上盖下印章。", -- draft
	["Loot Coins"] = "拾取钱币", -- draft
	["Coins into the pouch when money is looted."] = "拾取金钱时钱币进袋。", -- draft
	["Spell Icons"] = "法术图标", -- draft
	["A page lifting when a spell, macro or ability is dragged, the slot latching when it is placed."] = "拖动法术、宏或技能时纸页掀起，放下时栏位卡住。", -- draft
	["Map Ping"] = "地图信号", -- draft
	["An iron pin into the parchment for a minimap ping."] = "小地图信号时一枚铁钉扎进羊皮纸。", -- draft
	["Scroll Wheel"] = "滚轮", -- draft
	["One cog notch per mouse-wheel step on any list, window or the chat. The game has no wheel sound; this is an addition."] = "在任何列表、窗口或聊天中，鼠标滚轮每滚一格响一声齿轮。游戏没有滚轮音效；这是新增的。", -- draft
	["Hover Ticks"] = "悬停滴答", -- draft
	["A tiny tick when the mouse reaches a button. The game has no hover sound; this is an addition."] = "鼠标移到按钮上时轻轻一声滴答。游戏没有悬停音效；这是新增的。", -- draft
	["Output"] = "输出", -- draft
	["Sound Channel"] = "音效频道", -- draft
	["The game volume slider the sounds follow."] = "这些音效跟随的游戏音量滑块。", -- draft
	["Sound Effects"] = "声音效果", -- draft
	["Master"] = "主音量", -- draft
	["Dialog"] = "对话", -- draft
	["Preview"] = "试听", -- draft
	["Click, light"] = "点击，轻", -- draft
	["UI_Click_Light.ogg: checkboxes, tabs, list rows, minimap zoom"] = "UI_Click_Light.ogg：复选框、标签、列表行、小地图缩放", -- draft
	["checkboxes, tabs, list rows, minimap zoom"] = "复选框、标签、列表行、小地图缩放", -- draft
	["Play"] = "播放", -- draft
	["Click, heavy"] = "点击，重", -- draft
	["UI_Click_Heavy.ogg: Okay, Accept, the panel buttons, the main menu opening"] = "UI_Click_Heavy.ogg：确定、接受、面板按钮、打开主菜单", -- draft
	["Okay, Accept, the panel buttons, the main menu opening"] = "确定、接受、面板按钮、打开主菜单", -- draft
	["Hover tick"] = "悬停滴答", -- draft
	["UI_Hover.ogg: the mouse reaching a button (Hover Ticks)"] = "UI_Hover.ogg：鼠标移到按钮上（悬停滴答）", -- draft
