	-- Nameplates
	["Large crowd-control icon above the name and a quest marker on enemy nameplates."] = "名字上方的大号控制图标，以及敌方姓名板上的任务标记。", -- draft
	["Know who is stunned, who is your quest target, and who is about to be a problem."] = "知道谁被晕了，谁是你的任务目标，谁马上要出麻烦。", -- draft
	["Crowd Control"] = "控制", -- draft
	["Large CC Icon Above Name"] = "名字上方大号控制图标", -- draft
	["Move the crowd-control icon from the right side of the nameplate to above the name and enlarge it. Requires Blizzard's Crowd Control nameplate aura option to be on."] = "把控制图标从姓名板右侧移到名字上方并放大。需要开启暴雪的姓名板控制光环选项。", -- draft
	["CC Icon Size"] = "控制图标大小", -- draft
	["Size of the crowd-control icon in pixels."] = "控制图标的大小（像素）。", -- draft
	["Gap Above Name"] = "名字上方间隙", -- draft
	["Space between the name / debuff row and the crowd-control icon."] = "名字 / 减益行与控制图标之间的距离。", -- draft
	["Quest Icon"] = "任务图标", -- draft
	["Show a yellow quest marker left of the health bar on enemies that still count for one of your quests."] = "在仍算作你某个任务目标的敌人的生命条左侧显示黄色任务标记。", -- draft
	["Quest Icon Size"] = "任务图标大小", -- draft
	["Size of the quest marker in pixels."] = "任务标记的大小（像素）。", -- draft
	["Threat Line"] = "仇恨线", -- draft
	["In a group fight, a thin bar along the bottom of an enemy's health bar (in the Nameplate Kit's lower rail) fills to the point where it would turn on you: gold while safe, amber when close, red when it is on you. For a tank it turns red when a mob is not on you. Solo it stays away."] = "在队伍战斗中，敌人生命条底部（姓名板套件的下石条里）一条细条，填充到它会转向你的位置：安全时为金色，接近时为琥珀色，在你身上时为红色。对坦克来说，怪不在自己身上时变红。单人时不显示。", -- draft
	["Combo Points"] = "连击点数", -- draft
	["For a rogue, and a druid in Cat Form: your five combo points in a row on the top edge of your target's health bar, empty until you build them. The name moves up a little to make room."] = "盗贼以及猎豹形态的德鲁伊：你的五个连击点数排在目标生命条的上沿，攒起来之前是空的。名字会稍微上移让出位置。", -- draft
	["Combo Point Size"] = "连击点数大小", -- draft
	["The size of each combo point, as a share of the health bar's height."] = "每个连击点数的大小，按生命条高度的比例。", -- draft
	-- PlateImpact
	["Impact Effects"] = "打击效果", -- draft
	["Your target's nameplate answers the fight: hits flash its bar, the part a hit took drains away, crits glow gold, a dodge or a miss flicks off its edge, an enemy's cast glows hotter towards its end and shatters when you interrupt it, and the killing blow flashes the bar out."] = "你目标的姓名板会回应战斗：命中让条闪一下，被打掉的部分慢慢流走，暴击泛起金光，躲闪或未命中从边上弹出，敌人的施法越接近结束越炽热、被你打断时碎裂，致命一击让条炸开。", -- draft
	["Every hit lands on the plate, not only in a number."] = "每一击都打在姓名板上，而不只是一个数字。", -- draft
	["Hit Flash"] = "命中闪光", -- draft
	["Your target's health bar flashes a moment when it is hit; a critical hit flashes gold."] = "你目标的生命条被击中时闪一下；暴击闪金光。", -- draft
	["Damage Chunk"] = "伤害块", -- draft
	["The part of the bar a hit took stays lit for a moment, then drains away, so you see how big each hit was."] = "被一击打掉的那段条会亮一会儿再流走，让你看清每一击有多大。", -- draft
	["Crit Glow"] = "暴击光晕", -- draft
	["A soft gold glow bursts round your target's bar on a critical hit."] = "暴击时你目标的条周围迸发出柔和的金色光晕。", -- draft
	["Kill Flash"] = "击杀闪光", -- draft
	["The killing blow flashes the bar out where the plate stood, instead of the plate simply vanishing."] = "致命一击让条在姓名板原处炸开，而不是姓名板直接消失。", -- draft
	["Dodge And Miss"] = "躲闪和未命中", -- draft
	["When your target dodges, parries or is missed, the word flicks off the side of its plate."] = "你的目标躲闪、招架或你未命中时，字样从它姓名板的侧边弹出。", -- draft
	["Cast Warning"] = "施法警告", -- draft
	["Your target's cast bar glows hotter as its cast nears the end, and shatters when the cast is interrupted."] = "你目标的施法条越接近施法结束越炽热，施法被打断时碎裂。", -- draft
	-- Tooltip
	["Tooltip"] = "鼠标提示", -- draft
	["Dark flat tooltips with class coloured names and borders, plus placement options."] = "深色扁平的鼠标提示，名字和边框为职业颜色，另有位置选项。", -- draft
	["Dark, flat and out of the way, with names in the colour of their class."] = "深色、扁平、不碍事，名字为职业颜色。", -- draft
	["Background"] = "背景", -- draft
	["The tooltips' background: the painted kit (Painted), the kit with a parchment sheet whose text is dark ink (Parchment), a flat near-black box with a dark border in your palette's colours (Dark), or the game's own. Painted and Parchment need the reskin on (Oldschool)."] = "鼠标提示的背景：手绘套件（手绘），带深色墨水文字羊皮纸的套件（羊皮纸），用你的配色、带深色边框的近黑扁平框（深色），或游戏自己的。手绘和羊皮纸需要开启换肤（Oldschool）。", -- draft
	["Painted"] = "手绘", -- draft
	["Parchment"] = "羊皮纸", -- draft
	["Dark"] = "深色", -- draft
	["Game"] = "游戏", -- draft
	["Backdrop Opacity"] = "背景不透明度", -- draft
	["Opacity of the Dark background."] = "深色背景的不透明度。", -- draft
	["Class / Reaction Border"] = "职业 / 关系边框", -- draft
	["Colour the border of unit tooltips by class (players) or reaction (NPCs)."] = "按职业（玩家）或关系（NPC）为单位鼠标提示的边框着色。", -- draft
	["Units"] = "单位", -- draft
	["Class / Reaction Health Colour"] = "职业 / 关系生命颜色", -- draft
	["Colour the tooltip health bar by class or reaction instead of green."] = "按职业或关系为鼠标提示的生命条着色，而不是绿色。", -- draft
	["Hide Health Bar"] = "隐藏生命条", -- draft
	["Hide the health bar under unit tooltips (on by default). Bar Texture and Class / Reaction Health Colour only matter while the bar is shown."] = "隐藏单位鼠标提示下方的生命条（默认开启）。“条材质”和“职业 / 关系生命颜色”只在显示生命条时有意义。", -- draft
	["Hide Issue Report Line"] = "隐藏问题报告行", -- draft
	["Leave out the beta's \"Press F6 to submit an issue for this ...\" line, and the gap above it, from creature, item, spell and quest tooltips. The key still opens the issue report while the tooltip shows."] = "从生物、物品、法术和任务的鼠标提示中去掉测试版的“Press F6 to submit an issue for this ...”这一行及其上方的空隙。鼠标提示显示时按键仍可打开问题报告。", -- draft
	["Coloured Lines"] = "彩色行", -- draft
	["A unit's tooltip in colours that tell you at a glance: the guild green, Alliance blue and Horde red, the level line in the colour of how hard the unit is for you, a quest's title gold and its objectives cream while still to do, green once done."] = "单位的鼠标提示用一眼就懂的颜色：公会为绿色，联盟为蓝色，部落为红色，等级行用该单位对你的难度颜色，任务标题为金色，未完成的目标为奶油色，完成后为绿色。", -- draft
	["Hide Unit Tooltips In Combat"] = "战斗中隐藏单位鼠标提示", -- draft
	["Do not show tooltips for units while in combat."] = "战斗中不显示单位的鼠标提示。", -- draft
	["Fade Delay"] = "淡出延迟", -- draft
	["How long the tooltip of a creature or an object stays fully visible after your cursor leaves it, before it fades out (the fade itself takes a quarter of a second)."] = "光标离开生物或物体后，它的鼠标提示保持完全可见多久再淡出（淡出本身需要四分之一秒）。", -- draft
	["Placement"] = "位置", -- draft
	["Anchor"] = "锚点", -- draft
	["Where tooltips appear."] = "鼠标提示出现的位置。", -- draft
	["Default (Edit Mode position)"] = "默认（编辑模式中的位置）", -- draft
	["At the cursor"] = "在光标处", -- draft
	["Right of the cursor"] = "光标右侧", -- draft
	["Scale"] = "缩放", -- draft
	["Scale of the game tooltip, the comparison tooltips beside it and a linked item's tooltip."] = "游戏鼠标提示、旁边的对比提示以及链接物品提示的缩放。", -- draft
	-- UnitFrames
	["Centred names, a clear name band and no combat flash for player, target and focus; the party's levels and the names' soft bands."] = "玩家、目标和焦点的名字居中、名字横带清晰、没有战斗闪光；小队的等级和名字的柔和横带。", -- draft
	["Player, target and focus, centred and calm."] = "玩家、目标和焦点，居中又安静。", -- draft
	["MelloUI Frames"] = "MelloUI框体", -- draft
	["The player, target, focus, target of target, pet and party frames in MelloUI's look, exactly as the game lays them out: a gold ring round the portrait, a dark level badge, and gold-lined iron borders round the name, health and power; the elite's and boss's golden dragon and the rare's silver one round the target. Off: the game's own frame art. The painted skin's frames keep their own (Oldschool)."] = "MelloUI外观的玩家、目标、焦点、目标的目标、宠物和小队框体，完全按游戏的布局：头像周围一圈金环、深色等级徽章，名字、生命和能量周围带金线的铁边框；目标周围有精英和首领的金龙、稀有的银龙。关闭：游戏自己的框体美术。手绘皮肤的框体保留自己的（Oldschool）。", -- draft
	["Names"] = "名字", -- draft
	["Name Font"] = "名字字体", -- draft
	["The face of the names on the player, target, focus and pet frames, their targets' and the party portraits' (their level follows). Shared: the Interface text's face (Look > Fonts)."] = "玩家、目标、焦点和宠物框体、它们的目标以及小队头像上名字的字体（等级跟随）。共享：“界面文字”的字体（外观 > 字体）。", -- draft
	["Glows"] = "光晕", -- draft
	["Hide Combat Flash"] = "隐藏战斗闪光", -- draft
	["Hide the red flash around the player, target, focus, pet and party frames while in combat or when a target attacks."] = "隐藏战斗中或目标攻击时玩家、目标、焦点、宠物和小队框体周围的红色闪光。", -- draft
	["Hide Status Glow"] = "隐藏状态光晕", -- draft
	["Hide the glow around the player portrait and name that shows resting (yellow) and combat (red), and the pet frame's glow while your pet attacks."] = "隐藏玩家头像和名字周围表示休息（黄色）和战斗（红色）的光晕，以及宠物攻击时宠物框体的光晕。", -- draft
	["Hide PvP Badge"] = "隐藏PvP徽章", -- draft
	["Hide the PvP badge beside the portrait of the player, target and focus frames: the diamond with your honour rank, or the faction icon, that shows while you or they are flagged for PvP."] = "隐藏玩家、目标和焦点框体头像旁的PvP徽章：你或他们开启PvP时显示的带荣誉军衔的菱形或阵营图标。", -- draft
	["Frame Art"] = "框体美术", -- draft
	-- Fader
	["Fader"] = "淡出", -- draft
	["Fade parts of the interface away while you do not need them: out of combat, or until you point at them. Pick for each frame, bar, the chat, the minimap and the trackers."] = "不需要时让界面的部分淡出：脱离战斗时，或在你指向它们之前。可为每个框体、条、聊天、小地图和追踪器分别选择。", -- draft
	["Your interface, only when you need it."] = "你的界面，只在需要时出现。", -- draft
	["Fade Everything"] = "全部淡出", -- draft
	["Every element on the Frames, Bars and Chat & Map tabs on In Combat: the whole interface fades away out of combat and comes back in a fight."] = "把“框体”“条”和“聊天和地图”标签上的每个元素设为“战斗中”：整个界面在脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。", -- draft
	["Fade"] = "淡出", -- draft
	["Fade Nothing"] = "全不淡出", -- draft
	["Every element on the Frames, Bars and Chat & Map tabs on Always: nothing fades."] = "把“框体”“条”和“聊天和地图”标签上的每个元素设为“总是”：什么都不淡出。", -- draft
	["Reset"] = "重置", -- draft
	["Faded Opacity"] = "淡出不透明度", -- draft
	["How much of an element stays while it is faded. At 0 % it is gone until it is needed (an On Mouseover bar at 0 % still shows when you point at it)."] = "元素淡出时保留多少。在0 %时它会消失，直到需要时才出现（0 %的“鼠标悬停”条在你指向它时仍会显示）。", -- draft
	["Fade After"] = "淡出前等待", -- draft
	["How long an element waits before it fades: after a fight ends, after you let go of your target or point away."] = "元素淡出前等待多久：战斗结束后、你放开目标或移开指针后。", -- draft
	["Fade Speed"] = "淡出速度", -- draft
	["How long the fade itself takes. Coming back is always quick. Reduce Motion: at once."] = "淡出本身需要多久。回来总是很快。减少动态效果：立即。", -- draft
	["Show With A Target"] = "有目标时显示", -- draft
	["In Combat elements come back while you have a target, a friend too."] = "“战斗中”的元素在你有目标时回来，友方目标也算。", -- draft
	["Also Show On Mouseover"] = "鼠标悬停时也显示", -- draft
	["In Combat elements come back while you point at them, too. (On Mouseover elements always do.)"] = "“战斗中”的元素在你指向它们时也会回来。（“鼠标悬停”的元素总是如此。）", -- draft
	["Your own frame. In Combat, it also comes back while your health or mana is below full and when you are dead; On Mouseover, it stays faded until you point at it. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "你自己的框体。“战斗中”时，你的生命或法力不满以及你死亡时它也会回来；“鼠标悬停”时，它保持淡出直到你指向它。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["On Mouseover"] = "鼠标悬停", -- draft
	["Pet Frame Too"] = "宠物框体也一起", -- draft
	["Your pet's frame fades and comes back with the player frame, and also comes back while your pet is hurt. Off: the pet frame always stays."] = "宠物框体与玩家框体一起淡出和回来，宠物受伤时也会回来。关闭：宠物框体始终显示。", -- draft
	["Your target's frame (and its target's). Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "你的目标框体（及其目标的）。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Party Frames"] = "小队框体", -- draft
	["The party frames, the game's and the raid-style ones. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "小队框体，游戏的和团队样式的。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["The raid frames. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "团队框体。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Your own buffs and debuffs, the game's or MelloUI's rows by the minimap. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "你自己的增益和减益效果，小地图旁游戏的或MelloUI的行。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["The round reminders beside your portrait (restock, mail, your buffs, the weapon's poison...). A new reminder does not bring them back: In Combat keeps it faded until a fight, On Mouseover until you point at them. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "头像旁的圆形提醒（补货、邮件、你的增益、武器毒药……）。新提醒不会让它们回来：“战斗中”保持淡出直到战斗，“鼠标悬停”直到你指向它们。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["The bars under your character and the shield column beside it (Personal Display). In Combat, they also come back while you cast. (No On Mouseover: the pointer passes through them to the world.) Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight."] = "你角色下方的条和旁边的护盾栏（个人显示）。“战斗中”时，你施法时它们也会回来。（没有“鼠标悬停”：指针会穿过它们点到世界。）总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。", -- draft
	["Main Action Bar"] = "主动作条", -- draft
	["Action Bar 1. Its keys work while it is faded. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "动作条1。淡出时它的按键照常可用。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Its keys work while it is faded. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "淡出时它的按键照常可用。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Stance & Pet Bar"] = "姿态条和宠物条", -- draft
	["The stance, form and aura bar, and your pet's bar. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "姿态、形态和光环条，以及你宠物的条。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Micro Menu"] = "微型菜单", -- draft
	["The small buttons for the game's windows. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "游戏窗口的小按钮。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Bag Bar"] = "背包栏", -- draft
	["Your bags' buttons. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "你的背包按钮。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["The bars of your experience and the reputation you watch. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "你的经验条和关注的声望条。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["The chat windows with their tabs, buttons, the Friends button and the line you type in. They come back while you type. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "聊天窗口及其标签、按钮、好友按钮和输入行。你打字时它们会回来。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["The minimap with its zone band and the Services row. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "小地图及其区域横带和服务栏。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Quest Tracker"] = "任务追踪器", -- draft
	["MelloUI's Quest Tracker. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "MelloUI的任务追踪器。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Objective Tracker"] = "目标追踪器", -- draft
	["The game's own objective tracker. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "游戏自己的目标追踪器。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["Widget Column"] = "小部件栏", -- draft
	["The column of widgets: loot rolls, summons, Voice Over, whispers and the rest. A new one does not bring the column back: In Combat keeps a loot roll, a summons or a whisper faded out of combat, On Mouseover until you point at the column. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "小部件栏：拾取掷骰、召唤、Voice Over、悄悄话等。新的小部件不会让栏回来：“战斗中”让拾取掷骰、召唤或悄悄话在脱离战斗时保持淡出，“鼠标悬停”直到你指向这一栏。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	["World Marker"] = "世界标记", -- draft
	["Route's World Marker over the destination. Always: never faded. In Combat: faded out of combat, back in a fight. On Mouseover: faded all the time, shown while you point at it."] = "路线在目的地上方的世界标记。总是：从不淡出。战斗中：脱离战斗时淡出，战斗时回来。鼠标悬停：一直淡出，指向时显示。", -- draft
	-- QuestAuto
	["Auto Accept & Hand In"] = "自动接受和交任务", -- draft
	["Accepts quests and hands them in as you talk to their givers, off until you switch it on."] = "与任务给予者交谈时接受任务并交任务，开启前保持关闭。", -- draft
	["Talk, and the quest is yours. Hold Shift to read it first."] = "说句话，任务就是你的了。按住Shift先读一读。", -- draft
	["Auto Accept Quests"] = "自动接受任务", -- draft
	["Accept a quest as soon as its giver shows it, and open a giver's only quest from its list. Grey, repeatable, daily and ignored quests are left to you, and so is an escort's or a shared quest's question."] = "任务给予者一显示任务就接受，并从列表中打开给予者唯一的任务。灰色、可重复、日常和被忽略的任务留给你，护送任务或共享任务的提问也是。", -- draft
	["Auto Hand In"] = "自动交任务", -- draft
	["Hand a finished quest in as soon as you talk to whoever takes it, and pick it from their list first. A choice of rewards waits for you (unless Take The Upgrade is on), and so do a hand-in that costs money and repeatable turn-ins."] = "与接收者一交谈就交上完成的任务，先从他的列表中选中它。有奖励可选时等你来选（除非开启“选择升级”），花钱交的任务和可重复交付也一样。", -- draft
	["Take The Upgrade"] = "选择升级", -- draft
	["With a choice of rewards: take the one with the highest item level over what you wear in its slot, among those you can use; when none is better, the one that sells for the most."] = "有奖励可选时：在你能用的奖励中，选物品等级比你该栏位所穿装备高出最多的；都不更好时，选卖价最高的。", -- draft
	["Skip Key"] = "跳过键", -- draft
	["Hold it as you talk to a giver to see its dialog as usual: nothing is accepted or handed in there."] = "与任务给予者交谈时按住它，照常查看对话：那里什么都不会被接受或交付。", -- draft
	["Shift"] = "Shift", -- draft
	["Ctrl"] = "Ctrl", -- draft
	["Alt"] = "Alt", -- draft
	-- HealerFrames
	["Healer Frames"] = "治疗者框体", -- draft
	["Incoming heals on the unit frames, and a glow in a debuff's colour round any frame whose unit has a debuff to remove."] = "单位框体上的预计治疗，以及在单位有可移除减益的框体周围显示减益颜色的光晕。", -- draft
	["See the heals coming in, and who needs a cleanse."] = "看清即将到来的治疗，以及谁需要驱散。", -- draft
	["Incoming Heals"] = "预计治疗", -- draft
	["The heals on their way to a unit shown on its health bar: your heals, other healers' heals and shields. On the player, target and focus frames and their targets; the party, pet and raid frames show the game's own (the raid frames' Display Incoming Heals)."] = "正在飞向单位的治疗显示在它的生命条上：你的治疗、其他治疗者的治疗和护盾。用于玩家、目标和焦点框体及其目标；小队、宠物和团队框体显示游戏自己的（团队框体的“显示预计治疗”）。", -- draft
	["Debuff Glow"] = "减益光晕", -- draft
	["A soft glow in the debuff's colour (Magic blue, Curse purple, Disease brown, Poison green) round a friend's frame while they have a debuff that can be removed. On the raid frames the border takes the colour too."] = "友方有可移除的减益时，在其框体周围显示该减益颜色的柔和光晕（魔法蓝、诅咒紫、疾病棕、中毒绿）。团队框体上边框也会变色。", -- draft
	["Debuff Glow Shows"] = "减益光晕显示", -- draft
	["Which debuffs light a frame: every one that can be removed, the ones someone in your group can remove, or only the ones you can remove."] = "哪些减益会点亮框体：所有可移除的、队伍中有人能移除的，或只有你能移除的。", -- draft
	["Every Dispellable Debuff"] = "所有可驱散的减益", -- draft
	["Ones The Group Can Dispel"] = "队伍能驱散的", -- draft
	["Ones I Can Dispel"] = "我能驱散的", -- draft
	-- ActionBars
	["The backdrops round the action bars, the micro menu, the bag bar and the experience bars, and the main bar's page arrows and bar art hidden, whatever their look."] = "动作条、微型菜单、背包栏和经验条周围的底板，以及隐藏主动作条的翻页箭头和动作条美术，无论外观如何。", -- draft
	["The experience and reputation bars in MelloUI's look: a slim iron frame with gold diamond ends, a dark track, the notches between the bar's parts and a soft light on the filling edge. Off: the game's own frame. The painted skin's bars keep their own (Oldschool)."] = "MelloUI外观的经验条和声望条：细铁框配金色菱形端头、深色轨道、条分段之间的刻痕以及填充边缘的柔光。关闭：游戏自己的框。手绘皮肤的条保留自己的（Oldschool）。", -- draft
	["Hide Page Arrows"] = "隐藏翻页箭头", -- draft
	["Hide the main bar's page number and its up / down arrows (the bar still pages with the keybinds)."] = "隐藏主动作条的页码及其上 / 下箭头（仍可用快捷键翻页）。", -- draft
	["Hide Bar Art"] = "隐藏动作条美术", -- draft
	["Action Bar 1 without the game's bar art (its frame, dividers and the art of empty slots), like the other bars: MelloUI ticks Edit Mode's own Hide Bar Art for it. Only on your own Edit Mode layouts: a preset such as Modern can't be changed. Shows after a /reload. Off: the art back on the layouts MelloUI changed (or set it yourself in Edit Mode)."] = "让动作条1像其他动作条一样不带游戏的动作条美术（框、分隔线和空栏位美术）：MelloUI为它勾选编辑模式自己的“隐藏动作条美术”。仅限你自己的编辑模式布局：“现代”这样的预设布局无法更改。/reload后显示。关闭：MelloUI改过的布局恢复美术（或在编辑模式中自己设置）。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 1, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条1周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 2, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条2周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 3, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条3周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 4, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条4周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 5, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条5周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 6, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条6周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 7, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条7周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round Action Bar 8, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "动作条8周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the stance bar, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "姿态条周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the pet bar, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "宠物条周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["Possess Bar"] = "附身条", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the possess bar, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "附身条周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["Totem Bar"] = "图腾栏", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the totem bar, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "图腾栏周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the micro menu, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "微型菜单周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the bag bar, merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it. Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "背包栏周围的底板，与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["Experience Bar"] = "经验条", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the experience bar (the reputation bar in its place at the top level), merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it (this bar then takes their width, within a limit). Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "经验条周围的底板（满级时其位置为声望条），与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块（此时这条在限度内取它们的宽度）。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	["Reputation Bar"] = "声望条", -- draft
	["A backdrop round the second status bar (a watched reputation while you level), merged into one with the other switched-on elements placed next to it (this bar then takes their width, within a limit). Off: no backdrop, and it joins none."] = "第二条状态条周围的底板（升级时关注的声望），与旁边其他已开启的元素合并为一块（此时这条在限度内取它们的宽度）。关闭：没有底板，也不与任何底板合并。", -- draft
	-- ActionButtons
	["Action Buttons"] = "动作按钮", -- draft
	["Lights an action button while its key is held, and colours its icon by range and resources."] = "按住按键时点亮动作按钮，并按距离和资源为其图标着色。", -- draft
	["See which button you press, and which spell cannot reach its target."] = "看清你按的是哪个按钮，以及哪个法术够不着目标。", -- draft
	["Every action button in MelloUI's frame: a dark iron rim with a gold line, brighter under the pointer, bright gold while its aura or stance is on, red out of range, a dark slot when the button is empty. Off: the game's own frames. The painted skin's bars keep their own (Oldschool)."] = "每个动作按钮使用MelloUI的边框：带金线的深色铁边，指针下更亮，光环或姿态开启时为亮金色，超出范围为红色，按钮为空时为深色栏位。关闭：游戏自己的边框。手绘皮肤的动作条保留自己的（Oldschool）。", -- draft
	["Cooldown Ready Flash"] = "冷却就绪闪光", -- draft
	["When an action's cooldown runs out, a golden light runs once round its button, so you see it is ready again. Never for the global cooldown."] = "动作冷却结束时，一道金光绕按钮跑一圈，让你看到它又就绪了。公共冷却从不触发。", -- draft
	["Light While Pressed"] = "按下时发光", -- draft
	["While you hold an action button's key, or press it with the mouse, the whole button lights up in the colour scheme's highlight colour, so you can see which button you are pressing."] = "按住动作按钮的按键或用鼠标按下时，整个按钮以配色方案的高亮色亮起，让你看到正在按哪个按钮。", -- draft
	["Range And Resource Colours"] = "距离和资源颜色", -- draft
	["An action's icon turns red while your target is out of its range, deep blue while you lack the mana (or other resource) for it, and grey while it cannot be used. Its key already turns red out of range."] = "目标超出范围时动作图标变红，缺少法力（或其他资源）时变深蓝，无法使用时变灰。超出范围时它的按键本来就会变红。", -- draft
	-- CooldownTweaks
	["Cooldown Manager Tweaks"] = "冷却管理器调整", -- draft
	["Centred rows, key bindings, a light while pressed and the count size on the game's Cooldown Manager."] = "游戏冷却管理器的行居中、快捷键、按下时发光以及数字大小。", -- draft
	["Your cooldowns, in the middle, with their keys on them."] = "你的冷却，在中间，按键就在上面。", -- draft
	["Centre Rows"] = "行居中", -- draft
	["A row with fewer icons than the others sits centred under them, so the icons grow from the middle. The essential and utility cooldowns and the buff icons."] = "图标比其他行少的一行居中排在它们下面，让图标从中间向两边增长。重要技能、效能技能冷却以及增益图标。", -- draft
	["Key Bindings"] = "快捷键", -- draft
	["The key of the action button that holds a cooldown's spell, on the icon's corner."] = "放有该冷却法术的动作按钮的按键，显示在图标角上。", -- draft
	["A cooldown's icon lights up while you press the action button with its spell, as the button does (Action Buttons)."] = "按下放有该法术的动作按钮时，冷却图标像按钮一样亮起（动作按钮）。", -- draft
	["Count Size"] = "数字大小", -- draft
	["The size of the charges and stacks numbers on the icons."] = "图标上充能和层数数字的大小。", -- draft
	-- BagWindow
	["Bags by Kind"] = "背包分类", -- draft
	["Your bags in one window of MelloUI's own, sorted by kind: what you picked up lately, gear, quest items, consumables, junk, trade goods and the rest, each under its own heading. The empty slots fold into one slot with their count."] = "你的背包在MelloUI自己的一个窗口中，按类别排序：最近拾取的、装备、任务物品、消耗品、垃圾、商品等，各在自己的标题下。空栏位折叠成一个带数量的栏位。", -- draft
	["A place for everything, and everything under its heading."] = "物各有所，各归其题。", -- draft
	["Kinds"] = "类别", -- draft
	["Your bag window's kinds in the order they show, the top first: drag a row to move it. A line draws a line across the window between the kinds over and under it; a group puts the kinds under it, to the next line, under one heading you can fold. Untick a kind and its items go to their own type, or to Other. Add kind makes one of your own: it takes the items you drop on its + slot and the ones its rule matches (an item type, a word in the name, a quality), before the game's kinds. Double-click a name to rename it; a kind's cog opens its settings: its name, Split By Type (a heading for each item type, in its place) and an own kind's rule."] = "你背包窗口的类别，按显示顺序，最上面的在前：拖动一行即可移动它。“分隔线”在上下类别之间画一条横贯窗口的线；“分组”把它下面直到下一条线的类别收在一个可折叠的标题下。取消勾选一个类别，它的物品会归到自己的类型，或归到“其他”。“添加类别”新建你自己的类别：它会收下你拖到它+栏位上的物品，以及符合它规则（物品类型、名称中的词、品质）的物品，优先于游戏的类别。双击名字可重命名；类别的齿轮打开它的设置：名字、“按类型拆分”（在原位为每种物品类型加一个标题）以及自定义类别的规则。", -- draft
	["Items You Placed"] = "你放置的物品", -- draft
	["While you hold an item, every kind in your bag window shows a + slot: drop the item there and it always goes under that kind (drop it on its own kind's + to put it back). Forget puts every item you placed back under its own kind."] = "手里拿着物品时，背包窗口的每个类别都显示一个+栏位：把物品放到那里，它就总归在那个类别下（放到它自己类别的+上即可放回）。“忘记”把你放置的每件物品放回它自己的类别。", -- draft
	["Forget"] = "忘记", -- draft
	["Bank by Kind"] = "银行分类", -- draft
	["Your bank in the same kinds as your bags, inside the game's bank window: its items under their headings, the lines and groups of the Kinds list, the empty slots folded into one, a + slot in every kind while you hold an item. Deposit and take out as always (right-click, drag). Off: the game's own grid."] = "你的银行按与背包相同的类别显示，在游戏的银行窗口内：物品在各自标题下，类别列表的分隔线和分组，空栏位折叠成一个，拿着物品时每个类别都有+栏位。照常存取（右键、拖动）。关闭：游戏自己的网格。", -- draft
	["Recent Lasts"] = "“最近”保留时长", -- draft
	["How long an item stays under Recent: until you close your bags, only until you point at it (it moves to its own kind as the pointer leaves it), or for 5 minutes after you got it."] = "物品在“最近”下停留多久：直到你关闭背包，只到你指向它为止（指针离开时移到自己的类别），或获得后5分钟。", -- draft
	["Until The Bags Close"] = "直到关闭背包", -- draft
	["Until Hovered"] = "直到指向", -- draft
	["For 5 Minutes"] = "5分钟", -- draft
	["Columns"] = "列数", -- draft
	["How many slots across the bag window is: more makes it wider and shorter."] = "背包窗口横向有多少个栏位：越多越宽越矮。", -- draft
	["Item Size"] = "物品大小", -- draft
	["How big the item slots are (37 is the game's own size)."] = "物品栏位的大小（37为游戏自己的大小）。", -- draft
	["Fold Empty Slots"] = "折叠空栏位", -- draft
	["All your empty slots as one slot with their count (drop an item on it to put it in a free slot). Off: every empty slot shows."] = "所有空栏位合成一个带数量的栏位（把物品放上去即放入一个空栏位）。关闭：每个空栏位都显示。", -- draft
	["Sort Items By"] = "物品排序方式", -- draft
	["The order inside each kind: better quality first, by name, the ones you picked up last first, or the highest item level first."] = "每个类别内的顺序：品质高的在前、按名字、最后拾取的在前，或物品等级最高的在前。", -- draft
	["Quality"] = "品质", -- draft
	["Name"] = "名字", -- draft
	["Newest First"] = "最新的在前", -- draft
	["Item Level"] = "物品等级", -- draft
	["Loot Flight"] = "拾取飞行", -- draft
	["An item you loot flies from where you picked it up into its slot in your bag window (with the bags closed, onto the bag button) and lands with a light across it. The rarer it is, the more it does: green leaves a streak, blue bursts into rays and lands in a ring, purple throws sparks and a shockwave, and a legendary rises in a pillar of light, flashes your bag window's border and says its name on the screen. Turning in a quest, its reward item flies the same way, and its money flies as coins into the bag window's money, which counts up as they land; coins you loot fly in the same way while the bag window is open. Only loot and quest rewards, never what you buy, craft or take from the mail. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "你拾取的物品从拾取处飞进背包窗口中它的栏位（背包关闭时飞到背包按钮上），落下时有一道光扫过。越稀有效果越多：绿色留下一道拖尾，蓝色迸出光芒并落入光环，紫色溅出火花和冲击波，传说物品在光柱中升起，让背包窗口的边框闪光，并在屏幕上显示它的名字。交任务时，奖励物品同样飞入，金钱化作钱币飞进背包窗口的金钱栏，落下时数字随之增加；背包窗口打开时拾取的钱币也这样飞入。只限拾取和任务奖励，绝不包括你购买、制造或从邮件中取出的东西。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	["Items Glide"] = "物品滑动", -- draft
	["When an item comes into your bag window or leaves it, the others glide to their new slots instead of jumping there; one that moves to the next row slides in at its start, and a new one fades in. Switching between the Backpack and the Reagent Bag fades the window's items over. Not while you hold an item (its + slots come and go at once), not with Reduce Motion."] = "物品进入或离开背包窗口时，其他物品滑到新栏位而不是跳过去；移到下一行的物品从行首滑入，新物品淡入。在行囊和材料包之间切换时窗口的物品淡入淡出。拿着物品时不会（它的+栏位即时出现消失），“减少动态效果”开启时也不会。", -- draft
	["Rolling Money"] = "滚动金钱", -- draft
	["The bag window's money rolls to its new sum when it changes (selling, buying, a repair, a quest) instead of jumping there: warm while it goes up, red while it goes down. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "背包窗口的金钱变化时（出售、购买、修理、任务）滚动到新数额而不是直接跳过去：增加时为暖色，减少时为红色。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	["Bags Full Warning"] = "背包已满警告", -- draft
	["When something does not fit because your bags are full, the bag window's Empty slot (it shows 0 then) gives one short shake and a red flash; with the bags closed, the backpack button flashes red. Once each time, as the game's own \"Inventory is full.\" line comes. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "因背包已满放不下东西时，背包窗口的“空”栏位（此时显示0）短促地晃一下并闪红；背包关闭时行囊按钮闪红。每次游戏出现“物品栏已满。”这一行时一次。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	-- MinimapPanel
	["MelloUI's minimap: its size, the square shape in the Chat panel, the Services bar merged under it and the column under it the Quest Tracker follows. Off: the game's own minimap."] = "MelloUI的小地图：大小、聊天面板中的方形、并入其下方的服务栏，以及任务追踪器跟随的下方栏。关闭：游戏自己的小地图。", -- draft
	["Shape"] = "形状", -- draft
	["The painted Minimap skin's shape (Oldschool): Round, the map in the painted ring, or Square, the whole square map in the border Square Border picks. Without the painted skin the map is square."] = "手绘小地图皮肤的形状（Oldschool）：圆形，地图在手绘圆环中；或方形，整张方形地图在“方形边框”选定的边框中。没有手绘皮肤时地图为方形。", -- draft
	["Round"] = "圆形", -- draft
	["Square"] = "方形", -- draft
	["Square Border"] = "方形边框", -- draft
	["The border round the square map: the windows' frame with its gem corners, a single iron rail, the action bars' heavy frame with red or iron gems, one of the thin rims the buttons wear (drawn heavier, at the map's size), or none. Picked with pictures on the Minimap page, its Border part. The painted borders need the painted Minimap skin (Oldschool); without it the map wears the Chat panel."] = "方形地图周围的边框：带宝石角的窗口边框、单铁条、带红色或铁色宝石的动作条粗边框、按钮使用的一种细边（按地图尺寸画得更粗），或无。在小地图页面的“边框”部分用图片选择。手绘边框需要手绘小地图皮肤（Oldschool）；没有它时地图使用聊天面板。", -- draft
	["Window frame"] = "窗口边框", -- draft
	["Chat panel"] = "聊天面板", -- draft
	["Heavy, red gems"] = "粗边，红宝石", -- draft
	["Heavy, iron gems"] = "粗边，铁宝石", -- draft
	["Merge With Services"] = "与服务合并", -- draft
	["The square map, its zone header and the Services bar in one frame: the zone name on the frame's top rail, and under the map a divider rail named Services over the Services bar (with the row of group buttons, the clock beside the zone name). For the square shape with the window frame or the single rail."] = "方形地图、区域标题和服务栏在同一个边框中：区域名在边框上沿石条上，地图下方一条名为“服务”的分隔石条在服务栏上方（含一排分组按钮，时钟在区域名旁）。用于配窗口边框或单石条的方形。", -- draft
	["How wide the map is. The round map is as tall as it is wide, and its painted ring grows and shrinks with it. The square map's border and the zone name keep their size, the Services buttons too (smaller only on a map too narrow for them), and the Quest Tracker under the map follows its width. Edit Mode's minimap Size no longer sizes the map while the Minimap Kit is on."] = "地图的宽度。圆形地图高宽相等，手绘圆环随之缩放。方形地图的边框和区域名保持大小，服务按钮也是（仅在地图太窄放不下时变小），地图下方的任务追踪器跟随其宽度。小地图套件开启时，编辑模式的小地图大小不再决定地图大小。", -- draft
	["How tall the square map is (the round map takes its Width). The shorter side is at least half the longer one."] = "方形地图的高度（圆形地图取其宽度）。短边至少为长边的一半。", -- draft
	-- QuestTracker
	["A quest tracker in the game's tracker's place that scrolls with the mouse wheel, so every watched quest can be reached."] = "在游戏追踪器的位置上放一个可用鼠标滚轮滚动的任务追踪器，让每个追踪的任务都能看到。", -- draft
	["Every watched quest within reach: the tracker scrolls when the list runs long."] = "每个追踪的任务都触手可及：列表变长时追踪器会滚动。", -- draft
	["Tracker"] = "追踪器", -- draft
	["How tall the tracker may grow before it scrolls (at least 88, room for the title and a few lines). Edit Mode's: the height set for the game's tracker in Edit Mode. The grip in its bottom-left corner sets it by dragging."] = "追踪器开始滚动前最多能长多高（至少88，够放标题和几行）。“编辑模式的”：编辑模式中为游戏追踪器设置的高度。拖动左下角的把手即可设置。", -- draft
	["Match The Minimap's Width"] = "与小地图同宽", -- draft
	["The tracker as wide on the screen as the minimap (the round map's width, or the square map's frame) and, unless you moved it yourself, right under it: it moves and changes size with the map (the Minimap Kit's Width and Height). Needs the Minimap Kit. Off: the Width below, under the game's tracker's place."] = "追踪器在屏幕上与小地图同宽（圆形地图的宽度或方形地图的边框），并且除非你自己移动过，紧贴在它下方：随地图移动和改变大小（小地图套件的宽度和高度）。需要小地图套件。关闭：使用下方的宽度，位于游戏追踪器的位置。", -- draft
	["How wide the tracker is when it does not match the minimap's width (at least 60). Edit Mode's: as wide as the game's tracker. The grip in its bottom-left corner sets width and height by dragging (only the height while it matches the minimap)."] = "不与小地图同宽时追踪器的宽度（至少60）。“编辑模式的”：与游戏追踪器同宽。拖动左下角的把手可设置宽度和高度（与小地图同宽时只能设置高度）。", -- draft
	["The size of the quest titles and the section headers (the headers in the Fonts module's title face, which draws them larger); the objectives are one size smaller. The Fonts' Titles & headers size does not change it."] = "任务标题和分区标题的大小（分区标题使用字体模块的标题字体，绘制得更大）；目标小一号。字体中的“标题和题头大小”不影响它。", -- draft
	["Header Text Size"] = "标题文字大小", -- draft
	["The size of the tracker's title, Objectives (in the Fonts module's title face, which draws it larger). The Fonts' Titles & headers size does not change it."] = "追踪器标题“目标”的大小（使用字体模块的标题字体，绘制得更大）。字体中的“标题和题头大小”不影响它。", -- draft
	["Scroll Step"] = "滚动步长", -- draft
	["How far one turn of the mouse wheel scrolls."] = "鼠标滚轮滚一格滚动多远。", -- draft
	["Show a quest's usable item beside it. A click uses it out of combat."] = "在任务旁显示它的可用物品。脱离战斗时点击即可使用。", -- draft
	["Progress Motion"] = "进度动画", -- draft
	["A count going up rolls over to its new number as a soft light runs along its line; a finished objective gets a tick drawn in its dash's place; a finished quest's last count rolls first, then a light runs over its title, its mark turns over to the hand-in ? and its turn-in line comes in. Off: the lines change at once, with their dashes. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "计数增加时翻到新数字，同时一道柔光沿该行划过；完成的目标在短横线处画上对勾；完成的任务先翻动最后一个计数，然后一道光扫过标题，标记翻转为交任务的?，交任务行随之出现。关闭：各行立即改变，保留短横线。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	["Nearest First"] = "最近的在前", -- draft
	["Nearest Quest First"] = "最近的任务在前", -- draft
	["The nearest quest on top, the one you follow above it; quests with no place known after them. The arrow by the tracker's title switches it too. Needs Route."] = "最近的任务在顶部，你追随的任务在它上方；不知道地点的任务排在后面。追踪器标题旁的箭头也能切换。需要路线。", -- draft
	["Distances"] = "距离", -- draft
	["How far each quest is, beside its name: its objectives, or the one who takes it once it is done. The quest you follow shows the way along its route. Needs Route."] = "每个任务名旁显示它有多远：它的目标，或完成后接收它的人。你追随的任务显示沿路线的方向。需要路线。", -- draft
	["Turn-in Line"] = "交任务行", -- draft
	["A quest ready to turn in says who takes it and where, for example: Turn in: Gryan Stoutmantle, Sentinel Hill."] = "可以交的任务会说明谁接收以及在哪里，例如：交任务：格里安·斯托曼，哨兵岭。", -- draft
	["Reset Position"] = "重置位置", -- draft
	["back under the minimap (or on the game's tracker's place)"] = "回到小地图下方（或游戏追踪器的位置）", -- draft
	-- ErrorFilter
	["Hide the red error messages you choose, such as \"Not enough energy\" or \"Spell is not ready yet\", from the middle of the screen."] = "从屏幕中央隐藏你选择的红色错误信息，例如“能量值不足”或“法术还没有准备好。”。", -- draft
	["Quiet, please. The red shouts in the middle of the screen, a kind at a time."] = "请安静。屏幕中央的红色叫喊，一类一类地关掉。", -- draft
	["Hide"] = "隐藏", -- draft
	["Not Enough Resources"] = "资源不足", -- draft
	["Not enough energy, rage, mana or focus, and no combo points."] = "能量、怒气、法力或集中值不足，以及没有连击点数。", -- draft
	["Not Ready Yet"] = "尚未就绪", -- draft
	["Ability, spell or item is not ready yet."] = "技能、法术或物品尚未就绪。", -- draft
	["Out Of Range"] = "超出范围", -- draft
	["Out of range, too far away, too close."] = "超出范围、距离太远、距离太近。", -- draft
	["Facing And Target"] = "朝向和目标", -- draft
	["Facing the wrong way, target needs to be in front of you, no target, invalid target, target not in line of sight."] = "面朝方向错误、目标必须在你面前、没有目标、无效目标、目标不在视野中。", -- draft
	["Busy Or Moving"] = "忙碌或移动中", -- draft
	["Another action is in progress, can't do that while moving, while stunned or while mounted."] = "另一个动作正在进行，移动、昏迷或骑乘时无法那么做。", -- draft
	-- Auras
	["Your own buff and debuff rows on the target frame, enemy nameplates and at your buffs, drawn by the game so they keep working in combat."] = "在目标框体、敌方姓名板和你的增益处显示你自己的增益和减益行，由游戏绘制，因此战斗中也能工作。", -- draft
	["Buffs and debuffs in rows of your own, drawn by the game itself, so they never go dark in a fight."] = "增益和减益排在你自己的行里，由游戏本身绘制，战斗中从不变暗。", -- draft
	["MelloUI's own rows of buffs and debuffs: yours in place of the game's buff bar, the target's under its frame, your debuffs on enemy nameplates."] = "MelloUI自己的增益和减益行：你的代替游戏的增益栏，目标的在其框体下方，你的减益在敌方姓名板上。", -- draft
	["Your Buffs And Debuffs"] = "你的增益和减益效果", -- draft
	["Your buffs, then your debuffs on a row of their own. Right-click a buff to cancel it. Beside the minimap, or where the game's buff bar is: that bar comes back while Edit Mode is open, so it can still be moved, and these follow it."] = "你的增益，然后减益另起一行。右键增益可取消它。在小地图旁或游戏增益栏的位置：编辑模式打开时那个栏会回来，仍可移动，这些行跟随它。", -- draft
	["Attach To The Minimap Column"] = "贴附小地图栏", -- draft
	["Your buffs in a line beside the minimap, level with the map's top and growing away from it, your debuffs on the line under them. They follow the minimap when it moves or changes size. Needs the Minimap Kit; off, they stand where the game's buff bar is."] = "你的增益在小地图旁排成一行，与地图顶端齐平并向远离地图的方向增长，减益在下一行。小地图移动或改变大小时跟随它。需要小地图套件；关闭时它们位于游戏增益栏的位置。", -- draft
	["Attach To The Player Frame"] = "贴附玩家框体", -- draft
	["Your debuffs, then your buffs and weapon buffs, under your player frame, as the target's are under the target frame: the same icons, spiral and timers. Right-click a buff to cancel it. They move with the player frame. Off, they stand beside the minimap or where the game's buff bar is."] = "你的减益，然后增益和武器增益，位于你的玩家框体下方，就像目标的在目标框体下方：同样的图标、旋转和计时。右键增益可取消它。随玩家框体移动。关闭时它们位于小地图旁或游戏增益栏的位置。", -- draft
	["Direction"] = "方向", -- draft
	["Which way your icons run under the player frame: from the bars' left end rightwards, or from their right end leftwards."] = "玩家框体下方图标排列的方向：从条的左端向右，或从右端向左。", -- draft
	["Left To Right"] = "从左到右", -- draft
	["Right To Left"] = "从右到左", -- draft
	["Icon Size On The Frame"] = "框体上的图标大小", -- draft
	["The size of your buff and debuff icons under the player frame, in pixels (the target's are 22 by default). The rows keep one width, so a smaller size fits more in a row."] = "玩家框体下方增益和减益图标的大小（像素；目标的默认为22）。行宽保持不变，所以尺寸越小一行放得越多。", -- draft
	["Target"] = "目标", -- draft
	["Your target's debuffs, then its buffs, under the target frame, in place of the game's."] = "你目标的减益，然后它的增益，位于目标框体下方，代替游戏的。", -- draft
	["The size of your target's debuff and buff icons under its frame, in pixels. The rows keep one width, so a smaller size fits more in a row."] = "目标框体下方目标减益和增益图标的大小（像素）。行宽保持不变，所以尺寸越小一行放得越多。", -- draft
	["Only My Debuffs"] = "只显示我的减益", -- draft
