	["Character Panel"] = "角色面板", -- draft
	["The character window dressed in the painted kit: stone frame, slot rims, framed panes and stats, all on the game's own layout."] = "角色窗口穿上手绘套件：石框、栏位边缘、带框的窗格和属性，全部在游戏自己的布局上。", -- draft
	["Stone, iron and a window on the world. Your character, framed the way it deserves."] = "石、铁和一扇看向世界的窗。你的角色，配得上的边框。", -- draft
	["Window Background"] = "窗口背景", -- draft
	["What the character window shows behind everything: its own stone, or stone, cracked concrete, iron plate, leather or dark. Parchment is Oldschool > Parchment's Character Window: under the right pane, or over the whole window (on its own stone, whatever this shows). The equipment slots, the progress bars and the side tabs wear the borders of Oldschool > Borders (every window's)."] = "角色窗口在一切后面显示的东西：它自己的石材，或石材、裂纹水泥、铁板、皮革或深色。羊皮纸属于Oldschool > 羊皮纸的“角色窗口”：铺在右侧窗格下，或整个窗口上（在它自己的石材上，无论这里显示什么）。装备栏位、进度条和侧边标签使用Oldschool > 边框中的边框（每个窗口通用）。", -- draft
