	["Recipe List Background"] = "配方列表背景", -- draft
	["What the recipe list shows behind its rows: its darker list stone, or one of the other backgrounds. All three are chosen with pictures on Windows > Professions. The reagent slots wear the Button Border, the rank bar the Progress Bar Border, the finished item the Round Border (Oldschool > Borders, every window's)."] = "配方列表在各行后面显示的东西：它自己更深的列表石材，或其他背景之一。三项都在窗口 > 专业中用图片选择。材料栏位使用按钮边框，等级条使用进度条边框，成品使用圆形边框（Oldschool > 边框，每个窗口通用）。", -- draft
