	["A backdrop round the player, target and focus frames: stone behind the portrait, the name and the bars, framed by the red or iron gems of the action bars' backdrops or by one of the border styles of Look > Borders (its inner corners mitred)."] = "玩家、目标和焦点框体周围的底板：头像、名字和条后面的石材，由动作条底板的红色或铁色宝石，或外观 > 边框中的一种边框样式（内角斜切）围起来。", -- draft
