	-- ActionBarPanel
	["Action Bars Kit"] = "动作条套件", -- draft
	["The action bars, micro menu, bag bar and experience bars dressed in the painted kit on the game's own layout."] = "动作条、微型菜单、背包栏和经验条在游戏自己的布局上穿上手绘套件。", -- draft
	["The border of the backdrop round the action bars (and the experience and reputation bars): the red or iron gems on its corners, or one of the border styles of Oldschool > Borders (drawn heavy, its inner corners mitred). Each element's backdrop is switched on on Bars (its Backdrop); switched-on elements placed together share one backdrop, in the look of the first of them: Action Bar 1, the other bars, the micro menu, the bag bar."] = "动作条（以及经验条和声望条）周围底板的边框：角上的红色或铁色宝石，或Oldschool > 边框中的一种边框样式（画得较粗，内角斜切）。每个元素的底板在“条”中开启（它的底板）；放在一起的已开启元素共用一个底板，外观取第一个：动作条1、其他条、微型菜单、背包栏。", -- draft
	["Backdrop Background"] = "底板背景", -- draft
	["What lies behind the buttons inside the backdrop. All three are chosen with pictures on Oldschool > Frame Art."] = "底板内按钮后面的东西。三项都在Oldschool > 框体美术中用图片选择。", -- draft
	["Button Background"] = "按钮背景", -- draft
	["What a button shows inside its rim where it has no icon."] = "按钮在没有图标时其边缘内显示的东西。", -- draft
	["The border of the backdrop round the micro menu: the red or iron gems on its corners, or one of the border styles of Oldschool > Borders (drawn heavy, its inner corners mitred). Each element's backdrop is switched on on Bars (its Backdrop); switched-on elements placed together share one backdrop, in the look of the first of them: Action Bar 1, the other bars, the micro menu, the bag bar."] = "微型菜单周围底板的边框：角上的红色或铁色宝石，或Oldschool > 边框中的一种边框样式（画得较粗，内角斜切）。每个元素的底板在“条”中开启（它的底板）；放在一起的已开启元素共用一个底板，外观取第一个：动作条1、其他条、微型菜单、背包栏。", -- draft
	["The border of the backdrop round the bag bar: the red or iron gems on its corners, or one of the border styles of Oldschool > Borders (drawn heavy, its inner corners mitred). Each element's backdrop is switched on on Bars (its Backdrop); switched-on elements placed together share one backdrop, in the look of the first of them: Action Bar 1, the other bars, the micro menu, the bag bar."] = "背包栏周围底板的边框：角上的红色或铁色宝石，或Oldschool > 边框中的一种边框样式（画得较粗，内角斜切）。每个元素的底板在“条”中开启（它的底板）；放在一起的已开启元素共用一个底板，外观取第一个：动作条1、其他条、微型菜单、背包栏。", -- draft
	-- BackpackPanel
	["Backpack Kit"] = "行囊套件", -- draft
	["The bag windows dressed in the painted kit on the game's own layout."] = "背包窗口在游戏自己的布局上穿上手绘套件。", -- draft
	["What the bag windows show behind the items (Bags by Kind's window too, and the bank): cracked concrete (the window's own), stone, iron plate, parchment, leather or dark."] = "背包窗口在物品后面显示的东西（背包分类窗口和银行也是）：裂纹水泥（窗口自己的）、石材、铁板、羊皮纸、皮革或深色。", -- draft
	["Item Background"] = "物品背景", -- draft
	["What an empty bag slot shows inside its rim. Both are chosen with pictures on Windows > Bags. The slots' rim is the Button Border (Oldschool > Borders, every window's)."] = "空背包栏位在其边缘内显示的东西。两项都在窗口 > 背包中用图片选择。栏位边缘为按钮边框（Oldschool > 边框，每个窗口通用）。", -- draft
