	-- TooltipPanel
	["Tooltip Kit"] = "鼠标提示套件", -- draft
	["Tooltips dressed in the painted kit: the stone box with the single rail, the unit health bar in the bracket."] = "鼠标提示穿上手绘套件：带单石条的石框，支架中的单位生命条。", -- draft
	-- NameplatePanel
	["Nameplate Kit"] = "姓名板套件", -- draft
	["Nameplates dressed in the painted kit: the health bar in the bracket, the cast bar on the single rail, the level circle on the orb."] = "姓名板穿上手绘套件：支架中的生命条，单石条上的施法条，宝珠上的等级圆圈。", -- draft
	["Whole Plate Shade"] = "整块牌子阴影", -- draft
	["The UI Shade also follows the painted plate's own shape: round the level circle, round each end gem and along the bar, in every Nameplate Border look. It needs the UI Shade on (Look); its Shade Strength sets how dark it is. The name's own band is Nameplates' Name Shade."] = "界面阴影也会跟随手绘牌子自身的形状：环绕等级圆圈、环绕两端的每颗宝石并沿着条，适用于每种姓名板边框外观。需要开启界面阴影（外观）；它的阴影强度决定有多暗。名字自己的横带是姓名板的“名字阴影”。", -- draft
	["Elites, rares, rare elites and bosses stand out: a metal line over the name with a crest on it. Gold with a crown and wings for an elite, silver with a star for a rare, silver with a gold star and wings for a rare elite, and red-bronze scrollwork with a skull, winged at both ends, for a boss. The plate itself keeps its look."] = "精英、稀有、稀有精英和首领一眼可见：名字上方一条带纹章的金属线。精英为带王冠和翅膀的金色，稀有为带星的银色，稀有精英为带金星和翅膀的银色，首领为带骷髅、两端有翼的红铜卷纹。牌子本身保持原样。", -- draft
	-- Chat
	["Clean chat: hidden background and input art, short coloured channel tags, class coloured names."] = "简洁的聊天：隐藏背景和输入框美术，简短的彩色频道标签，职业颜色名字。", -- draft
	["Less frame, more talk. Short channel tags and class colours keep the log readable."] = "少点边框，多点聊天。简短的频道标签和职业颜色让记录易读。", -- draft
	["Chat View"] = "聊天视图", -- draft
	["How the chat is shown. Game Windows: the game's chat windows and tabs. Minimal: one panel with a rail of round tabs on its left (one per chat window, a count of the lines you have not seen; Whispers last), each line under its sender's name, channel and time, and a row of round buttons under the lines: Say, Party, Raid, Instance, Guild, Yell, Whisper and Emote open the line you type in on that chat, then Channels, Friends, the fight history and these settings. A whisper puts a count on the Whispers tab and shows the Whispers widget; either opens one whisper window above the chat with every conversation in it, theirs left and yours right. Parchment (its own switch) puts both on the parchment sheet."] = "聊天的显示方式。游戏窗口：游戏的聊天窗口和标签。极简：一个面板，左侧是一排圆形标签（每个聊天窗口一个，显示你未看的行数；悄悄话在最后），每行在发送者名字、频道和时间下方，各行下面是一排圆形按钮：说、小队、团队、副本、公会、大喊、悄悄话和表情会打开对应聊天的输入行，然后是频道、好友、战斗历史和这些设置。一条悄悄话会在悄悄话标签上显示计数并显示悄悄话小部件；任一项都会在聊天上方打开一个包含所有对话的悄悄话窗口，对方的在左，你的在右。羊皮纸（它自己的开关）把两者都铺到羊皮纸上。", -- draft
	["Game Windows"] = "游戏窗口", -- draft
	["Minimal"] = "极简", -- draft
	["The chat windows' background: a dark panel of the palette behind the window, its tabs and its input box (Dark), the game's own (Game), or none at all (None). Under the painted chat (its Painted Skin, the reskin on) its stone instead. With the Minimal Chat View: None leaves its panel clear, Dark and Game keep its dark panel; Parchment lays the parchment sheet over it."] = "聊天窗口的背景：窗口、标签和输入框后面的配色深色面板（深色），游戏自己的（游戏），或完全没有（无）。在手绘聊天下（它的手绘皮肤，换肤开启）改用它的石材。使用极简聊天视图时：无让它的面板透明，深色和游戏保留它的深色面板；羊皮纸在上面铺一张羊皮纸。", -- draft
	["Set The Background Opacity"] = "统一背景不透明度", -- draft
	["Give every chat window the same background opacity, kept in your profile. Off, each window keeps the opacity set in its tab's menu."] = "让每个聊天窗口使用相同的背景不透明度，保存在你的配置中。关闭时每个窗口保留其标签菜单中设置的不透明度。", -- draft
	["Background Opacity"] = "背景不透明度", -- draft
	["How solid the chat windows' background is. Moving the Background slider in a chat tab's menu changes this too."] = "聊天窗口背景有多实。在聊天标签菜单中移动“背景”滑块也会改变它。", -- draft
	["Border Opacity"] = "边框不透明度", -- draft
	["How solid the painted border round the chat windows and their button column is, and its shade (the painted chat: its Painted Skin, the reskin on)."] = "聊天窗口及其按钮栏周围手绘边框有多实，以及它的阴影（手绘聊天：它的手绘皮肤，换肤开启）。", -- draft
	["Hide Input Box Art"] = "隐藏输入框美术", -- draft
	["Hide the border and background art of the chat input box."] = "隐藏聊天输入框的边框和背景美术。", -- draft
	["Hide Tab Background"] = "隐藏标签背景", -- draft
	["Hide the background art behind the chat tabs. The tab text stays."] = "隐藏聊天标签后面的背景美术。标签文字保留。", -- draft
	["Tabs Only On Mouseover"] = "仅鼠标悬停时显示标签", -- draft
	["Chat tab names are invisible until the mouse is over the chat. Tabs flashing with new whispers stay visible. It adds to the Fader's Chat fade: both fade the tabs, so with both on the two fades multiply. Does nothing under the painted chat (its Painted Skin, the reskin on), which keeps its tabs shown."] = "鼠标不在聊天上时聊天标签名字不可见。因新悄悄话闪烁的标签保持可见。它叠加在淡出功能的聊天淡出上：两者都会淡出标签，两者都开启时淡出效果相乘。在手绘聊天下（它的手绘皮肤，换肤开启）不起作用，那里的标签一直显示。", -- draft
	["Input Box On Top"] = "输入框在上方", -- draft
	["Move the chat input box above the chat window and its tabs instead of below it."] = "把聊天输入框移到聊天窗口及其标签的上方，而不是下方。", -- draft
	["Input Box Only While Typing"] = "仅在打字时显示输入框", -- draft
	["The chat input box shows only while you type: Enter (or /) brings it up, and it goes again once you send the line or press Escape. It sets the game's Chat Style to Classic while on, and gives your own back when off. The change shows from the next line you type."] = "聊天输入框只在你打字时显示：按回车（或/）调出，发送这一行或按Esc后消失。开启时把游戏的聊天风格设为经典，关闭时恢复你自己的设置。从你输入的下一行开始生效。", -- draft
	["Chat Buttons"] = "聊天按钮", -- draft
	["The game's chat buttons in their column left of the chat: Friends at the top, Channels, the chat menu (Say, Party, Guild, Yell, whisper and reply, emotes, and the language you speak). While you speak more than one language, the one you speak shows at the right end of the line you type in. Off: the column is hidden."] = "聊天左侧一列中的游戏聊天按钮：顶部是好友，然后是频道、聊天菜单（说、小队、公会、大喊、悄悄话和回复、表情以及你说的语言）。当你会说多种语言时，正在使用的语言显示在输入行的右端。关闭：隐藏这一列。", -- draft
	["Smooth Scrolling"] = "平滑滚动", -- draft
	["The mouse wheel glides the chat text up and down instead of jumping a line at a time, in the chat windows and the whisper windows. Off, or with Reduce Motion on, it jumps as before."] = "在聊天窗口和悄悄话窗口中，鼠标滚轮让聊天文字上下滑动，而不是一次跳一行。关闭或开启“减少动态效果”时照旧跳动。", -- draft
	["Channels"] = "频道", -- draft
	["Short Channel Tags"] = "简短频道标签", -- draft
	["Replace [Guild], [Party], [1. General] and so on with short, saturated coloured tags."] = "把[公会]、[小队]、[1. 综合]等替换为简短、饱和的彩色标签。", -- draft
	["Hide Brackets"] = "隐藏方括号", -- draft
	["Also remove the square brackets around the short channel tags."] = "同时去掉简短频道标签周围的方括号。", -- draft
	["Whisper Popup Window"] = "悄悄话弹窗", -- draft
	["A whisper opens a small window of its own, one per person, with the conversation and a box to answer in, instead of a new chat tab. Whispers still show in the main chat. Switching it off puts the game's own whisper setting back."] = "悄悄话会打开一个独立的小窗口，每人一个，带有对话和回复框，而不是新的聊天标签。悄悄话仍会显示在主聊天中。关闭后恢复游戏自己的悄悄话设置。", -- draft
	-- CombatText
	["The text that floats over your character in a fight (damage taken, heals, Dodge and Parry, procs, resources gained) in MelloUI's look, in one of three styles, or the game's own."] = "战斗中浮在你角色上方的文字（受到的伤害、治疗、躲闪和招架、触发、获得的资源），使用MelloUI的外观，三种风格之一，或游戏自己的。", -- draft
	["Your hits taken, heals and procs in MelloUI's soft look, or the game's own text."] = "你受到的打击、治疗和触发，使用MelloUI柔和的外观，或游戏自己的文字。", -- draft
	["Combat Text Style"] = "战斗文字风格", -- draft
	["Who draws the text over your character. Game: the game's own, as it always was. Lanes: damage taken falls on your left, healing rises on your right, procs and Dodge / Parry above your head, resources under your feet. Feed: one column over your portrait, the newest on top. Classic: one stream over your head, like the game's, in MelloUI's font and soft shade."] = "由谁绘制你角色上方的文字。游戏：游戏自己的，一如既往。分道：受到的伤害落在你左侧，治疗从右侧升起，触发和躲闪 / 招架在头顶，资源在脚下。信息流：头像上方一列，最新的在最上面。经典：头顶一道文字流，和游戏的一样，但使用MelloUI的字体和柔和阴影。", -- draft
	["Game (Blizzard)"] = "游戏（暴雪）", -- draft
	["Lanes: round your character"] = "分道：围绕你的角色", -- draft
	["Feed: over your portrait"] = "信息流：在你的头像上方", -- draft
	["Classic: one stream, restyled"] = "经典：一道文字流，换了新样式", -- draft
	["Your Damage"] = "你的伤害", -- draft
	["The numbers of the damage you deal, over the enemies. Game: the game's own numbers, as always. Rise, Beside, Fan or Stack: drawn by MelloUI at each enemy's nameplate in its soft look, the game's numbers switched off meanwhile: crits gold and bigger, spells violet, a dodge or parry as a word, about a second and a half each, only on enemies you or your pet are fighting. Beside starts them at the plate's right end, so the name stays readable. Rise, Beside, Fan and Stack draw your hits while you play solo. In a group, or where the game keeps threat hidden, the game's own numbers show, because only they know whose hit it is. With enemy nameplates off, the game's own numbers show too (the plates are where MelloUI draws)."] = "你造成的伤害数字，显示在敌人上方。游戏：游戏自己的数字，一如既往。上升、侧边、扇形或堆叠：由MelloUI以柔和外观在每个敌人的姓名板处绘制，同时关闭游戏的数字：暴击为金色且更大，法术为紫色，躲闪或招架显示为文字，每个约一秒半，只在你或你的宠物正在战斗的敌人上。“侧边”从姓名板右端开始，让名字保持可读。上升、侧边、扇形和堆叠在你单人游戏时绘制你的打击。在队伍中，或游戏隐藏仇恨的地方，显示游戏自己的数字，因为只有它们知道是谁的打击。关闭敌方姓名板时也显示游戏自己的数字（MelloUI是在姓名板处绘制的）。", -- draft
	["Rise: up from the enemy"] = "上升：从敌人身上向上", -- draft
	["Beside: up from the plate's side"] = "侧边：从姓名板侧边向上", -- draft
	["Fan: up, left and right"] = "扇形：向上、左和右", -- draft
	["Stack: a column beside the enemy"] = "堆叠：敌人旁的一列", -- draft
	["Your Damage Size"] = "你的伤害大小", -- draft
	["The size of Your Damage's numbers over the enemies (Rise, Beside, Fan and Stack), whatever the text around you. 70% by default."] = "敌人上方“你的伤害”数字的大小（上升、侧边、扇形和堆叠），与你周围的文字无关。默认70%。", -- draft
	["Plays a few made-up lines (hits, a crit, heals, a Dodge, a proc) in the chosen style, so you can compare them without a fight. Also /mello combattext test."] = "以所选风格播放几行虚构的文字（命中、一次暴击、治疗、一次躲闪、一次触发），无需战斗即可比较。也可用/mello combattext test。", -- draft
	["a short burst in the chosen style"] = "以所选风格播放一小段", -- draft
	["Text Around You"] = "你周围的文字", -- draft
	["The size of the text around your character in the Lanes, Feed and Classic styles. Crits are a third bigger. The Fonts' Interface text and Titles & headers sizes do not change it (only their faces). The numbers over the enemies have their own size: Numbers Over Enemies."] = "分道、信息流和经典风格中你角色周围文字的大小。暴击大三分之一。字体中的“界面文字”和“标题和题头”大小不影响它（只影响字体本身）。敌人上方的数字有自己的大小：敌人头上的数字。", -- draft
	["Notices In Title Font"] = "通知使用标题字体", -- draft
	["Procs and auras in the title font, as the window titles. Off: in the text font, as the numbers."] = "触发和光环使用标题字体，与窗口标题相同。关闭：使用文字字体，与数字相同。", -- draft
	["Shade Size"] = "阴影大小", -- draft
	["The size of the soft shade behind the combat text, the text over you and Your Damage alike. 100% is the notices' shade; less hugs the numbers closer; 0% shows none."] = "战斗文字背后柔和阴影的大小，你上方的文字和“你的伤害”都适用。100%为通知的阴影；更小则更贴近数字；0%不显示。", -- draft
	["Lane Spread"] = "分道间距", -- draft
	["How far from your character the damage and healing lanes run, left and right. Move the whole text in Edit Layout."] = "伤害和治疗分道在左右两侧离你的角色多远。在“编辑布局”中移动整体文字。", -- draft
	["Most Lines"] = "最多行数", -- draft
	["The most lines around your character at once: per lane for Lanes, in the stream for Classic, in the column for Feed. The oldest goes first. Your Damage keeps its own count per enemy."] = "你角色周围同时显示的最多行数：分道风格按每条分道，经典风格按文字流，信息流风格按那一列。最旧的先消失。“你的伤害”对每个敌人单独计数。", -- draft
	["Damage Taken"] = "受到的伤害", -- draft
	["The damage you take, crits bigger."] = "你受到的伤害，暴击更大。", -- draft
	["The healing you get, and shields put on you."] = "你获得的治疗，以及加在你身上的护盾。", -- draft
	["Procs & Auras"] = "触发和光环", -- draft
	["Abilities that light up (Overpower!), auras you gain or lose, interrupts and dispels."] = "亮起的技能（压制！）、获得或失去的光环、打断和驱散。", -- draft
	["Dodge, Parry & Block"] = "躲闪、招架和格挡", -- draft
	["Attacks that miss you: misses, dodges, parries, blocks, absorbs, resists and immunes."] = "没打中你的攻击：未命中、躲闪、招架、格挡、吸收、抵抗和免疫。", -- draft
	["Resources Gained"] = "获得的资源", -- draft
	["Mana, rage, energy and focus you gain (+12 Rage)."] = "你获得的法力、怒气、能量和集中值（+12怒气）。", -- draft
	["Entering & Leaving Combat"] = "进入和离开战斗", -- draft
	["A short line when a fight starts and when it ends."] = "战斗开始和结束时一行短文字。", -- draft
	["Reputation & Honor"] = "声望和荣誉", -- draft
	["Reputation and honor you gain."] = "你获得的声望和荣誉。", -- draft
	["Damage Over Enemies"] = "敌人头上的伤害", -- draft
	["The numbers of your damage over the enemies (the game's own setting: drawn by the game in the Game Numbers Font, at Numbers Over Enemies' size)."] = "敌人头上你的伤害数字（游戏自己的设置：由游戏用游戏数字字体绘制，大小为“敌人头上的数字”）。", -- draft
	["DoT Ticks Over Enemies"] = "敌人头上的持续伤害跳数", -- draft
	["Your damage over time ticks over the enemies (the game's own setting)."] = "敌人头上你的持续伤害跳数（游戏自己的设置）。", -- draft
	["Pet Damage Over Enemies"] = "敌人头上的宠物伤害", -- draft
	["Your pet's damage over the enemies (the game's own setting)."] = "敌人头上你宠物的伤害（游戏自己的设置）。", -- draft
	["Healing Over Friends"] = "友方头上的治疗", -- draft
	["The numbers of your healing over the ones you heal (the game's own setting)."] = "你治疗对象头上你的治疗数字（游戏自己的设置）。", -- draft
	-- HealFlight
	["Heal Effects"] = "治疗效果", -- draft
	["Your heals on your group as light: a cast heal gathers on your cast bar and flies to the frame of the one you heal; an instant one lands on their frame at once. Each kind lands its own way: heals over time, shields, protection, a heal to full, a resurrection."] = "你对队伍的治疗化作光：读条治疗在你的施法条上汇聚，飞向你治疗对象的框体；瞬发治疗直接落在其框体上。每种治疗都有自己的落点方式：持续治疗、护盾、保护、满血治疗、复活。", -- draft
	["Your heals fly from your cast bar to the frame of the one you heal."] = "你的治疗从施法条飞向你治疗对象的框体。", -- draft
	["How your heals look. By Class: Holy for priests and paladins, Nature for druids, Water for shamans (Holy for anyone else). Water: water circles your cast bar, a winding stream throws off droplets, a splash lands; a shield is a water bubble, a heal to full a geyser. Holy: gold sparks spiral into your spell's icon, a gold comet flies, a white flash and a burst of rays land, rune marks linger round the frame. Nature: green and gold ribbons circle your cast bar, ribbons fly shedding leaves, leaves burst and rise. Quiet: your cast bar's fill glows, a thin thread of light flies, the frame's border flares. Each kind lands its own way in each look: a heal over time sinks in, a shield wraps the frame in a barrier, protection puts a crest over it, a heal to full raises a column of light, a resurrection lights the fallen one's frame."] = "你的治疗看起来的样子。按职业：牧师和圣骑士为神圣，德鲁伊为自然，萨满为水（其他职业为神圣）。水：水流环绕你的施法条，一道蜿蜒的水流甩出水滴，落下一片水花；护盾是一个水泡，满血治疗是一道间歇泉。神圣：金色火花螺旋汇入你的法术图标，一颗金色彗星飞出，落下白色闪光和一束光芒，符文印记在框体周围停留。自然：绿金丝带环绕你的施法条，丝带一路洒落树叶飞去，树叶迸开升起。低调：施法条的填充发光，一缕细光飞出，框体边框亮起。每种类型在每种外观中都有自己的落点：持续治疗渗入，护盾用屏障包住框体，保护在其上放一个纹章，满血治疗升起一道光柱，复活点亮倒下之人的框体。", -- draft
	["By Class: Holy, Nature or Water"] = "按职业：神圣、自然或水", -- draft
	["Holy: a gold comet"] = "神圣：一颗金色彗星", -- draft
	["Nature: ribbons and leaves"] = "自然：丝带和树叶", -- draft
	["Water: a stream and a splash"] = "水：一道水流和一片水花", -- draft
	["Quiet: a thread of light"] = "低调：一缕细光", -- draft
	["Flying Light"] = "飞行之光", -- draft
	["The light that flies from your cast bar to the frame when a cast heal ends (Chain Heal's hops too). Off: the heal lands on the frame the moment the cast ends, as an instant one does; the glow on your cast bar while you cast and every effect on the frames stay."] = "读条治疗结束时从施法条飞向框体的光（治疗链的跳跃也是）。关闭：施法结束的瞬间治疗就落在框体上，就像瞬发一样；施法时施法条上的光晕和框体上的所有效果保留。", -- draft
	["Heal Over Time Ticks"] = "持续治疗跳动", -- draft
	["While a heal over time of yours runs (Renew, Rejuvenation, Regrowth's), each of its ticks plays a small pulse on the frame: a ring and three motes (Holy), a leaf (Nature), a drop and a ripple (Water), the border's breath (Quiet, and in a raid). Timed from the game's spell data: Renew ticks five times in 15 seconds."] = "你的持续治疗生效期间（恢复、回春术、愈合的持续部分），每跳都会在框体上播放一个小脉动：一个环和三颗光点（神圣）、一片叶子（自然）、一滴水和一圈涟漪（水）、边框的呼吸（低调，以及团队中）。时机取自游戏的法术数据：恢复在15秒内跳五次。", -- draft
	["Plays the chosen look once: the light gathers where your cast bar stands and flies to your own frame in your party or raid frames (or your player frame); with Flying Light off it lands there at once."] = "播放一次所选外观：光在你施法条的位置汇聚，飞向小队或团队框体中你自己的框体（或你的玩家框体）；关闭飞行之光时直接落在那里。", -- draft
	["a made-up heal on you"] = "一次虚构的、施加在你身上的治疗", -- draft
	["Every Kind"] = "每种类型", -- draft
	["Plays each kind's landing on your own frame, one after another: a heal over time, a shield, protection, a heal to full, a resurrection."] = "在你自己的框体上依次播放每种类型的落点：持续治疗、护盾、保护、满血治疗、复活。", -- draft
	["each kind's landing on your frame"] = "每种类型在你框体上的落点", -- draft
	-- FrameEffects
	["Cooldown Effects"] = "冷却效果", -- draft
	["Your group's frames show their big moments: a roar's square ripples, a taunt, Shield Wall's steel, Last Stand's heartbeat, an immunity's barrier, an evasion's afterimages -- on your own frame when you use one, on a group mate's when they do."] = "你队伍的框体显示它们的高光时刻：怒吼的方形波纹、嘲讽、盾墙的钢铁、破釜沉舟的心跳、免疫的屏障、闪避的残影——你使用时在你自己的框体上，队友使用时在队友的框体上。", -- draft
	["Shield Wall, Last Stand, a roar: your group's frames show their big moments."] = "盾墙、破釜沉舟、一声怒吼：你队伍的框体显示它们的高光时刻。", -- draft
	["Every Effect"] = "每种效果", -- draft
	["Plays each kind on your own frame, one after another, its name and an example on the screen: a roar (Challenging Shout), a taunt, damage taken down (Shield Wall), more health (Last Stand), an immunity, a dodge or parry (Evasion)."] = "在你自己的框体上依次播放每种类型，并在屏幕上显示它的名字和一个例子：怒吼（挑战怒吼）、嘲讽、减少受到的伤害（盾墙）、更多生命值（破釜沉舟）、免疫、躲闪或招架（闪避）。", -- draft
	["each kind on your own frame"] = "每种类型在你自己的框体上", -- draft
	["Whose"] = "谁的", -- draft
	["Whose big moments play on the frames. Yours: when you use one (Challenging Shout, Shield Wall, Last Stand, Divine Shield, Evasion ...), your own frame in your party or raid frames plays its effect for as long as it lasts (a roar: 2 seconds). Your group's: when someone of your party or raid uses one, their frame plays it -- you see at a glance who just used Shield Wall or Divine Shield, and whose roar just pulled."] = "框体上播放谁的高光时刻。你的：当你使用时（挑战怒吼、盾墙、破釜沉舟、圣盾术、闪避……），小队或团队框体中你自己的框体在其持续期间播放效果（怒吼：2秒）。你队伍的：当你的小队或团队中有人使用时，他的框体播放它——一眼就能看出谁刚开了盾墙或圣盾术，谁的怒吼刚拉了怪。", -- draft
	["Yours And Your Group's"] = "你的和你队伍的", -- draft
	["Yours"] = "你的", -- draft
	["Your Group's"] = "你队伍的", -- draft
	-- GroupFrames
	["Group Frames"] = "小队框体", -- draft
	["MelloUI's own party and raid frames in place of the game's: their size, layout and sorting, every bar's colour (class, your own, by health), the power bar, the texts, and your own aura indicators on them."] = "用MelloUI自己的小队和团队框体代替游戏的：它们的大小、布局和排序，每条的颜色（职业、你自己的、按生命值），能量条，文字，以及上面你自己的光环指示器。", -- draft
	["Your party and raid as you want them: colours, bars, texts, and your HoTs and shields at a glance."] = "随你心意的小队和团队：颜色、条、文字，你的持续治疗和护盾一目了然。", -- draft
	["In A Party"] = "在小队中", -- draft
	["In a party: these frames, or MelloUI's normal party frames (the game's party frames with their portraits, in the painted look). With the normal ones, you show as one of them while solo too (Show Yourself While Solo), so you can see your heals and indicators on it. In a raid these frames show. The normal party frames show as the game's Edit Mode sets them: with Raid-Style Party Frames on there, the game shows none of its normal ones."] = "在小队中：这些框体，或MelloUI的普通小队框体（游戏的带头像小队框体，手绘外观）。使用普通框体时，你单人时也作为其中之一显示（单人时显示自己），这样可以在上面看到你的治疗和指示器。在团队中显示这些框体。普通小队框体按游戏编辑模式的设置显示：如果那里开启了团队样式小队框体，游戏不显示任何普通框体。", -- draft
	["Party Frames (Portraits)"] = "小队框体（头像）", -- draft
	["Show Yourself In Your Party"] = "在小队中显示自己", -- draft
	["Your own frame among your party's."] = "你自己的框体位于队友之中。", -- draft
	["Show Yourself While Solo"] = "单人时显示自己", -- draft
	["While you are not in a group, your own frame stands where your party's will, with your indicators on it. Move it in Edit Layout. With In A Party set to Party Frames, it is a normal party frame where the game's party frames stand (move those in Edit Mode)."] = "不在队伍中时，你自己的框体位于小队框体将出现的位置，上面带有你的指示器。可在“编辑布局”中移动。“在小队中”设为小队框体时，它是位于游戏小队框体位置的普通小队框体（在编辑模式中移动它们）。", -- draft
	["Frame Width"] = "框体宽度", -- draft
	["Each frame's width (the game's raid frame: 72)."] = "每个框体的宽度（游戏的团队框体：72）。", -- draft
	["Frame Height"] = "框体高度", -- draft
	["Each frame's height (the game's raid frame: 36)."] = "每个框体的高度（游戏的团队框体：36）。", -- draft
	["Party Spacing"] = "小队间距", -- draft
	["The room between two of the party's frames. Also on the party's plate in Edit Layout (right-click it)."] = "两个小队框体之间的距离。也可在“编辑布局”中小队的牌子上设置（右键它）。", -- draft
	["Party Grows"] = "小队增长方向", -- draft
	["Which way the party's frames line up from where you placed them."] = "小队框体从你放置的位置向哪个方向排列。", -- draft
	["Party Order"] = "小队顺序", -- draft
	["The order of the party's frames: tanks, then healers, then damage; the game's group order; or by name."] = "小队框体的顺序：坦克，然后治疗者，然后伤害；游戏的队伍顺序；或按名字。", -- draft
	["By Role (Tanks, Healers, Damage)"] = "按职责（坦克、治疗、伤害）", -- draft
	["Group Order"] = "队伍顺序", -- draft
	["By Name"] = "按名字", -- draft
	["Raid Grouping"] = "团队分组", -- draft
	["How the raid's frames are grouped: by raid group (1 to 8), by role, by class, or one list."] = "团队框体的分组方式：按团队小组（1到8）、按职责、按职业，或一个列表。", -- draft
	["By Group"] = "按小组", -- draft
	["By Role"] = "按职责", -- draft
	["By Class"] = "按职业", -- draft
	["One List"] = "一个列表", -- draft
	["Raid Fills"] = "团队填充", -- draft
	["Down a column then the next column across, or across a row then the next row down."] = "先向下填满一列再到下一列，或先横向填满一行再到下一行。", -- draft
	["Down, Then Across"] = "先向下，再横向", -- draft
	["Across, Then Down"] = "先横向，再向下", -- draft
	["Frames Per Column / Row"] = "每列 / 每行框体数", -- draft
	["How many frames in a column (or a row) before the next one starts. 5 lines the raid up by its groups."] = "一列（或一行）放多少个框体后开始下一列。5会按小组排列团队。", -- draft
	["Raid Spacing"] = "团队间距", -- draft
	["The room between two of the raid's frames in a column (or a row). Also on the raid's plate in Edit Layout (right-click it)."] = "一列（或一行）中两个团队框体之间的距离。也可在“编辑布局”中团队的牌子上设置（右键它）。", -- draft
	["Gap Between Columns / Rows"] = "列 / 行间距", -- draft
	["The room between two columns (or rows) of the raid."] = "团队两列（或两行）之间的距离。", -- draft
	["Out Of Range Opacity"] = "超出范围不透明度", -- draft
	["How far a member too far away for your heals fades. 100%: no fade."] = "超出你治疗范围的成员淡出多少。100%：不淡出。", -- draft
	["Health Bar Opacity"] = "生命条不透明度", -- draft
	["How solid the health bar is."] = "生命条有多实。", -- draft
	["Fill Direction"] = "填充方向", -- draft
	["Which way the health and power bars fill."] = "生命条和能量条的填充方向。", -- draft
	["Bottom To Top"] = "从下到上", -- draft
	["Top To Bottom"] = "从上到下", -- draft
	["Smooth Bars"] = "平滑条", -- draft
	["The bars glide to a new value instead of jumping."] = "条平滑过渡到新数值，而不是跳变。", -- draft
	["What lies behind the health bar: a flat colour (Background Colour), one of MelloUI's backgrounds (stone, concrete, parchment, the dark gradients...), or none."] = "生命条后面的东西：纯色（背景颜色）、MelloUI的背景之一（石材、水泥、羊皮纸、深色渐变……），或无。", -- draft
	["Flat colour"] = "纯色", -- draft
	["Background Colour"] = "背景颜色", -- draft
	["The colour behind the health bar: one of yours, or the member's class colour."] = "生命条后面的颜色：你的一种颜色，或该成员的职业颜色。", -- draft
	["Class Colour"] = "职业颜色", -- draft
	["My Background Colour"] = "我的背景颜色", -- draft
	["The colour behind the health bar with My Colour."] = "选择“我的颜色”时生命条后面的颜色。", -- draft
	["How solid the background is."] = "背景有多实。", -- draft
	["Missing Health"] = "损失生命", -- draft
	["The part of the bar a member has lost, in a colour of its own: yours, their class colour, or by health."] = "成员损失的那部分条，用自己的颜色：你的、他的职业颜色，或按生命值。", -- draft
	["By Health"] = "按生命值", -- draft
	["My Missing Health Colour"] = "我的损失生命颜色", -- draft
	["The missing health's colour with My Colour."] = "选择“我的颜色”时损失生命的颜色。", -- draft
	["Missing Health Opacity"] = "损失生命不透明度", -- draft
	["How solid the missing health is."] = "损失生命部分有多实。", -- draft
	["Power Bar"] = "能量条", -- draft
	["Who shows a power bar (mana, rage, energy) under their health."] = "谁在生命条下方显示能量条（法力、怒气、能量）。", -- draft
	["Healers"] = "治疗者", -- draft
	["Everyone"] = "所有人", -- draft
	["Your Power Bar While Solo"] = "单人时你的能量条", -- draft
	["Your own power bar while you play solo, whatever your role."] = "单人游戏时你自己的能量条，无论你的职责是什么。", -- draft
	["Power Bar Height"] = "能量条高度", -- draft
	["How tall the power bar is."] = "能量条有多高。", -- draft
	["Power Colour"] = "能量颜色", -- draft
	["The power bar's colour: the power's own (blue mana, red rage, yellow energy), the member's class colour, or one of yours."] = "能量条的颜色：能量本身的颜色（蓝色法力、红色怒气、黄色能量）、该成员的职业颜色，或你的一种颜色。", -- draft
	["Power Type"] = "能量类型", -- draft
	["My Power Colour"] = "我的能量颜色", -- draft
	["The power bar's colour with My Colour."] = "选择“我的颜色”时能量条的颜色。", -- draft
	["Name Colour"] = "名字颜色", -- draft
	["The name's colour: white, the member's class colour, or one of yours."] = "名字的颜色：白色、该成员的职业颜色，或你的一种颜色。", -- draft
	["White"] = "白色", -- draft
	["My Name Colour"] = "我的名字颜色", -- draft
	["The name's colour with My Colour."] = "选择“我的颜色”时名字的颜色。", -- draft
	["Name Length"] = "名字长度", -- draft
	["The most letters of a name shown (0: the whole name)."] = "名字最多显示几个字（0：完整名字）。", -- draft
	["Health Text"] = "生命文字", -- draft
	["The health shown as text: its percent, the current health, or how much is missing."] = "以文字显示的生命：百分比、当前生命值，或缺少多少。", -- draft
	["Percent"] = "百分比", -- draft
	["Current"] = "当前", -- draft
	["Missing"] = "缺少", -- draft
	["Dead / Offline Text"] = "死亡 / 离线文字", -- draft
	["Dead, Ghost or Offline written on a member's frame."] = "在成员框体上写出死亡、灵魂或离线。", -- draft
	["The face of the names on your party and raid frames. Shared: the Interface text's face (Look > Fonts)."] = "你的小队和团队框体上名字的字体。共享：“界面文字”的字体（外观 > 字体）。", -- draft
	["Health Text Font"] = "生命文字字体", -- draft
	["The face of the health text on your party and raid frames, and of the Dead, Ghost and Offline words. Shared: the Interface text's face (Look > Fonts)."] = "你的小队和团队框体上生命文字的字体，以及死亡、灵魂和离线字样的字体。共享：“界面文字”的字体（外观 > 字体）。", -- draft
	["Indicator Numbers Font"] = "指示器数字字体", -- draft
	["The face of every indicator's time and stacks. Shared: the Chat & numbers face (Look > Fonts)."] = "每个指示器的时间和层数字体。共享：“聊天和数字”的字体（外观 > 字体）。", -- draft
	["Indicators On The Frames"] = "框体上的指示器", -- draft
	["Your aura indicators on the frames. Off: the frames show none."] = "框体上你的光环指示器。关闭：框体不显示任何指示器。", -- draft
	["Your Indicators"] = "你的指示器", -- draft
	["Your indicators for the spec you play, and the one you picked: its look, place, size, colour and text. Drag it on the frame above to move it."] = "你当前专精的指示器，以及你选中的那个：它的外观、位置、大小、颜色和文字。在上方框体上拖动它即可移动。", -- draft
	-- Map
	["Map"] = "地图", -- draft
	["One seamless map of the whole world: zoom from Azeroth down to a zone with the mouse wheel and drag to look around."] = "一张无缝的全世界地图：用鼠标滚轮从艾泽拉斯一直缩放到某个区域，拖动查看四周。", -- draft
	["The whole world on one sheet, from the continents down to a village."] = "整个世界在一张图上，从大陆到村庄。", -- draft
	["Open The Map"] = "打开地图", -- draft
	["Open MelloUI's map: the wheel zooms toward the cursor, a drag looks around, a click glides into the zone under the cursor and a right-click goes out again. Your map key (M) opens it, your quest log key (L) opens it with your quests beside it; /mellomap opens it too."] = "打开MelloUI的地图：滚轮朝光标缩放，拖动查看四周，点击滑入光标下的区域，右键再退出。你的地图键（M）打开它，任务日志键（L）打开它并在旁边显示你的任务；/mellomap也可以打开。", -- draft
	["Open"] = "打开", -- draft
	-- PersonalDisplay
	["Your health, power and cast bar under your character, as Legion's resource display had them, and a shield column beside your character: it fills when a shield goes up, drains as it takes the hits, turns amber when low and breaks when it is gone. The game's own Personal Resource Display is switched off while this is on, and comes back as you had it when it is off; Hide The Game's Cast Bar (on) hides the game's cast bar too, and Swing On The Rails (on) stands in for Swing Timers. This client cannot tell an addon where your character stands, so the display stays where you put it in Edit Layout (under your character to begin with) and hops when you jump."] = "你角色下方的生命、能量和施法条，就像军团再临的资源显示那样，以及角色旁的护盾栏：护盾出现时填满，随承受打击而耗减，低时变成琥珀色，消失时碎裂。开启时游戏自己的个人资源显示关闭，关闭时按你原来的设置回来；“隐藏游戏的施法条”（开启）也会隐藏游戏的施法条，“轨道上的挥击”（开启）会代替挥击计时条。这个客户端无法告诉插件你的角色站在哪里，所以显示停在你在“编辑布局”中放置的位置（起初在角色下方），你跳跃时它会跳一下。", -- draft
	["Health, power, casts and shields, right by your character."] = "生命、能量、施法和护盾，就在你的角色旁边。", -- draft
	["Shield Column"] = "护盾栏", -- draft
	["An upright bar beside your character for every shield on you added up, as the game counts them: spells (Power Word: Shield, Ice Barrier, Mana Shield, the wards), talents and items, the ones against one kind of damage too. Each shield is its own part, in its school's colour (Power Word: Shield gold, Ice Barrier frost, Mana Shield arcane, a Fire Protection Potion fire), stacked in the order they went up, its icon beside the column. It fills when one goes up, drains as it takes the hits, turns amber when low and breaks when the last one is gone; one ending while another holds only takes its part away. Edit Layout places it."] = "角色旁一根竖条，按游戏的计算方式累加你身上所有护盾：法术（真言术：盾、寒冰护体、法力护盾、各种防护结界）、天赋和物品，只防一种伤害的护盾也算。每个护盾是独立的一段，使用其学派颜色（真言术：盾金色、寒冰护体冰霜、法力护盾奥术、防护火焰药水火焰），按出现顺序叠放，图标在栏旁边。护盾出现时填满，随承受打击而耗减，低时变成琥珀色，最后一个消失时碎裂；一个结束而另一个还在时只去掉它那一段。在“编辑布局”中放置。", -- draft
	["Hide The Game's Cast Bar"] = "隐藏游戏的施法条", -- draft
	["The game's own cast bar is hidden while this is on: your casts show on the display's cast bar under your character. Off: both show."] = "开启时隐藏游戏自己的施法条：你的施法显示在角色下方显示的施法条上。关闭：两者都显示。", -- draft
	["Heal Light From Your Character"] = "治疗之光从角色出发", -- draft
	["With Heal Effects on (Frame Effects > Heals): the light of a heal you cast gathers at your character's middle instead of on the cast bar, and flies from there to the party or raid frame of the one you heal. It follows the display's place and the camera's zoom."] = "开启治疗效果时（框体效果 > 治疗）：你施放的治疗之光在角色身体中间汇聚，而不是在施法条上，然后从那里飞向你治疗对象的小队或团队框体。它跟随显示的位置和镜头缩放。", -- draft
	["Swing On The Rails"] = "轨道上的挥击", -- draft
	["Your swing timer without a bar of its own: in a fight, two sparks run out from the middle of the health bar's top rail to its ends, and your swing lands as they reach them. An off hand's swings run along the bottom of the power bar. Your shots run on the seam between the health and power bars: cream sparks out while you reload, then a red line grows back from the ends while you aim (stand still: moving holds it), and the shot flies as it meets in the middle. A wand's shots run out once, with no aim. While it is on, MelloUI's Swing Timers step aside and the game's own swing timers stay off."] = "没有独立条的挥击计时：战斗中，两颗火花从生命条上沿轨道的中间奔向两端，到达时你的挥击落下。副手挥击沿能量条底部奔跑。你的射击沿生命条和能量条之间的接缝奔跑：装填时奶油色火花向外跑，然后瞄准时一条红线从两端向回生长（站着别动：移动会拖住它），在中间会合时射击飞出。魔杖射击向外跑一次，不用瞄准。开启时MelloUI的挥击计时条让开，游戏自己的挥击计时条保持关闭。", -- draft
	["Big Cooldowns"] = "大冷却", -- draft
	["The buffs you give yourself on a cooldown -- Shield Wall, Shield Block, Last Stand, Evasion, Ice Block, Recklessness, a trinket's -- as icons above the health bar, their time sweeping round them and their seconds on them, the most important first: an immunity, then damage taken down, more health, block, evasion, the rest. From the game's own spell data, for every class."] = "你给自己施加的带冷却的增益——盾墙、盾牌格挡、破釜沉舟、闪避、寒冰屏障、鲁莽、饰品的——以图标显示在生命条上方，时间绕着它们转，秒数在上面，最重要的在前：免疫，然后减伤、更多生命、格挡、闪避、其他。取自游戏的法术数据，适用于所有职业。", -- draft
	["Percent And Spell Text"] = "百分比和法术文字", -- draft
	["Your health and power in percent beside their bars, the spell and its seconds on the cast bar, the shield's amount under its column, and what took your control under the bars."] = "条旁边以百分比显示生命和能量，施法条上显示法术和秒数，护盾栏下方显示护盾数值，条下方显示让你失控的效果。", -- draft
	["Text Font"] = "文字字体", -- draft
	["The face of the display's texts: the percents, the spell and its seconds, the shield's amount. Shared: the Interface text's face (Look > Fonts)."] = "个人显示中各项文字的字体：百分比、法术及其秒数、护盾数值。共享：“界面文字”的字体（外观 > 字体）。", -- draft
	["Class Colours"] = "职业颜色", -- draft
	["The health bar in your class's colour instead of green. With Low Health on it still turns ember under 35%."] = "生命条使用你的职业颜色而不是绿色。开启低生命值时，低于35%仍会变成余烬色。", -- draft
	["How wide the health, power and cast bars are. Edit Layout sizes the whole display."] = "生命条、能量条和施法条的宽度。“编辑布局”调整整个显示的大小。", -- draft
	["How tall the health bar is; the power and cast bars are a little thinner, in step with it. Their frames grow and shrink with them."] = "生命条的高度；能量条和施法条稍细，随之变化。它们的边框也随之缩放。", -- draft
	["Big Cooldown Size"] = "大冷却大小", -- draft
	["How big the Big Cooldowns' icons above the health bar are. Their seconds keep the display's text size."] = "生命条上方大冷却图标的大小。秒数保持显示的文字大小。", -- draft
	["Follow Camera Zoom"] = "跟随镜头缩放", -- draft
	["The display keeps its place by your character as you zoom the camera: closer under your feet when you zoom out, further down when you zoom in, so it never covers your character. Place it in Edit Layout at the zoom you play at; it follows from there. Turning the camera up or down is not followed (the game does not tell)."] = "缩放镜头时显示保持在角色旁：拉远时更靠近脚下，拉近时更往下，永远不遮住你的角色。在“编辑布局”中按你常用的缩放放置；之后会自动跟随。镜头上下转动不跟随（游戏不提供）。", -- draft
	["What a hit takes from your health stays lit a moment, then drains away."] = "一击从你生命中拿走的部分会亮一会儿，然后流走。", -- draft
	["Heal Lead"] = "治疗预显", -- draft
	["A heal lights the health it gives at once; the bar then grows into it."] = "治疗会立即点亮它给予的生命；然后条再长到那里。", -- draft
	["Heavy Hit"] = "重击", -- draft
	["A critical or crushing blow on you flashes the bars' rim red and dips them a hair, once."] = "你受到暴击或碾压时，条的边缘闪一次红光并下沉一点点。", -- draft
	["Power Spent"] = "消耗的能量", -- draft
	["The rage, energy or mana an ability costs stays lit a moment, then drains, so you see the cost."] = "技能消耗的怒气、能量或法力会亮一会儿再流走，让你看到消耗。", -- draft
	["Power Gained"] = "获得的能量", -- draft
	["New power lights ahead of the bar, which grows into it; a big gain sparks at its edge (energy's steady ticks do not)."] = "新获得的能量在条的前方亮起，条再长到那里；大量获得时在边缘迸出火花（能量的稳定恢复不会）。", -- draft
	["Dodge, Parry, Block"] = "躲闪、招架、格挡", -- draft
	["Your dodge, parry or block flicks its word off the health bar's end: your Revenge window, on the bars you watch."] = "你的躲闪、招架或格挡让字样从生命条末端弹出：你的复仇时机，就在你盯着的条上。", -- draft
	["Low Health"] = "低生命值", -- draft
	["Under 35% health the health bar turns ember."] = "生命值低于35%时生命条变成余烬色。", -- draft
	["Loss Of Control"] = "失控", -- draft
	["While you are stunned, feared, silenced or locked out of a school, the bars' rim turns red and a line under them runs down its time, its name under it. The game's own banner over your character is off while this is on, and comes back as you had it when it is off."] = "你被昏迷、恐惧、沉默或某个学派被锁定时，条的边缘变红，下方一条线倒数时间，名字在下面。开启时游戏在角色上方的横幅关闭，关闭时按你原来的设置回来。", -- draft
	["Combat Settle"] = "战斗归位", -- draft
	["Into a fight the bars rise into place; a moment after it they settle a little lower, until the next one. (To fade them out of combat: the Fader.)"] = "进入战斗时条升到位；战斗结束片刻后稍微下沉，直到下一场。（脱离战斗时淡出它们：用淡出功能。）", -- draft
	["Plays a made-up fight on the display: a shield going up, taking hits until it is low and breaks, a cast and a second shield, and the bars answering it -- the hits, a critical blow, power gained and spent, a dodge, a stun, low health and the heal after. Also /mello personal test."] = "在显示上播放一场虚构的战斗：一个护盾出现，承受打击直到变低并碎裂，一次施法和第二个护盾，以及条的回应——打击、一次暴击、获得和消耗的能量、一次躲闪、一次昏迷、低生命值和之后的治疗。也可用/mello personal test。", -- draft
	["a shield going up, hit, low and broken, casts, and the bars in the fight"] = "护盾出现、受击、变低并碎裂，施法，以及战斗中的条", -- draft
	-- QuestList
	["Quest List"] = "任务列表", -- draft
	["A page in the world map's quest log listing the quests of a zone, how many you have completed, and where each one is picked up."] = "世界地图任务日志中的一页，列出一个区域的任务、你完成了多少，以及每个任务在哪里接。", -- draft
	["Every quest of the zone in the map's quest log: who gives it, where, and what is left to do."] = "区域内每个任务都在地图的任务日志里：谁给的、在哪里、还剩什么要做。", -- draft
	["List"] = "列表", -- draft
	["Show Quests For"] = "显示任务范围", -- draft
	["Which quests the list shows. The dropdown at the top of the list switches this as well."] = "列表显示哪些任务。列表顶部的下拉菜单也可切换。", -- draft
	["All"] = "全部", -- draft
	["Current continent"] = "当前大陆", -- draft
	["Current zone"] = "当前区域", -- draft
	["Class quests"] = "职业任务", -- draft
	["Dungeons"] = "地下城", -- draft
	["Raids"] = "团队副本", -- draft
	["Attunements"] = "副本准入", -- draft
	["Events"] = "活动", -- draft
	["Hide Completed"] = "隐藏已完成", -- draft
	["Leave out quests you have already completed instead of greying them."] = "不显示已完成的任务，而不是把它们变灰。", -- draft
	["Show Hidden Quests"] = "显示隐藏的任务", -- draft
	["List the quests you hid (Alt-click a quest giver's mark on the map, or a quest in the list), dimmed, so you can Alt-click them back. Hidden quests stay off the map either way. Hiding is kept per character."] = "列出你隐藏的任务（在地图上Alt+点击任务给予者的标记，或在列表中Alt+点击任务），显示为暗淡，便于你Alt+点击恢复。隐藏的任务无论如何都不显示在地图上。隐藏按角色保存。", -- draft
	["Quests From A Quest Giver"] = "任务给予者的任务", -- draft
	["List quests picked up from a quest giver or an object (the \"!\"). The gear button on the list switches these as well; they apply to the map pins too."] = "列出从任务给予者或物体（“!”）处接的任务。列表上的齿轮按钮也可切换；这些也作用于地图标记。", -- draft
	["Quests From a Mob Drop"] = "怪物掉落的任务", -- draft
	["List quests that begin with an item dropped by creatures (crossed swords)."] = "列出以生物掉落的物品开始的任务（交叉剑）。", -- draft
	["Quests From an Item Picked Up"] = "拾取物品开始的任务", -- draft
	["List quests that begin with an item picked up from the ground or a chest (treasure chest)."] = "列出以从地上或箱子里拾取的物品开始的任务（宝箱）。", -- draft
	["Quests Starting Somewhere Unknown"] = "起点未知的任务", -- draft
	["List quests whose giver or starting item is not known yet."] = "列出给予者或起始物品尚不知道的任务。", -- draft
	["Show Other Faction's Quests"] = "显示另一阵营的任务", -- draft
	["Also list quests only the other faction can take."] = "也列出只有另一阵营能接的任务。", -- draft
	["Show Other Classes' Quests"] = "显示其他职业的任务", -- draft
	["Also list quests restricted to classes other than yours."] = "也列出限于其他职业的任务。", -- draft
	["Hide Quests More Than N Levels Above Me"] = "隐藏高出我N级以上的任务", -- draft
	["Leave out quests whose level is more than this many levels above your character. 0 shows everything."] = "不显示等级比你的角色高出超过这个数值的任务。0显示全部。", -- draft
	["Quest Givers On Zone Maps"] = "区域地图上的任务给予者", -- draft
	["Mark every known quest giver on the zone map with a ! or ? coloured by what you can do there. Hover for the quests, click to track the giver. The List tab's choices apply to the pins too: where quests start (for quests not taken yet), the other faction's and other classes' quests, the levels above yours, and Events (a holiday's givers show while the list shows Events or the quest is in your log)."] = "在区域地图上用!或?标出每个已知的任务给予者，颜色表示你在那里能做什么。悬停查看任务，点击追踪该给予者。“列表”标签的选项也作用于地图标记：任务从哪里开始（对尚未接的任务）、另一阵营和其他职业的任务、高出你的等级，以及活动（节日的任务给予者在列表显示活动或任务在你的日志中时显示）。", -- draft
	["Include Givers You Are Done With"] = "包括已完成的给予者", -- draft
	["Also mark givers whose quests you have all completed, with a grey tick."] = "也用灰色对勾标出你已完成其全部任务的给予者。", -- draft
	["Hide Grey Quests"] = "隐藏灰色任务", -- draft
	["Leave quests that are grey for you (far below your level, as the game colours them) off the zone map until you take them. Quests in your log and the one you track still show."] = "在你接下之前，不在区域地图上显示对你而言为灰色的任务（远低于你的等级，按游戏的着色）。日志中的任务和你追踪的任务仍会显示。", -- draft
	["Zone Progress On Continent Maps"] = "大陆地图上的区域进度", -- draft
	["Show a done/total badge on each zone of the continent map. Hover for the level range, click to open the zone."] = "在大陆地图的每个区域上显示已完成/总数徽章。悬停查看等级范围，点击打开该区域。", -- draft
	["Zone Progress On Zone Maps"] = "区域地图上的区域进度", -- draft
	["Show the zone's progress in the zone map's corner: a ring of the quests you have done, how many are left, and how many of those you can take now."] = "在区域地图角落显示该区域的进度：已完成任务的圆环、还剩多少，以及其中现在能接多少。", -- draft
	["Dungeon And Raid Entrances"] = "地下城和团队副本入口", -- draft
	["Mark instance entrances on the zone maps. Hover for the level range and your quest progress, click to list its quests. Entrances of new instances are learned the first time you walk in."] = "在区域地图上标出副本入口。悬停查看等级范围和你的任务进度，点击列出它的任务。新副本的入口在你第一次走进去时记录。", -- draft
	["Boats And Zeppelins"] = "船只和飞艇", -- draft
	["Mark the docks and zeppelin towers on the zone maps with the destination. Click to route there, Shift-click to open the destination's map."] = "在区域地图上标出码头和飞艇塔及其目的地。点击规划路线，Shift+点击打开目的地的地图。", -- draft
	["Objective Marks"] = "目标标记", -- draft
	["Mark on the zone map where the quests in your log are done: an outline round each objective's area with one mark for it (a sword to kill, a bag to collect, a cog to use, a flag to explore) and its progress, and the single places as small dots when you zoom in. Hover a mark for the quest, the objective and what drops it; click it for a waypoint. A done objective's marks go; a done quest shows only its hand-in ?."] = "在区域地图上标出日志中任务的完成地点：每个目标区域外围一圈轮廓并带一个标记（剑表示击杀，袋子表示收集，齿轮表示使用，旗帜表示探索）及其进度，放大时单独的地点显示为小点。悬停标记查看任务、目标以及谁会掉落；点击设置路径点。已完成目标的标记消失；已完成的任务只显示交任务的?。", -- draft
	["Only The Tracked Quests"] = "仅追踪的任务", -- draft
	["Mark only the quests you track, not every quest in your log."] = "只标出你追踪的任务，而不是日志中的每个任务。", -- draft
	["Hide The Game's Quest Areas"] = "隐藏游戏的任务区域", -- draft
	["While the objective marks are on, the game's own blue quest areas and quest markers on the world map are switched off, through the game's own Quest Objectives setting (the quest buttons in the game's quest tracker go with it). Turning this or the marks off gives the game's setting back as you had it."] = "目标标记开启时，通过游戏自己的“任务目标”设置关闭世界地图上游戏的蓝色任务区域和任务标记（游戏任务追踪器中的任务按钮也随之消失）。关闭此项或标记时，游戏的设置按你原来的样子恢复。", -- draft
	["On The Minimap"] = "在小地图上", -- draft
	["The same marks on the minimap for the objectives near you, and a small mark on its edge with an arrow for the nearest ones just beyond it. Drawn with Route's minimap drawing, so Route has to be on."] = "小地图上为附近目标显示同样的标记，对刚好在范围外的最近目标在边缘显示一个带箭头的小标记。使用路线的小地图绘制，所以路线必须开启。", -- draft
	["Quest Check When Entering An Instance"] = "进入副本时检查任务", -- draft
	["When you enter a dungeon or raid, list in chat the quests for it you could have picked up but have not."] = "进入地下城或团队副本时，在聊天中列出你本可以接但没接的该副本任务。", -- draft
	["Quest Progress On Items"] = "物品上的任务进度", -- draft
	["On the tooltip of an item one of your quests asks for, name the quest and how many you have, for example \"Quest: Red Linen Goods (4/6)\"."] = "在你某个任务需要的物品的鼠标提示上，写出任务名和你拥有的数量，例如“任务：Red Linen Goods (4/6)”。", -- draft
	["Turn-In NPCs"] = "交任务NPC", -- draft
	["On the tooltip of an NPC that takes back one of your quests: \"Turn in here\" once the quest is ready, a quieter \"Quest ends here\" while it is still in progress."] = "在接收你某个任务的NPC的鼠标提示上：任务就绪时显示“在此交任务”，仍在进行中时显示较低调的“任务在此结束”。", -- draft
	["Your Other Characters On Quests"] = "任务上的你的其他角色", -- draft
	["On a quest's tooltip in the Quest List, name your other characters who have done the quest or have it in their quest log. A character is noted each time it logs out; /mello alts lists them and forgets a deleted one."] = "在任务列表中任务的鼠标提示上，列出已完成该任务或日志中有该任务的其他角色。角色每次登出时记录；/mello alts列出它们并忘记已删除的角色。", -- draft
	-- Route
	["Route"] = "路线", -- draft
	["Draws the way to your map waypoint on the world map and the minimap, along roads you have walked before."] = "在世界地图和小地图上沿你走过的道路画出通往地图路径点的路线。", -- draft
	["A trail of gems from here to there, along the roads you have walked before."] = "一串宝石从这里通到那里，沿着你走过的路。", -- draft
	["Drawing"] = "绘制", -- draft
	["Route On The World Map"] = "世界地图上的路线", -- draft
	["Draw the route to the waypoint on the world map, and its destination as a flag in a gold ring. A stretch where no road is known is a paler, straight guess."] = "在世界地图上画出通往路径点的路线，目的地显示为金环中的旗帜。没有已知道路的一段显示为较淡的直线估计。", -- draft
	["Route On The Minimap"] = "小地图上的路线", -- draft
	["Draw the nearby part of the route on the minimap."] = "在小地图上画出路线的附近部分。", -- draft
	["Trail Look"] = "路线外观", -- draft
	["How the route is drawn on the world map and the minimap: red beads in gold rings, one pale gold line, or short pale gold dashes. The destination is a flag in a gold ring either way."] = "路线在世界地图和小地图上的画法：金环中的红色珠子、一条淡金线，或淡金色短虚线。目的地无论如何都是金环中的旗帜。", -- draft
	["Red Beads"] = "红色珠子", -- draft
	["Gilded Line"] = "镀金线", -- draft
	["Waymarks"] = "路标", -- draft
	["Trail Size"] = "路线大小", -- draft
	["How big the route's beads, line or dashes are on the world map and the minimap."] = "世界地图和小地图上路线珠子、线或虚线的大小。", -- draft
	["Route To The Tracked Quest"] = "前往追踪任务的路线", -- draft
	["When no map pin is set, route to the quest you are tracking (the one with the arrow): to the nearest place for an objective you have not finished yet (a creature to kill, an object to use, where the item drops or is sold, a place to explore), and to its turn-in once it is complete. An objective that needs an item in your bags first (remains to bury, a key for a cage) is routed to where that item comes from until you have it."] = "没有设置地图标记时，规划前往你追踪的任务（带箭头的那个）的路线：前往尚未完成的目标的最近地点（要击杀的生物、要使用的物体、物品掉落或出售的地方、要探索的地点），完成后前往交任务处。需要先在背包中有某件物品的目标（要埋葬的遗骸、笼子的钥匙），在你拿到之前路线指向那件物品的来源。", -- draft
	["Fall Back To The First Tracked Quest"] = "退而使用第一个追踪任务", -- draft
	["When nothing is super-tracked, follow the first quest on the game's watch list instead of showing nothing. That is the game's own order of the quests you watch, not the Quest Tracker's Nearest Quest First order."] = "没有超级追踪时，跟随游戏追踪列表中的第一个任务，而不是什么都不显示。这是游戏自己对你追踪任务的顺序，不是任务追踪器“最近的任务在前”的顺序。", -- draft
	["Distance Under The Minimap"] = "小地图下方的距离", -- draft
	["Show the remaining route length and the destination under the minimap, with or without Route On The Minimap (hidden while the World Marker shows them)."] = "在小地图下方显示剩余路线长度和目的地，开不开小地图上的路线都可以（世界标记显示它们时隐藏）。", -- draft
	["Travel Time"] = "旅行时间", -- draft
	["About how long the rest of the way takes, beside the distance on the World Marker, from how fast you are moving (on foot or mounted). The tracking notice says it too, and arriving says how long the way took."] = "根据你的移动速度（步行或骑乘），在世界标记的距离旁显示剩余路程大约需要多久。追踪通知也会说，到达时会说这段路花了多久。", -- draft
	["A small flag mark over the destination itself, with the distance and the travel time, that stays on it as you move the camera. Far away it is a beacon, smaller the farther the place, faint while it stands in the middle of the screen; within 100 yards it rises above the place, the distance and the name over it and a gold chevron pointing down to it, so it never covers what you are looking for. Inside a quest's objective area it hides, and comes back when you leave. When the place is off screen, an arrow beside your character points the way to turn. Takes the place of the game's own destination marker while it is on."] = "目的地本身上方的一个小旗帜标记，带距离和旅行时间，移动镜头时仍停在那里。远处是一个信标，越远越小，位于屏幕中央时变淡；100码以内时它升到地点上方，距离和名字在上，一个金色V形指向下方，永远不遮住你要找的东西。在任务目标区域内它会隐藏，离开时回来。地点在屏幕外时，角色旁的箭头指示该转向哪边。开启时取代游戏自己的目的地标记。", -- draft
	["Light Beam"] = "光柱", -- draft
	["A slim beam of light rising from the destination, so the place can be seen from far away, with a small glow on the ground at its foot, red with Red Beads and gold with the other Trail Looks. It fades as you come near and is gone once the marker rises above the place, and hides while the place is off screen. Part of the World Marker."] = "从目的地升起的一道细光柱，远处也能看到该地点，柱脚地面有一小片光晕，红色珠子时为红色，其他路线外观时为金色。靠近时淡出，标记升到地点上方时消失，地点在屏幕外时隐藏。世界标记的一部分。", -- draft
	["Wisp"] = "小精灵", -- draft
	["When the World Marker comes up for a new destination, a small light flies from your character to the place and lights it: the beam rises and the mark pops in as it lands. It follows the place as you turn the camera; while the place is off the screen it settles into the arrow beside your character. Firefly: a bright point with a short streak. Embers: a smaller glow shedding sparks. Not with Reduce Motion. Part of the World Marker."] = "世界标记为新目的地出现时，一点小光从你的角色飞到该地点并点亮它：光柱升起，标记在它落下时出现。转动镜头时它跟随地点；地点在屏幕外时它停在角色旁的箭头里。萤火虫：一个亮点带一小段拖尾。余烬：较小的光晕洒落火花。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。世界标记的一部分。", -- draft
	["Firefly"] = "萤火虫", -- draft
	["Embers"] = "余烬", -- draft
	["Route Draws In"] = "路线绘入", -- draft
	["A new route grows from you to the destination in about a second instead of appearing whole, on the world map and the minimap at once: the beads pop in one after another, the line and the dashes are drawn with a small light at their head, and the destination's flag pops in as the trail reaches it. A re-plan of the same route (you strayed off it) swaps at once. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "新路线用约一秒从你延伸到目的地，而不是整条直接出现，世界地图和小地图同时：珠子一颗颗出现，线和虚线由头部一点小光画出，路线到达时目的地的旗帜出现。同一路线的重新规划（你偏离了路线）立即切换。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	["Arrival Light"] = "到达之光", -- draft
	["As you arrive, the place is put out: the World Marker's mark sinks onto it in a ring of light with a few sparks. Not with Reduce Motion."] = "你到达时，地点熄灭：世界标记的标记在一圈光和几点火花中沉落在上面。“减少动态效果”开启时不会。", -- draft
	["Marker Sounds"] = "标记音效", -- draft
	["A soft breath of air as the World Marker changes: when it comes up for a new destination, as it rises above the place you are near, and as it turns back into the beacon when you walk away. For a new destination it is the one sound: the tracking notice leaves its chime out then. Plays on the Sound Effects channel. Part of the World Marker."] = "世界标记变化时的一声轻柔气息：为新目的地出现时，升到你附近地点的上方时，以及你走开它变回信标时。对新目的地来说这是唯一的音效：此时追踪通知不再响铃。在声音效果频道播放。世界标记的一部分。", -- draft
	["Arrival"] = "到达", -- draft
	["Arrived Within (yards)"] = "到达范围（码）", -- draft
	["The route ends and the waypoint is cleared when you get this close. Not for the route to a tracked quest: that one moves on with the quest."] = "离得这么近时路线结束并清除路径点。前往追踪任务的路线除外：它会随任务继续前进。", -- draft
	["Flights"] = "飞行", -- draft
	["Flight Map Help"] = "飞行地图帮助", -- draft
	["At a flight master: where your route flies to, on the flight map's title band, with a bead of your trail on that flight point. Pointing at a flight point also shows about how long the flight takes."] = "在飞行管理员处：在飞行地图的标题横带上显示你的路线飞往哪里，并在那个飞行点上放一颗路线珠子。指向飞行点时也显示飞行大约需要多久。", -- draft
	["Learning"] = "学习", -- draft
	["Learn Paths While Playing"] = "游戏中学习路径", -- draft
	["Remember where you walk and fly so routes can follow real roads. What it learns is saved and kept from one session to the next. /route shows how much has been learned."] = "记住你走过和飞过的地方，让路线沿真实的道路走。学到的内容会保存，跨游戏会话保留。/route显示已学了多少。", -- draft
	-- VoiceOver
	["Voice Over"] = "Voice Over", -- draft
	["Read NPC dialog and quest text aloud with the built in text-to-speech voices, picked by the NPC's race and gender."] = "用内置的文字转语音声音朗读NPC对话和任务文本，按NPC的种族和性别选择。", -- draft
	["Every quest giver speaks. Recorded voices with the pack, text-to-speech without it."] = "每个任务给予者都会说话。有语音包时用录制语音，没有时用文字转语音。", -- draft
	["Read Aloud"] = "朗读", -- draft
	["NPC Greetings"] = "NPC问候", -- draft
	["The text an NPC greets you with when you talk to them."] = "你与NPC交谈时它问候你的文字。", -- draft
	["Quest Offers"] = "任务提供", -- draft
	["The quest description when a quest is offered."] = "任务提供时的任务描述。", -- draft
	["Quest Objectives"] = "任务目标", -- draft
