	["Sound Packs"] = "音效包", -- draft
	["Use Voice Packs"] = "使用语音包", -- draft
	["Play the recorded lines of the voice pack, MelloUI_VoicePack (a separate download in two parts that replaces the old pack), when it has one for the quest, greeting or page; the rest is read with text-to-speech unless Read Unvoiced Lines is off. Tick the pack in the addon list; it loads when needed."] = "当语音包MelloUI_VoicePack（分两部分单独下载，取代旧包）有该任务、问候或页面的录音时播放；其余用文字转语音朗读，除非关闭“朗读无配音的台词”。在插件列表中勾选该语音包；需要时才载入。", -- draft
	["Read Unvoiced Lines"] = "朗读无配音的台词", -- draft
	["Read a quest or greeting the voice pack has no recording of with a text-to-speech voice. Off: only recorded lines are heard and the rest stay silent."] = "语音包没有录音的任务或问候用文字转语音的声音朗读。关闭：只能听到录制的台词，其余保持安静。", -- draft
	["Prefer Recordings"] = "优先使用录音", -- draft
	["When an NPC's greeting text was changed but the pack has exactly one recorded greeting for that NPC, play the recording anyway instead of reading the new text aloud. The words will not match what is on screen."] = "当某个NPC的问候文字改变了，但语音包里恰好有该NPC的一条录制问候时，仍然播放录音而不是朗读新文字。说的话会和屏幕上的不一致。", -- draft
	["Channel the recorded lines play on; its volume slider in the game's sound settings controls them."] = "录制台词播放所用的频道；游戏声音设置中该频道的音量滑块控制它们。", -- draft
	["Ambience"] = "环境音", -- draft
	["Record Dialog Lines"] = "记录对话台词", -- draft
	["For making new voice lines: keep the greetings and quest lines Voice Over picks up (read aloud or left silent), with the NPC and whether a recording existed, so the lines this client added or changed can be voiced for the pack. Lines of a kind switched off, repeats and greetings passed over behind a quest line are not kept. Saved and kept from one session to the next. Off by default."] = "用于制作新的语音台词：保存Voice Over捕获的问候和任务台词（朗读的或保持安静的），连同NPC以及是否已有录音，让这个客户端新增或修改的台词可以为语音包配音。已关闭类型的台词、重复内容以及在任务台词后被跳过的问候不会保存。跨游戏会话保存。默认关闭。", -- draft
	["Playback"] = "播放", -- draft
	["Queue Lines"] = "台词排队", -- draft
	["Read lines one after another: a greeting finishes before the quest offer that follows it. Off makes every new dialog interrupt the previous one."] = "一行接一行地朗读：问候读完后才读接下来的任务提供。关闭时每个新对话都会打断上一个。", -- draft
	["Stop When Window Closes"] = "关闭窗口时停止", -- draft
	["Cut the speech off when you close the dialog. Off by default so the NPC keeps talking while you walk away."] = "关闭对话时切断语音。默认关闭，这样你走开时NPC还会继续说。", -- draft
	["Read Button In The Quest Log"] = "任务日志中的朗读按钮", -- draft
	["A Read button on the quest log's details view: the quest's description in the giver's voice (the recorded offer line when a pack has it), then the recorded objectives when the voice pack has them (Quest Objectives). Also /vo read."] = "任务日志详情中的一个朗读按钮：用给予者的声音朗读任务描述（语音包有录制的提供台词时用它），然后在语音包有录音时朗读任务目标（任务目标）。也可用/vo read。", -- draft
	["Stop When Target Changes"] = "更换目标时停止", -- draft
	["Cut the speech off when you change target."] = "更换目标时切断语音。", -- draft
	["Show The Widget"] = "显示小部件", -- draft
	["Show the speaker in MelloUI's widget column while a line is read: their face, the line, a gold ring that fills as it plays and the lines waiting. Hover it for Pause, Skip, Lines and the padlock; right-click stops. Move and size the column in Edit Layout; /vo reset puts it back."] = "朗读时在MelloUI的小部件栏中显示说话者：他的脸、这句台词、随播放填充的金环以及等待中的台词。悬停可暂停、跳过、查看台词和锁；右键停止。在“编辑布局”中移动和调整栏的大小；/vo reset把它放回原处。", -- draft
	["3D Portrait"] = "3D头像", -- draft
	["The speaker's animated 3D face in the widget. Off: the book."] = "小部件中说话者的3D动态脸部。关闭：显示书本。", -- draft
	["Subtitles"] = "字幕", -- draft
	["Also show the text being read under the line, page by page as the voice goes on."] = "同时在台词下方显示正在朗读的文字，随语音逐页推进。", -- draft
	["Compact In Combat"] = "战斗中精简", -- draft
	["In a fight the widget shrinks to the speaker's face and its ring, and the reading goes on (a book too). The name and the line come back when the fight is over."] = "战斗中小部件缩小为说话者的脸和圆环，朗读继续（书本也是）。战斗结束后名字和台词回来。", -- draft
