	-- Core/Config.lua
	["Module based interface tweaks for World of Warcraft: Forever."] = "为《魔兽世界：Forever》打造的模块化界面调整。", -- draft
	["Your whole setup under one name. Save it, load it, or make it the default for a fresh install."] = "你的整套设置归在一个名字下。保存、载入，或设为新安装的默认设置。", -- draft
	["Languages: the configurator and the installer in German, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Chinese and Korean. Pick one at the left of the top line."] = "语言：配置器和安装器提供德语、法语、西班牙语、葡萄牙语、俄语、中文和韩语。在顶部一行的左侧选择。", -- draft
	["A line not translated yet shows in English. Corrections are welcome on MelloUI's CurseForge translation page."] = "尚未翻译的行显示为英文。欢迎在MelloUI的CurseForge翻译页面上提交更正。", -- draft
	["MelloUI's windows show Cyrillic, Chinese and Korean names in the game's letters instead of boxes; buttons grow to fit a longer label."] = "MelloUI的窗口用游戏的字形显示西里尔文、中文和韩文名字，而不是方块；按钮会变宽以容纳更长的标签。", -- draft
	["A seamless world map of MelloUI's own (M): zoom from Azeroth to a village, ground and caves up close; your party, Route, flights, dungeons, quests and objectives on it."] = "MelloUI自己的无缝世界地图（M）：从艾泽拉斯一直缩放到村庄，近看地面和洞穴；你的队伍、路线、航线、地下城、任务和目标都在上面。", -- draft
	["Map: your quest log and the Quest List beside it (L), search, a pin to share in chat, layer switches; Questie, HandyNotes and GatherMate2 pins on it too."] = "地图：任务日志和旁边的任务列表（L）、搜索、可在聊天中分享的标记、图层开关；Questie、HandyNotes和GatherMate2的标记也会显示。", -- draft
	["One look: its own look, Gilded Slate colours, the Fredoka font and a new logo, reskin or not; the installer sets up the new layout. The painted reskin is MelloUI Oldschool."] = "统一外观：自己的样式、Gilded Slate配色、Fredoka字体和新标志，换肤与否均可；安装器会设置新布局。手绘换肤即MelloUI Oldschool。", -- draft
	["Configurator: Unit & Group Frames, Nameplates, Bars and Minimap are designers: pick a frame, then a part, drag names and values; a new Automation page."] = "配置器：单位和小队框体、姓名板、动作条和小地图都变成设计器：选一个框体，再选一个部分，拖动名字和数值；新增自动化页面。", -- draft
	["A new icon set, sharp at every size, map pins glowing and marks shaded; MelloUI Frames on buttons, XP bars and unit frames; Heal Flight and Frame Effects in soft light."] = "一套新图标，任何尺寸都清晰，地图标记发光，标记带阴影；按钮、经验条和单位框体使用MelloUI框体；治疗效果和框体效果以柔光呈现。", -- draft
	["Frames and bars: party levels on the name line, soft name bands, a round-rim swing timer, a slim race bar, a gold flash as cooldowns end, one Health Colour for all."] = "框体和条：小队等级在名字行，柔和的名字横带，圆边挥击计时，纤细的竞速条，冷却结束时一道金光，所有地方共用一种生命颜色。", -- draft
	["Action bars and minimap: backdrops and MelloUI's square minimap for everyone, no painted skin needed; the round painted map is Oldschool's."] = "动作条和小地图：所有人都能用底板和MelloUI的方形小地图，无需手绘皮肤；圆形手绘地图属于Oldschool。", -- draft
	["Quests: the Quest Tracker in the chat's look with the game's clicks, round marks, one gem per title, short Quest List and map tips; Parchment is its own switch."] = "任务：任务追踪器采用聊天的外观和游戏的点击方式，圆形标记，每个标题一颗宝石，简短的任务列表和地图提示；羊皮纸有独立开关。", -- draft
	["Route: shorter ways over open ground, out of rough hills and capitals' cliffs, never turned round mid-walk; the World Marker shows the way and follows RestedXP Guides."] = "路线：开阔地上走更短的路，避开崎岖丘陵和主城的悬崖，途中绝不掉头；世界标记指示方向并跟随RestedXP指南。", -- draft
	["Nameplates and Personal Display answer the fight: lit chunks on hits, flashing crits, cast warnings; dodges and stuns on your bars. Combat Text has a Beside look."] = "姓名板和个人显示回应战斗：命中时亮起的伤害块、闪烁的暴击、施法警告；躲闪和昏迷显示在你的条上。战斗文字新增“侧边”样式。", -- draft
	["Tooltips colour guilds, factions, levels and quest objectives. Macro Backup is gone: the game keeps your settings."] = "鼠标提示为公会、阵营、等级和任务目标着色。宏备份已移除：游戏会保存你的设置。", -- draft
	["Edit Layout, bags and groups: more windows move without the reskin; quality gems and junk on every slot; party and raid frames keep their own places and indicators."] = "编辑布局、背包和队伍：不换肤也能移动更多窗口；每个栏位都有品质宝石和垃圾标记；小队和团队框体保留各自的位置和指示器。", -- draft
	["Chat View: the chat and the whisper window keep their history over a /reload and a new login."] = "聊天视图：聊天和悄悄话窗口在/reload和重新登录后保留历史记录。", -- draft
	["Chat: Chat View (Minimal) -- one dark panel, round tabs on a rail, each line under its sender, channel and time; a row of round buttons below."] = "聊天：聊天视图（极简）——一个深色面板，轨道上的圆形标签，每行在发送者、频道和时间下方；下面一排圆形按钮。", -- draft
	["Chat View: one whisper window grows up out of the chat -- every conversation, theirs left and yours right; the Whispers tab counts new ones."] = "聊天视图：一个悄悄话窗口从聊天中升起——所有对话，对方在左，你在右；悄悄话标签计数新消息。", -- draft
	["Chat View: Background Parchment puts the chat and the whisper window on the parchment sheet in dark ink."] = "聊天视图：背景“羊皮纸”把聊天和悄悄话窗口铺到羊皮纸上，使用深色墨水。", -- draft
	["Chat View: right-click a tab for the game's window menu -- rename, a new window with the channels you pick, close, font size."] = "聊天视图：右键标签打开游戏的窗口菜单——重命名、用所选频道新建窗口、关闭、字体大小。", -- draft
	["Chat View: your /join channels get their own tabs; drag tabs to reorder; the chat and whisper window scroll smoothly."] = "聊天视图：你/join的频道有各自的标签；拖动标签可重新排序；聊天和悄悄话窗口平滑滚动。", -- draft
	["Round borders are sharp at small sizes: the Services buttons' and Round Border styles' rings are solid, not dotted."] = "圆形边框在小尺寸下清晰：服务按钮和圆形边框样式的圆环是实心的，不再是点状。", -- draft
	["Unit Frames: XP Gain -- the stretch of the experience bar you just gained lights up as a light runs along it."] = "单位框体：获得经验——经验条上刚获得的那一段在一道光划过时亮起。", -- draft
	["Bags by Kind: Items Glide -- items glide to their new slots when the window sorts again; new ones fade in."] = "背包分类：物品滑动——窗口重新排序时物品滑到新栏位；新物品淡入。", -- draft
	["Bags by Kind: Rolling Money -- the bag window's money rolls to its new sum; coins you loot fly into it."] = "背包分类：滚动金钱——背包窗口的金钱滚动到新数额；你拾取的钱币飞进去。", -- draft
	["Bags by Kind: Bags Full Warning -- with your bags full, Empty shows a 0 slot that shakes and flashes red as the game says so."] = "背包分类：背包已满警告——背包满时，“空”显示一个为0的栏位，在游戏提示时晃动并闪红。", -- draft
	["Services: Trays Slide Out -- a group's list slides out from the minimap column like a drawer, and back in."] = "服务：托盘滑出——分组的列表像抽屉一样从小地图栏滑出，再滑回去。", -- draft
